# Japanese translations of the docstrings of rs-editor.
# msgctxt is "function:NAME" or "variable:NAME"; msgid is the English docstring.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: ja\n"

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:make-abbrev-table"
msgid ""
"Create a new, empty abbrev table.\n"
"An abbrev table is called with an operation (get, put, clear or names) and its arguments."
msgstr ""
"空の略語の表を作る.\n"
"略語の表は, 操作 (get, put, clear, names) とその引数を付けて呼ぶ."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:clear-abbrev-table"
msgid "Undefine all abbrevs in abbrev table TABLE, leaving TABLE empty."
msgstr "略語の表 TABLE の略語を全て取り消して, 空にする."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:global-abbrev-table"
msgid "The abbrev table whose abbrevs affect all buffers."
msgstr "全てのバッファに効く略語の表."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:local-abbrev-table"
msgid "Local (mode-specific) abbrev table."
msgstr "ローカル (モードごと) の略語の表."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:only-global-abbrevs"
msgid ""
"Non-nil means user plans to use global abbrevs only.\n"
"This makes the commands that normally define mode-specific abbrevs define global abbrevs instead."
msgstr ""
"非 nil なら, グローバルな略語だけを使うつもりであることを表す.\n"
"モードごとの略語を定義するコマンドが, 代わりにグローバルな略語を定義する."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:abbrev-all-caps"
msgid "Non-nil means expand multi-word abbrevs in all caps if the abbrev was so."
msgstr "非 nil なら, 略語が大文字だったとき, 複数の語の展開も全て大文字にする."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:abbrev-start-location"
msgid ""
"Buffer position for `expand-abbrev' to use as the start of the abbrev.\n"
"When nil, use the word before point as the abbrev.\n"
"Calling `expand-abbrev' sets this to nil."
msgstr ""
"`expand-abbrev' が略語の始まりに使うバッファの位置.\n"
"nil なら, ポイントの前の単語を略語にする.\n"
"`expand-abbrev' を呼ぶと nil になる."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-abbrev"
msgid "The abbrev of the last abbrev expanded."
msgstr "最後に展開した略語."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-abbrev-text"
msgid "The exact text of the last abbrev that was expanded."
msgstr "最後に展開した略語の, 打った文字列そのもの."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-abbrev-location"
msgid "The location of the start of the last abbrev that was expanded."
msgstr "最後に展開した略語の始まりの位置."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--active-tables"
msgid "Return the abbrev tables to look in: TABLE only, or the local and the global table."
msgstr "探す略語の表を返す. TABLE があればそれだけ, 無ければローカルとグローバルの表."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--entry"
msgid "Return the entry of ABBREV in TABLE (name expansion hook count), folding case, or #f if it has no expansion."
msgstr "TABLE の中の ABBREV の項目 (名前 展開 フック 回数) を, 大文字と小文字を区別せずに返す. 展開が無ければ偽."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--symbol"
msgid "Return the entry of ABBREV in the TABLE (or the active tables), or #f."
msgstr "表 TABLE (無ければ今有効な表) の中の ABBREV の項目を返す. 無ければ偽."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev-expansion"
msgid ""
"Return the string that ABBREV expands into in the current buffer.\n"
"Optionally specify an abbrev TABLE as second arg; then ABBREV is looked up in that table only."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファで ABBREV が展開される文字列を返す.\n"
"2 番目の引数で略語の表 TABLE を選ぶと, その表だけから探す."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:define-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Define ABBREV in TABLE, to expand into EXPANSION and optionally call HOOK.\n"
"ABBREV must be a string, and should be lower-case.\n"
"To undefine an abbrev, define it with EXPANSION = nil.\n"
"If HOOK is non-nil, it should be a function of no arguments;\n"
"it is called after EXPANSION is inserted."
msgstr ""
"TABLE に, EXPANSION に展開され, HOOK を呼ぶこともある略語 ABBREV を定義する.\n"
"ABBREV は文字列で, 小文字がよい.\n"
"略語を取り消すには, EXPANSION を nil にして定義する.\n"
"HOOK があれば, 引数の無い関数で, EXPANSION を挿入した後に呼ぶ."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--add"
msgid "Define an abbrev in TABLE whose expansion is ARG words before point; read the abbrev from the minibuffer."
msgstr "ポイントの前の ARG 語を展開とする略語を TABLE に定義する. 略語はミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:add-mode-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Define a mode-specific abbrev whose expansion is the last word before point.\n"
"If there's an active region, use that as the expansion.\n"
"\n"
"Prefix argument ARG says how many words before point to use for the expansion;\n"
"zero means the entire region is the expansion.\n"
"\n"
"A negative ARG means to undefine the specified abbrev.\n"
"\n"
"This command reads the abbreviation from the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前の単語を展開とする, モードごとの略語を定義する.\n"
"リージョンが有効なら, それを展開とする.\n"
"\n"
"前置引数 ARG は, ポイントの前の何語を展開とするか. 0 なら, リージョン全体が展開になる.\n"
"\n"
"ARG が負なら, 指定した略語を取り消す.\n"
"\n"
"このコマンドは, 略語をミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:add-global-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Define a global (all modes) abbrev whose expansion is last word before point.\n"
"If there's an active region, use that as the expansion.\n"
"\n"
"Prefix argument ARG says how many words before point to use for the expansion;\n"
"zero means the entire region is the expansion.\n"
"\n"
"A negative ARG means to undefine the specified abbrev.\n"
"\n"
"This command reads the abbreviation from the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前の単語を展開とする, グローバル (全てのモード) の略語を定義する.\n"
"リージョンが有効なら, それを展開とする.\n"
"\n"
"前置引数 ARG は, ポイントの前の何語を展開とするか. 0 なら, リージョン全体が展開になる.\n"
"\n"
"ARG が負なら, 指定した略語を取り消す.\n"
"\n"
"このコマンドは, 略語をミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--inverse-add"
msgid "Define the Nth word before point as an abbrev in TABLE, reading the expansion, and expand it."
msgstr "ポイントの前の N 番目の単語を略語として TABLE に定義し, 展開をミニバッファで読んで, 展開する."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:inverse-add-mode-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Define the word before point as a mode-specific abbreviation.\n"
"With prefix argument N, define the Nth word before point as the\n"
"abbreviation.  Negative N means use the Nth word after point.\n"
"\n"
"If `only-global-abbrevs' is non-nil, this command defines a\n"
"global (mode-independent) abbrev instead of a mode-specific one.\n"
"\n"
"This command reads the expansion from the minibuffer, defines the\n"
"abbrev, and then expands the abbreviation in the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前の単語を, モードごとの略語として定義する.\n"
"前置引数 N があれば, ポイントの前の N 番目の単語を略語にする.\n"
"N が負なら, ポイントの後の N 番目の単語を使う.\n"
"\n"
"`only-global-abbrevs' が非 nil なら, モードごとではなく,\n"
"グローバル (モードによらない) 略語を定義する.\n"
"\n"
"このコマンドは, 展開をミニバッファで読み, 略語を定義して,\n"
"今のバッファの略語を展開する."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:inverse-add-global-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Define the word before point as a global (mode-independent) abbreviation.\n"
"With prefix argument N, define the Nth word before point as the\n"
"abbreviation.  Negative N means use the Nth word after point.\n"
"\n"
"This command reads the expansion from the minibuffer, defines the\n"
"abbrev, and then expands the abbreviation in the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前の単語を, グローバル (モードによらない) 略語として定義する.\n"
"前置引数 N があれば, ポイントの前の N 番目の単語を略語にする.\n"
"N が負なら, ポイントの後の N 番目の単語を使う.\n"
"\n"
"このコマンドは, 展開をミニバッファで読み, 略語を定義して,\n"
"今のバッファの略語を展開する."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev-prefix-mark"
msgid ""
"Mark point as the beginning of an abbreviation.\n"
"The abbrev to be expanded starts at point rather than at the\n"
"beginning of a word.  This way, you can expand an abbrev with\n"
"a prefix: insert the prefix, use this command, then insert the\n"
"abbrev.\n"
"\n"
"This command inserts a hyphen after the prefix, and if the abbrev\n"
"is subsequently expanded, this hyphen will be removed.\n"
"\n"
"If the prefix is itself an abbrev, this command expands it,\n"
"unless ARG is non-nil.  Interactively, ARG is the prefix\n"
"argument."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを略語の始まりとして印を付ける.\n"
"展開する略語は, 単語の始めではなくポイントから始まる.\n"
"こうすると, 接頭辞を付けて略語を展開できる:\n"
"接頭辞を挿入し, このコマンドを使ってから, 略語を挿入する.\n"
"\n"
"このコマンドは, 接頭辞の後にハイフンを挿入する.\n"
"後で略語を展開すると, このハイフンは消える.\n"
"\n"
"接頭辞自身が略語なら, このコマンドはそれを展開する.\n"
"ただし ARG が非 nil なら展開しない. 対話では, ARG は前置引数."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--before-point"
msgid "Try and find an abbrev before point.  Return (ENTRY NAME START END) if found, #f otherwise."
msgstr "ポイントの前の略語を探す. 見つかれば (項目 名前 始め 終わり) を, 無ければ偽を返す."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--insert"
msgid ""
"Replace the text from WORDSTART to WORDEND with the expansion of ENTRY (found as NAME).\n"
"Return #t."
msgstr ""
"WORDSTART から WORDEND までの文字を, ENTRY の展開に置き換える (NAME で見つけた).\n"
"展開したら #t を返す."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:abbrev--expand"
msgid "Expand the abbrev before point, if there is an abbrev there.  Return #t if one was expanded."
msgstr "ポイントの前に略語があれば展開する. 展開したら #t を返す."

#: lisp/abbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:expand-abbrev"
msgid ""
"Expand the abbrev before point, if there is an abbrev there.\n"
"Effective when explicitly called even when `abbrev-mode' is nil."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前に略語があれば展開する.\n"
"`abbrev-mode' が nil でも, 明示的に呼べば効く."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-default-file"
msgid "File in which to save bookmarks by default."
msgstr "ブックマークを保存する, 既定のファイル."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-search-size"
msgid "Length of the context strings recorded around a bookmark's position."
msgstr "ブックマークの位置の前後に覚える, 文字列の長さ."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-save-flag"
msgid "If non-nil, `bookmark-set' and the other changes save the bookmarks to `bookmark-default-file'."
msgstr "空でなければ, ブックマークを変えたときに bookmark-default-file に保存する."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-alist"
msgid ""
"Association list of bookmarks.\n"
"Each element is (NAME (filename FILE) (front-context-string STRING)\n"
"(rear-context-string STRING) (position POINT)).  The newest bookmark comes first."
msgstr ""
"ブックマークの連想リスト.\n"
"各要素は, (NAME (filename FILE) (front-context-string STRING)\n"
"(rear-context-string STRING) (position POINT)). 新しいブックマークが先頭."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-alist-loaded"
msgid "Non-nil once the bookmarks in `bookmark-default-file' have been read."
msgstr "`bookmark-default-file' のブックマークを読んだら, 非 nil."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-current-bookmark"
msgid "Name of the bookmark set or jumped to last, or #f."
msgstr "最後に設定した, または移ったブックマークの名前. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--get"
msgid "Return the value of KEY in the bookmark RECORD, or #f."
msgstr "ブックマーク RECORD の KEY の値を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-maybe-load-default-file"
msgid "Read `bookmark-default-file' into `bookmark-alist' the first time."
msgstr "最初に, `bookmark-default-file' を `bookmark-alist' に読む."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-save"
msgid "Write the bookmarks to `bookmark-default-file'."
msgstr "ブックマークを `bookmark-default-file' に書く."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--store"
msgid ""
"Add RECORD to `bookmark-alist'.\n"
"MODE is `overwrite' to replace the bookmark of the same name in place,\n"
"`push' to put RECORD in front of the others of the same name,\n"
"and anything else to signal an error if the name is taken."
msgstr ""
"RECORD を `bookmark-alist' に足す.\n"
"MODE が `overwrite' なら, 同じ名前のブックマークをその場で置き換え,\n"
"`push' なら, 同じ名前のものの前に置き,\n"
"それ以外で名前が使われていれば, エラーにする."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--make-record"
msgid "Return the bookmark NAME for the point of the current buffer."
msgstr "今のバッファのカーソルの位置の, 名前 NAME のブックマークを返す."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--default-name"
msgid "Return the name offered by default: the file name of the buffer, or the buffer name."
msgstr "既定で示す名前を返す: バッファのファイル名, または, バッファの名前."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--set"
msgid ""
"Set a bookmark for `bookmark-set' and `bookmark-set-no-overwrite'.\n"
"ARGS is the command's arguments, PROMPT the minibuffer prompt, and MODE as in `bookmark--store'."
msgstr ""
"`bookmark-set' と `bookmark-set-no-overwrite' のためにブックマークを付ける.\n"
"ARGS はコマンドの引数, PROMPT はミニバッファの問い, MODE は `bookmark--store' と同じ."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-set"
msgid ""
"Set a bookmark named NAME, at point of the current buffer, and save the bookmarks.\n"
"Interactively, read NAME in the minibuffer; an empty input means the default,\n"
"the last bookmark or the file name.  A bookmark of the same name is replaced.\n"
"The bookmark records the file, the position and the text around it."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファのカーソルの位置に, 名前 NAME のブックマークを付けて, ブックマークを保存する.\n"
"対話では, NAME をミニバッファで読む. 空の入力は, 既定の名前,\n"
"最後のブックマークかファイル名, を表す. 同じ名前のブックマークは置き換える.\n"
"ブックマークは, ファイルと, 位置と, その周りの文字を覚える."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-set-no-overwrite"
msgid ""
"Set a bookmark named NAME at the current location, like `bookmark-set'.\n"
"If a bookmark named NAME already exists, signal an error, unless the second argument\n"
"PUSH-BOOKMARK is true (interactively, a prefix argument).  Then the new bookmark is put in front,\n"
"so it is the one in effect, and the others of the same name stay behind it."
msgstr ""
"今の位置に名前 NAME のブックマークを付ける (`bookmark-set' と同じ).\n"
"同じ名前のブックマークがあれば, 2 番目の引数 PUSH-BOOKMARK (対話では前置引数) が\n"
"真でない限り, エラーにする. 真なら, 新しいものを前に置いて有効にし,\n"
"同じ名前の古いものは後ろに残す."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--search-back"
msgid "Return the last index of PATTERN in TEXT that starts at FROM or before, or #f."
msgstr "TEXT の中で, FROM かそれより前に始まる PATTERN の, 最後の位置を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--position"
msgid ""
"Return the point of the bookmark RECORD in the current buffer.\n"
"Search the text after the recorded position for the front context, then the text before for the rear context,\n"
"so that the position follows the edits of the file."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファでの, ブックマーク RECORD の位置を返す.\n"
"覚えた位置より後ろで前の文字を探し, 次に前で後ろの文字を探すので,\n"
"ファイルを書き換えても, 位置が付いていく."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-jump"
msgid ""
"Jump to the bookmark BOOKMARK, visiting its file.\n"
"Interactively, read the name in the minibuffer with completion; the default is the last bookmark.\n"
"If the text of the file has changed, find the position again from the text around it."
msgstr ""
"ブックマーク BOOKMARK に移る (そのファイルを開く).\n"
"対話では, 名前をミニバッファで補完しながら読む. 既定は, 最後のブックマーク.\n"
"ファイルの本文が変わっていれば, 周りの文字から位置を探し直す."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-sort-flag"
msgid "Non-nil means that bookmarks are sorted by name in the bookmark list."
msgstr "非 nil なら, ブックマークの一覧を名前で並べる."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "variable:bookmark-bmenu-buffer"
msgid "Name of the buffer of the bookmark list."
msgstr "ブックマークの一覧のバッファの名前."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--row"
msgid ""
"Return the line of the bookmark list for RECORD: two columns of marks, the annotation mark,\n"
"the name padded to 30 columns, the width of the empty type column, then the file."
msgstr ""
"RECORD の, ブックマークの一覧の 1 行を返す: 印の 2 列, 注釈の印,\n"
"30 桁に詰めた名前, 空の種類の列の幅, ファイル."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark--sorted"
msgid "Return `bookmark-alist', sorted by name ignoring case if `bookmark-sort-flag' is true."
msgstr "`bookmark-sort-flag' が真なら, 大文字小文字を区別せず名前で並べた `bookmark-alist' を返す."

#: lisp/bookmark.scm
msgctxt "function:bookmark-bmenu-list"
msgid ""
"Display a list of existing bookmarks.\n"
"The list is displayed in a buffer named *Bookmark List*.\n"
"Each line has a * in front of the name if the bookmark has an annotation, then the name and the file.\n"
"The bookmarks are sorted by name, ignoring case, unless `bookmark-sort-flag' is false."
msgstr ""
"存在するブックマークの一覧を出す.\n"
"一覧は *Bookmark List* というバッファに出す.\n"
"注釈のあるブックマークは名前の前に * を付け, 名前とファイルを並べる.\n"
"`bookmark-sort-flag' が偽でなければ, 大文字小文字を区別せず, 名前で並べる."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu-use-header-line"
msgid ""
"If non-nil, use the header line to display Buffer Menu column titles.\n"
"This editor has no header line, so the titles are the first line of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"真なら, バッファメニューの列の題を, 見出し行に出す.\n"
"このエディタには見出し行が無いので, 題はバッファの 1 行目に出す."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu-name-width"
msgid "Width of buffer name column in the Buffer Menu."
msgstr "バッファメニューの, バッファ名の列の幅."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu-size-width"
msgid "Width of buffer size column in the Buffer Menu."
msgstr "バッファメニューの, バッファの大きさの列の幅."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu-mode-width"
msgid "Width of mode name column in the Buffer Menu."
msgstr "バッファメニューの, モード名の列の幅."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu-files-only"
msgid "Non-nil if the current Buffer Menu lists only file buffers."
msgstr "今のバッファメニューが, ファイルのバッファだけを並べているなら真."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "variable:Buffer-menu--names"
msgid "The names of the buffers listed in *Buffer List*, in the order of its lines."
msgstr "*Buffer List* に並べたバッファの名前を, 行の順に並べたもの."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:buff-menu--column"
msgid "Pad TEXT to WIDTH columns (on the left if RIGHT), then add the one space between columns."
msgstr "TEXT を WIDTH 桁になるまで埋め (RIGHT なら左に埋め), 列の間の空白を 1 つ足す."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:buff-menu--file-name"
msgid "Replace the home directory in FILE with ~."
msgstr "FILE のホームディレクトリを ~ に置き換える."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:buff-menu--row"
msgid "Return the line of the Buffer Menu for the buffer NAME (OLD is the buffer the command was run in)."
msgstr "バッファ NAME の, バッファメニューの行を返す (OLD は, コマンドを動かしたバッファ)."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:list-buffers-noselect"
msgid ""
"Create and return a buffer with a list of names of existing buffers.\n"
"The buffer is named *Buffer List*.\n"
"If FILES-ONLY is non-nil, show only the buffers that visit files."
msgstr ""
"今あるバッファの名前を並べたバッファを作って返す.\n"
"バッファの名前は *Buffer List*.\n"
"FILES-ONLY が偽でなければ, ファイルを訪れているバッファだけを出す."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:list-buffers"
msgid ""
"Display a list of names of existing buffers.\n"
"The list is displayed in a buffer named *Buffer List*.\n"
"The first column shows \".\" for the buffer you came from, then \"%\" for a read-only\n"
"buffer and \"*\" for a modified buffer; then follow the name, size, mode and file.\n"
"With a non-negative prefix argument FILES-ONLY, show only the buffers that visit files."
msgstr ""
"今あるバッファの名前の一覧を出す.\n"
"一覧は *Buffer List* という名前のバッファに出す.\n"
"最初の列は, 来たバッファに \".\" を, 次に読み出し専用のバッファに \"%\", 変更したバッファに \"*\" を出す.\n"
"そのあとに, 名前, 大きさ, モード, ファイルが続く.\n"
"前置引数 FILES-ONLY が 0 以上なら, ファイルを訪れているバッファだけを出す."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:Buffer-menu-buffer"
msgid "Return the name of the buffer described by the current Buffer Menu line."
msgstr "今の Buffer Menu の行が表すバッファの名前を返す."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:Buffer-menu-this-window"
msgid "Select this line's buffer in this window."
msgstr "この行のバッファを, このウィンドウで選ぶ."

#: lisp/buff-menu.scm
msgctxt "function:Buffer-menu-other-window"
msgid "Select this line's buffer in another window."
msgstr "この行のバッファを, 別のウィンドウで選ぶ."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "variable:next-error-last-buffer"
msgid "The name of the buffer `next-error' reads the locations from, or #f."
msgstr "`next-error' が場所を読むバッファの名前. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "variable:next-error-directory"
msgid "The directory the file names of `next-error-last-buffer' are relative to."
msgstr "`next-error-last-buffer' のファイル名の基準になるディレクトリ."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "variable:next-error--start"
msgid "The position where the locations of `next-error-last-buffer' start."
msgstr "`next-error-last-buffer' の場所が始まる位置."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "variable:next-error--end"
msgid "The position where the locations of `next-error-last-buffer' end."
msgstr "`next-error-last-buffer' の場所が終わる位置."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--set-source"
msgid "Make the buffer NAME the source of `next-error': its locations lie between START and END."
msgstr "バッファ NAME を `next-error' の元にする. 場所は START から END の間にある."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--hit"
msgid "Return (FILE LINE) if the line TEXT is `FILE:LINE:TEXT', or #f."
msgstr "行 TEXT が `FILE:LINE:TEXT' なら (FILE LINE) を返す. 違えば #f."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--line-hit"
msgid "Return the location on the line at point, or #f if the line is outside the locations."
msgstr "点の行にある場所を返す. 行が場所の範囲の外なら #f."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--scan"
msgid ""
"Move point to the next (or previous) line with a location and return it.\n"
"If there is none, leave point where it was and return #f."
msgstr ""
"点を, 次(前)の場所のある行に動かして, その場所を返す.\n"
"無ければ, 点を動かさず #f を返す."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--default-directory"
msgid "Return the directory `grep' starts from (that of the Dired buffer if dired.scm is loaded, else of the visited file)."
msgstr "`grep' が始めるディレクトリを返す (Dired のバッファならそのディレクトリ, そうでなければ開いているファイルのもの)."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--visit"
msgid "Visit the file and line of HIT, in another window if OTHER-WINDOW."
msgstr "HIT のファイルと行を訪ねる. OTHER-WINDOW なら別の窓で."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile--next-error"
msgid "Visit the next (or previous) location of `next-error-last-buffer'."
msgstr "`next-error-last-buffer' の, 次(前)の場所を訪ねる."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:next-error"
msgid "Visit the next location of the grep (or xref) results."
msgstr "grep (か xref)の結果の, 次の場所を訪ねる."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:previous-error"
msgid "Visit the previous location of the grep (or xref) results."
msgstr "grep (か xref)の結果の, 前の場所を訪ねる."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:first-error"
msgid "Visit the first location of the grep (or xref) results."
msgstr "grep (か xref)の結果の, 最初の場所を訪ねる."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:compile-goto-error"
msgid "Visit the location on the current line of the results, in another window."
msgstr "結果の今の行にある場所を, 別の窓で訪ねる."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:grep--home-name"
msgid "Return PATH with the home directory written as ~."
msgstr "PATH のホームディレクトリを ~ で書いて返す."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:grep--files"
msgid "Return the files below DIRECTORY, not those in .git, target, or node_modules."
msgstr "DIRECTORY の下のファイルを返す (.git, target, node_modules の中は除く)."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:grep--show"
msgid "Show HITS ((FILE LINE TEXT) ...) in the *grep* buffer, in another window; return the buffer name."
msgstr "HITS ((FILE LINE TEXT) ...) を *grep* バッファに入れて, 別の窓に出す. バッファの名前を返す."

#: lisp/compile.scm
msgctxt "function:grep"
msgid ""
"Search the files below a directory for lines that match a regexp.\n"
"Interactively, read the regexp and the directory in the minibuffer.\n"
"The matches are listed in the *grep* buffer; \\[next-error] visits them."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリの下のファイルから, 正規表現に合う行を探す.\n"
"対話では, 正規表現とディレクトリをミニバッファで読む.\n"
"合った行は *grep* バッファに並べる. \\[next-error] で順に訪ねる."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:dabbrev-backward-only"
msgid "If non-nil, `dabbrev-expand' only looks backwards."
msgstr "真なら, `dabbrev-expand' は, 後ろ向きだけに探す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "variable:dabbrev-case-replace"
msgid "Controls whether dabbrev preserves case when expanding the abbreviation."
msgstr "略語を展開するとき, dabbrev が大文字小文字を保つかを決める."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--location"
msgid "Return the position of `dabbrev--last-expansion-location' (a number, or a marker kept across the edit)."
msgstr "`dabbrev--last-expansion-location' の位置を返す (数か, 編集をまたいで保つマーカー)."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--ignore-case-p"
msgid "Return non-nil if case should be ignored when searching for ABBREV."
msgstr "ABBREV を探すとき, 大文字小文字を区別しないなら真を返す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--goto-start-of-abbrev"
msgid "Back over all abbrev type characters."
msgstr "略語の文字の分だけ, 戻る."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--abbrev-at-point"
msgid "Extract the symbol before point to serve as abbreviation."
msgstr "点の前の記号を, 略語として取り出す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--search"
msgid "Search for something that could be used to expand ABBREV, leaving point at its end."
msgstr "ABBREV を展開するのに使えるものを探し, 点をその終わりに置く."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--try-find"
msgid "Search for ABBREV, backwards if REVERSE, N times.  Return the expansion found."
msgstr "ABBREV を N 回探す (REVERSE なら後ろ向き). 見つけた展開を返す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--find-expansion"
msgid ""
"Find one occurrence of ABBREV, and return the expansion.\n"
"DIRECTION > 0 means look that many times backwards, < 0 forwards, = 0 both."
msgstr ""
"ABBREV の出現を 1 つ探し, 展開を返す.\n"
"DIRECTION が 0 より大きければ, その回数だけ後ろ向きに探し, 小さければ前向きに, 0 なら両方向に探す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--substitute-expansion"
msgid "Replace OLD (or ABBREV, if OLD is false) before point with EXPANSION."
msgstr "点の前の OLD (偽なら ABBREV) を, EXPANSION に置き換える."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev-expand"
msgid ""
"Expand previous word \"dynamically\".\n"
"\n"
"Expands to the most recent, preceding word for which this is a prefix.\n"
"If no suitable preceding word is found, words following point are considered.\n"
"\n"
"A positive prefix argument, N, says to take the Nth backward *distinct* possibility.\n"
"A negative argument says search forward.\n"
"\n"
"If the cursor has not moved from the end of the previous expansion and no argument is given,\n"
"replace the previously-made expansion with the next possible expansion not yet tried."
msgstr ""
"直前の単語を「動的に」展開する.\n"
"\n"
"点の前の語を接頭辞とする単語のうち, 一番近い前の単語に展開する.\n"
"合う前の単語が無ければ, 点の後ろの単語を考える.\n"
"\n"
"正の前置引数 N は, 後ろ向きの N 番目の異なる候補を取る.\n"
"負の引数は, 前向きに探す.\n"
"\n"
"点が前の展開の終わりから動いておらず, 引数が無いなら, 前の展開を, まだ試していない次の候補に置き換える."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--capitalize"
msgid "Return STRING with the first letter of each word upper case and the rest lower case."
msgstr "STRING の各単語の頭の文字を大文字に, 残りを小文字にして返す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--find-all-expansions"
msgid ""
"Return a list of all possible expansions of ABBREV, the last one found first.\n"
"If IGNORE-CASE is non-nil, accept matches which differ in case."
msgstr ""
"ABBREV の展開の候補を全て一覧にして返す (最後に見つけたものが先頭).\n"
"IGNORE-CASE が非 nil なら, 大文字と小文字の違うものも受け入れる."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev--capf"
msgid "Return (START END CANDIDATES) for the dabbrev completion of the abbreviation at point."
msgstr "ポイントの略語の dabbrev による補完の (START END CANDIDATES) を返す."

#: lisp/dabbrev.scm
msgctxt "function:dabbrev-completion"
msgid ""
"Completion on current word.\n"
"Like `dabbrev-expand' but finds all expansions in the current buffer\n"
"and presents suggestions for completion."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの単語の補完.\n"
"`dabbrev-expand' と同じように, 今のバッファの中の全ての展開を探し,\n"
"補完の候補として示す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "variable:dired--directories"
msgid "List of (BUFFER-NAME DIRECTORY) for the Dired buffers."
msgstr "dired のバッファの (バッファ名 ディレクトリ) のリスト."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--directory-file-name"
msgid "Return DIR without the trailing slashes (\"/\" stays)."
msgstr "DIR の終わりの / を除いたものを返す (\"/\" は, そのまま)."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--base-name"
msgid "Return the name of the Dired buffer for DIR (its last component; \"/\" stays)."
msgstr "DIR の dired のバッファの名前 (最後の部分. \"/\" は, そのまま) を返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--text"
msgid "Return the text of the Dired buffer of DIR: the directory, then the `ls -al' lines indented by two spaces."
msgstr "DIR の dired のバッファの本文を返す: ディレクトリ, 続けて `ls -al' の行を 2 文字字下げして."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--goto-first-file"
msgid "Move point to the name of the first file (after \".\" and \"..\"), or to the end if there is none."
msgstr "最初のファイル (「.」と「..」の次) の名前へ点を動かす. 無ければ終わりへ."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--fill"
msgid "Replace the text of the current buffer with the listing of DIR."
msgstr "今のバッファの本文を, DIR の一覧に置き換える."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--live"
msgid "Forget the Dired buffers that no longer exist."
msgstr "もう無い dired のバッファを忘れる."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-noselect"
msgid ""
"Like `dired' but return the Dired buffer (its name) without selecting it.\n"
"An existing Dired buffer of the same directory is reused."
msgstr ""
"`dired' と同じだが, dired のバッファ (の名前) を返し, 選ばない.\n"
"同じディレクトリの dired のバッファがあれば, それを使う."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--default-directory"
msgid "Return the directory to start from: the directory of the Dired buffer or of the visited file, or the home."
msgstr "始めに出すディレクトリを返す: dired のバッファか, 訪れているファイルのディレクトリ, 無ければホーム."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired"
msgid ""
"\"Edit\" directory DIRNAME--delete, rename, print, etc. some files in it.\n"
"Interactively, read DIRNAME in the minibuffer with file name completion.\n"
"The listing is made by `ls -al'.  An existing Dired buffer of the directory is shown again."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリ DIRNAME を「編集」する--中のファイルを消す, 名前を変える, 印刷するなど.\n"
"対話的には, DIRNAME をミニバッファで, ファイル名の補完付きで読む.\n"
"一覧は `ls -al' で作る. そのディレクトリの dired のバッファがあれば, それをまた出す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-other-window"
msgid "\"Edit\" directory DIRNAME.  Like `dired' but selects in another window."
msgstr "ディレクトリ DIRNAME を「編集」する. `dired' と同じだが, 別のウィンドウで選ぶ."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--goto-file"
msgid "Move point to the name NAME in the current Dired buffer.  Return #f if the listing has no such file."
msgstr "今の Dired のバッファで, 名前 NAME にカーソルを移す. 一覧に無ければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--jump"
msgid "Show the Dired buffer of the directory of FILE with point on FILE.  List the directory again if FILE is missing."
msgstr "FILE のあるディレクトリの Dired のバッファを出し, カーソルを FILE に置く. FILE が無ければ, 一覧を作り直す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--jump-file"
msgid "Return the file `dired-jump' starts from: the visited file, the directory of a Dired buffer, or the home."
msgstr "`dired-jump' の始めのファイルを返す: 開いているファイル, Dired のバッファのディレクトリ, またはホーム."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-jump"
msgid ""
"Jump to Dired buffer corresponding to current buffer.\n"
"If in a buffer visiting a file, Dired that file's directory and\n"
"move to that file's line in the directory listing.\n"
"If the current buffer isn't visiting a file, Dired the home directory.\n"
"If in Dired already, pop up a level and go to the old directory's line.\n"
"When OTHER-WINDOW is true, jump to Dired buffer in other window.\n"
"When FILE-NAME is given, jump to its line in Dired."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファに当たる Dired のバッファに移る.\n"
"ファイルを開いているバッファなら, そのファイルのディレクトリを Dired で開き,\n"
"一覧のそのファイルの行に移る.\n"
"ファイルのないバッファなら, ホームのディレクトリを Dired で開く.\n"
"すでに Dired なら, 一つ上のディレクトリに上がり, 元のディレクトリの行に移る.\n"
"OTHER-WINDOW が真なら, 別のウィンドウに出す.\n"
"FILE-NAME があれば, その行に移る."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-jump-other-window"
msgid "Like `dired-jump' but in other window."
msgstr "`dired-jump' と同じだが, 別のウィンドウに出す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--revert"
msgid "List the directory of the current Dired buffer again, and return #t.  Return #f if it is not a Dired buffer."
msgstr "今の dired のバッファのディレクトリを一覧し直し, 真を返す. dired のバッファでなければ偽を返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "variable:dired--filename-regexp"
msgid "Regexp that ends the date of an `ls -al' line, so that the file name follows it."
msgstr "`ls -al' の行の日付の終わりに合う正規表現. この後にファイルの名前が続く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--filename-start"
msgid "Return the position of the file name on the current line, or #f if the line has no file."
msgstr "今の行のファイルの名前の位置を返す. 行にファイルが無ければ #f."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-get-filename"
msgid "Return the name of the file on the current line, or #f.  With LOCALP non-nil, without the directory."
msgstr "今の行のファイルの名前を返す (無ければ #f). LOCALP が空でなければ, ディレクトリを付けない."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--directory"
msgid "Return the directory of the current Dired buffer."
msgstr "今の Dired バッファのディレクトリを返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-next-line"
msgid "Move down lines then position at the file name."
msgstr "何行か下へ動き, ファイルの名前の所に置く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-previous-line"
msgid "Move up lines then position at the file name."
msgstr "何行か上へ動き, ファイルの名前の所に置く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--mark-line"
msgid "Put the mark CHAR in the first column of the current line, if it lists a file."
msgstr "今の行にファイルがあれば, 最初の桁に印 CHAR を入れる."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-mark"
msgid "Mark the file at point in the Dired buffer, then move to the next line."
msgstr "Dired バッファの点のファイルに印を付け, 次の行へ動く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-flag-file-deletion"
msgid "In Dired, flag the current line's file for deletion, then move to the next line."
msgstr "Dired で, 今の行のファイルに消す印を付け, 次の行へ動く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-unmark"
msgid "Unmark the file at point in the Dired buffer, then move to the next line."
msgstr "Dired バッファの点のファイルの印を外し, 次の行へ動く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--marked"
msgid "Return the file names (without the directory) of the lines marked with CHAR."
msgstr "印 CHAR の付いた行のファイルの名前 (ディレクトリ無し) を返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-unmark-all-marks"
msgid "Remove all marks from all files in the Dired buffer."
msgstr "Dired バッファの全てのファイルの印を外す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--marks"
msgid "Return a list of (NAME MARK) of the marked lines."
msgstr "印の付いた行の (名前 印) の並びを返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--anchor"
msgid ""
"Return the name of the first file at or after the current line that is not in SKIP, or #f.\n"
"Emacs inserts a new entry before this line."
msgstr ""
"現在の行か, それより後ろの, SKIP に無い最初のファイルの名前. 無ければ #f.\n"
"Emacs は, この行の前に新しい項目を足す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--names"
msgid "Return the names of the files in the current Dired buffer, in the order of the lines."
msgstr "現在の Dired バッファのファイルの名前を, 行の順に返す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--order"
msgid "Return ORDER (a list of names) with NEW put before ANCHOR (or at the end if ANCHOR is not in it)."
msgstr "ORDER (名前の並び) の ANCHOR の前に NEW を置いた並びを返す (ANCHOR が無ければ, 最後に置く)."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--reorder"
msgid ""
"Move the lines of the files in ORDER, one after another, to the end of the buffer.\n"
"Names the listing does not have are skipped.  Emacs keeps the order of the lines\n"
"and inserts a new entry at point, instead of sorting the names again."
msgstr ""
"ORDER のファイルの行を, 順にバッファの最後へ移す.\n"
"一覧に無い名前は飛ばす.  Emacs は, 名前を並べ直さず, 行の順を保って,\n"
"点の所に新しい項目を足す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--relist"
msgid ""
"List the directory again, keep the order of the lines, then put MARKS (a list of (NAME MARK)) back.\n"
"PLACE is (ANCHOR NAMES): the lines of NAMES go before the line of ANCHOR."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリの一覧を作り直し, 行の順を保って, MARKS ((名前 印) の並び) の印を戻す.\n"
"PLACE は (ANCHOR NAMES): NAMES の行を, ANCHOR の行の前に置く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--delete"
msgid "Ask, then delete the files NAMES (names in the directory of the current Dired buffer)."
msgstr "確かめてから, ファイル NAMES (今の Dired バッファのディレクトリの中の名前) を消す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-do-flagged-delete"
msgid "In Dired, delete the files flagged for deletion."
msgstr "Dired で, 消す印の付いたファイルを消す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--marked-or-current"
msgid "Return the files marked with `*', or the current file."
msgstr "`*' の印の付いたファイルを返す. 無ければ今のファイル."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-do-delete"
msgid "Delete all marked (or next ARG) files."
msgstr "印の付いた (または次の ARG 個の) ファイルを消す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--target"
msgid "Read the target for NAME with PROMPT.  Return its absolute name (inside the directory if it is one)."
msgstr "NAME の行き先を PROMPT で読む. 絶対パスで返す (ディレクトリなら, その中)."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--transfer"
msgid "Copy or move the marked (or current) files.  OPERATE takes the source and the target."
msgstr "印の付いた (または今の) ファイルを写すか移す. OPERATE は, 元と先を受ける."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-do-copy"
msgid "Copy all marked (or next ARG) files, or copy the current file."
msgstr "印の付いた (または次の ARG 個の) ファイルを写す. 無ければ今のファイルを写す."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-do-rename"
msgid "Rename all marked (or next ARG) files, or rename the current file."
msgstr "印の付いた (または次の ARG 個の) ファイルの名前を変える. 無ければ今のファイルの名前を変える."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-create-directory"
msgid "Create a directory called DIRECTORY."
msgstr "DIRECTORY という名前のディレクトリを作る."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-do-redisplay"
msgid "Redisplay the Dired buffer, keeping the marks."
msgstr "Dired バッファを作り直す (印は残す)."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-find-file"
msgid "In Dired, visit the file or directory named on this line."
msgstr "Dired で, この行のファイルかディレクトリを開く."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired-up-directory"
msgid "Run Dired on the parent directory of the current directory."
msgstr "今のディレクトリの親のディレクトリで Dired を動かす."

#: lisp/dired.scm
msgctxt "function:dired--set-keys"
msgid "Give the current Dired buffer its keys."
msgstr "今の Dired バッファにキーを割り当てる."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "variable:auto-mode-alist"
msgid ""
"List of (REGEXP MODE) to choose the major mode of a visited file.\n"
"MODE is a syntax dialect (elisp, scheme), lisp-data-mode, or a major mode on the Fundamental dialect (text-mode, c-mode, c++-mode, rust-mode, typescript-mode).\n"
"The first REGEXP (Rust regex syntax) that matches the file name decides; other files are Fundamental."
msgstr ""
"訪れたファイルのメジャーモードを選ぶ (REGEXP MODE) のリスト.\n"
"MODE は、構文の方言 (elisp, scheme)、lisp-data-mode、または Fundamental の方言の上のメジャーモード (text-mode, c-mode, c++-mode, rust-mode, typescript-mode).\n"
"ファイルの名前に合う初めの REGEXP (Rust の regex の書き方) で決まる. 合わなければ Fundamental."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "variable:file-local-mode-alist"
msgid "List of (NAME MODE) for `mode: NAME' in the -*- line of a file.  MODE is as in `auto-mode-alist'."
msgstr "ファイルの -*- 行の `mode: NAME' のための (NAME MODE) のリスト.  MODE は `auto-mode-alist' と同じ."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:set-auto-mode-1"
msgid "Turn on MODE, a value of `auto-mode-alist'."
msgstr "MODE をオンにする. MODE は `auto-mode-alist' の値."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:set-auto-mode"
msgid ""
"Select the syntax dialect (major mode) of the current buffer.\n"
"`mode: NAME' in the first line (-*- ... -*-) of the file wins over the file name, as in Emacs.\n"
"See `auto-mode-alist'."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファの構文の方言 (メジャーモード) を選ぶ.\n"
"Emacs と同じく、ファイルの 1 行目 (-*- ... -*-) の `mode: NAME' が、ファイルの名前より優先される.\n"
"`auto-mode-alist' を見よ."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-buffer-visiting"
msgid "Return the buffer visiting file FILENAME, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "ファイル FILENAME を訪れているバッファを返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:create-file-buffer"
msgid ""
"Create a suitably named buffer for visiting FILENAME, and return it.\n"
"FILENAME (sans directory) is used unchanged if that name is free;\n"
"otherwise the buffer is renamed according to\n"
"`uniquify-buffer-name-style' to get an unused name.\n"
"To avoid confusion when visiting a file whose name begins with a space,\n"
"this function prepends a \"|\" to the final result if necessary."
msgstr ""
"FILENAME を訪れるための, 適した名前のバッファを作って返す.\n"
"FILENAME (ディレクトリを除いたもの) の名前が空いていれば, そのまま使う.\n"
"そうでなければ, `uniquify-buffer-name-style' に従って, 空いている名前に変える.\n"
"空白で始まる名前のファイルを訪れるときは, 紛れないように, 名前の前に \"|\" を付ける."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-file-noselect"
msgid ""
"Read file FILENAME into a buffer and return the buffer.\n"
"If a buffer exists visiting FILENAME, return that one.  A new buffer is named after the file,\n"
"its syntax dialect is chosen by `set-auto-mode', and `find-file-hook' runs in it.\n"
"If FILENAME does not exist, the new buffer is empty and visits it.\n"
"If FILENAME is a directory, return a Dired buffer (`dired-noselect')."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME をバッファに読み込み, そのバッファを返す.\n"
"FILENAME を訪れているバッファがあれば, それを返す. 新しいバッファの名前はファイルの名前で,\n"
"構文の方言は `set-auto-mode' で選び, そのバッファで `find-file-hook' を動かす.\n"
"FILENAME が無ければ, 新しいバッファは空で, そのファイルを訪れる.\n"
"FILENAME がディレクトリなら, dired のバッファを返す (`dired-noselect`)."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-file"
msgid ""
"Edit file FILENAME.\n"
"Switch to a buffer visiting file FILENAME, creating one if none already exists.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer with file name completion."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME を編集する.\n"
"FILENAME のファイルのバッファに切り替える (無ければ, 作る).\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, FILENAME をミニバッファで (ファイルの名前を補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-file-other-window"
msgid ""
"Edit file FILENAME, in another window.\n"
"Like `find-file' but creates a new window or reuses an existing one.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer with file name completion."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME を, 別のウィンドウで編集する.\n"
"`find-file' と同じだが, 新しいウィンドウを作るか, 既にあるものを使う.\n"
"対話では, FILENAME をミニバッファで, ファイル名を補完しながら読む."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-alternate-file"
msgid ""
"Find file FILENAME, select its buffer, and kill the previous buffer.\n"
"If the current buffer visits a file and is modified, ask before killing it.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer; the initial input is the current file."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME を開いてそのバッファを選び, 前のバッファを消す.\n"
"今のバッファがファイルを開いていて, 書き換えていれば, 消す前に聞く.\n"
"対話的には, FILENAME をミニバッファで読む. 入力の始めは, 今のファイル."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-file"
msgid ""
"Insert the contents of file FILENAME at point.\n"
"Point stays before the inserted text, and the mark is set after it.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer with file name completion."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME の中身を, ポイントの位置に入れる.\n"
"ポイントは, 入れた文字の前に残り, マークは, 入れた文字の後に置く.\n"
"対話的には, FILENAME をミニバッファで, ファイル名を補完しながら読む."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:files--confirm-overwrite"
msgid "Signal an error unless FILE does not exist or the user agrees to ACTION it anyway."
msgstr "FILE が無いか, 利用者が ACTION してよいと答えなければ, エラーにする."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:write-region"
msgid ""
"Write current region into specified file.\n"
"When called from a program, requires three arguments: START, END and FILENAME.\n"
"START and END are normally buffer positions specifying the part of the buffer to write.\n"
"If START is #f, that means to write the whole buffer.  If START is a string, then output\n"
"that string to the file instead of any buffer contents; END is ignored.\n"
"Optional fourth argument APPEND if non-#f means append to existing file contents (if any).\n"
"Optional fifth argument VISIT, if #t or a string, means set the last-save-file-modtime of\n"
"buffer to this file's modtime and mark buffer not modified; if a string, the buffer visits\n"
"that file name.\n"
"Interactively, write the region to a file read in the minibuffer, asking before overwriting\n"
"an existing file."
msgstr ""
"今のリージョンを指定のファイルに書く.\n"
"プログラムから呼ぶときは, START, END, FILENAME の 3 つの引数が要る.\n"
"START と END は, 書くバッファの範囲の位置. START が #f なら, バッファの全体を書く.\n"
"START が文字列なら, バッファの代わりにその文字列を書く (END は無視する).\n"
"4 つ目の引数 APPEND が #f でなければ, ファイルの後ろに足す.\n"
"5 つ目の引数 VISIT が #t か文字列なら, バッファを書き換えていないことにする. 文字列なら, バッファはそのファイルを訪れる.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, ファイルの名前をミニバッファで聞き, 既にあるファイルは聞いてから書き換える."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-file"
msgid ""
"Copy FILE to NEWNAME.  Both args must be strings.\n"
"Signal a `file-already-exists' error if file NEWNAME already exists, unless a third argument\n"
"OK-IF-ALREADY-EXISTS is supplied and non-#f.\n"
"Interactively, read FILE and NEWNAME in the minibuffer; if NEWNAME is a directory, copy FILE\n"
"into it, and ask before overwriting an existing file."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILE を NEWNAME に写す. どちらも文字列.\n"
"NEWNAME が既にあるときは, 3 つ目の引数 OK-IF-ALREADY-EXISTS が #f でなければ置き換え, さもなくばエラーにする.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, FILE と NEWNAME をミニバッファで聞く. NEWNAME がディレクトリなら, その中に写す. 既にあるファイルは, 聞いてから置き換える."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:do-auto-save"
msgid ""
"Auto-save all buffers that need it.\n"
"This writes the modified file-visiting buffers to their auto save files (#NAME#),\n"
"and prints \"Auto-saving...done\" if anything was saved."
msgstr ""
"必要なバッファを全て自動保存する.\n"
"書き換えたファイルのバッファを, 自動保存のファイル (#名前#) に書き, 何か保存したら \"Auto-saving...done\" と出す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:set-visited-file-name"
msgid ""
"Change the name of the file visited in the current buffer to FILENAME.\n"
"The buffer is renamed after the file, and marked as modified (the new file is not saved yet).\n"
"If FILENAME is #f, the buffer visits no file.\n"
"The third argument ALONG-WITH-FILE non-#f means the file was renamed along with the buffer:\n"
"the buffer keeps its modified flag.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer; the initial input is the current file."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファが訪れるファイルの名前を FILENAME に変える.\n"
"バッファの名前はファイルの名前にし, 書き換えたことにする (新しいファイルには, まだ保存していない).\n"
"FILENAME が #f なら, ファイルを訪れない.\n"
"3 つ目の引数 ALONG-WITH-FILE が #f でなければ, ファイルもバッファと一緒に名前を変えたことを表す:\n"
"バッファの書き換えの印は, そのままにする.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, ミニバッファで FILENAME を聞く (始めの入力は今のファイル)."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:files--set-visited-file-name"
msgid "Make the current buffer visit FILENAME (see `set-visited-file-name')."
msgstr "今のバッファに, ファイル FILENAME を訪れさせる (`set-visited-file-name` を見る)."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:append-to-file"
msgid ""
"Append the contents of the region to the end of file FILENAME.\n"
"When called from a function, expects three arguments,\n"
"START, END and FILENAME.  START and END are normally buffer positions\n"
"specifying the part of the buffer to write.\n"
"If START is nil, that means to use the entire buffer contents.\n"
"If START is a string, then output that string to the file\n"
"instead of any buffer contents; END is ignored."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの中身を, ファイル FILENAME の終わりに足す.\n"
"関数から呼ぶときは, 3 つの引数 START, END, FILENAME を渡す. START と END は, 普通は,\n"
"書き出すバッファの部分を指す位置.\n"
"START が nil なら, バッファ全体を使う.\n"
"START が文字列なら, バッファの中身でなく, その文字列をファイルに書く (END は使わない)."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:rename-visited-file"
msgid ""
"Rename the file visited by the current buffer to NEW-LOCATION.\n"
"This command also sets the visited file name.  If the buffer\n"
"isn't visiting any file, that's all it does.\n"
"\n"
"Interactively, this prompts for NEW-LOCATION."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファが訪れるファイルの名前を NEW-LOCATION に変える.\n"
"訪れるファイルの名前も変える. バッファがファイルを訪れていなければ, それだけをする.\n"
"\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, NEW-LOCATION を聞く."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "variable:mode-require-final-newline"
msgid "Non-#f means a file-visiting buffer gets a final newline when it is saved (if it is not empty)."
msgstr "#f でなければ, ファイルを訪れるバッファは, 保存するときに最後に改行を足す (空でないとき)."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:files--require-final-newline"
msgid "Add a newline at the end of the current buffer unless it is empty or already ends with one."
msgstr "バッファが空でなく, 最後が改行でなければ, 最後に改行を足す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:make-backup-file-name"
msgid "Return the backup file name of FILE (FILE~)."
msgstr "ファイル FILE のバックアップのファイルの名前 (FILE~) を返す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:backup-buffer"
msgid ""
"Make a backup of the file visited by the current buffer, if appropriate.\n"
"This is done before the first save after visiting the file: the old file is copied to its\n"
"backup file name (`make-backup-file-name').  Nothing is done if the file does not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファが訪れるファイルのバックアップを, 要るときに作る.\n"
"ファイルを訪れてから初めて保存する前に, 前のファイルをバックアップのファイルの名前\n"
"(`make-backup-file-name') に写す. ファイルがまだ無ければ, 何もしない."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-auto-save-file-if-necessary"
msgid "Delete the auto save file of the current buffer, if it exists."
msgstr "今のバッファの自動保存のファイルがあれば, 消す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:basic-save-buffer"
msgid ""
"Save the current buffer in its visited file, if it has been modified.\n"
"Make a backup first (`backup-buffer'), delete the auto save file after writing,\n"
"and run `after-save-hook'.  If the buffer visits no file, read a file name."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを書き換えていれば, 訪れているファイルに保存する.\n"
"先にバックアップを作り (`backup-buffer'), 書いた後で自動保存のファイルを消し,\n"
"`after-save-hook' を動かす. ファイルを訪れていなければ, ファイルの名前を聞く."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:files--write-file"
msgid ""
"Write the current buffer into FILENAME, and make the buffer visit it.\n"
"Ask before overwriting an existing file other than the visited one."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを FILENAME に書き, バッファにそのファイルを開かせる.\n"
"開いているファイルでない, 既にあるファイルを置き換えるときは, 前に聞く."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:write-file"
msgid ""
"Write the current buffer into file FILENAME, and make the buffer visit it.\n"
"The buffer is renamed after the file. Ask before overwriting another existing file.\n"
"Interactively, read FILENAME in the minibuffer with file name completion."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファをファイル FILENAME に書き, バッファにそのファイルを開かせる.\n"
"バッファの名前は, ファイルの名前にする. ほかの既にあるファイルを置き換えるときは, 前に聞く.\n"
"対話的には, FILENAME をミニバッファで, ファイル名を補完しながら読む."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:save-buffer"
msgid ""
"Save the current buffer in its file, if it is modified.\n"
"If the buffer visits no file, read a file name in the minibuffer and write it there.\n"
"The first save after visiting a file keeps the old file as a backup (FILE~)."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを, 書き換えていれば, そのファイルに保存する.\n"
"バッファがファイルを開いていなければ, ファイル名をミニバッファで読み, そこに書く.\n"
"ファイルを開いてから初めて保存するときは, 古いファイルをバックアップ (FILE~) に残す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:save-some-buffers"
msgid ""
"Save some modified file-visiting buffers, asking about each one.\n"
"Answer y or SPC to save it, n or DEL to skip it, ! to save it and all the rest,\n"
". to save it and stop, and q or RET to stop."
msgstr ""
"書き換えた, ファイルを開いているバッファを, 1 つずつ聞いて保存する.\n"
"y か SPC で保存, n か DEL で飛ばし, ! で保存して残りも全て保存,\n"
". で保存して終え, q か RET で終える."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:make-auto-save-file-name"
msgid ""
"Return the auto save file name of the file the current buffer visits (#NAME# in the same directory).\n"
"Return #f if the buffer visits no file."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファが訪れているファイルの自動保存のファイルの名前 (同じディレクトリの #名前#) を返す.\n"
"バッファがファイルを訪れていなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:revert-buffer"
msgid ""
"Replace the buffer text with the text of the visited file on disk.\n"
"Ask before reverting, unless the optional second argument NOCONFIRM is true.\n"
"A Dired buffer is listed again without asking.\n"
"Point stays at the same character, and the change can be undone."
msgstr ""
"バッファの本文を, ディスクにある訪れているファイルの本文に置き換える.\n"
"2 番目の引数 NOCONFIRM が真でなければ, 読み直す前に尋ねる.\n"
"Dired のバッファは, 尋ねずに一覧を作り直す.\n"
"カーソルは同じ文字の所に残り, 変更は取り消せる."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:revert-buffer-quick"
msgid ""
"Like `revert-buffer', but asks for less confirmation.\n"
"If the current buffer is visiting a file, and the buffer is not modified, no confirmation is\n"
"required."
msgstr ""
"`revert-buffer' と同じだが, 尋ねることが少ない.\n"
"今のバッファがファイルを訪れていて, 書き換えていなければ, 確認なしで読み直す."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:not-modified"
msgid ""
"Mark current buffer as unmodified, not needing to be saved.\n"
"With prefix ARG, mark buffer as modified, so \\[save-buffer] will save.\n"
"\n"
"It is not a good idea to use this function in Lisp programs, because it prints a message in the\n"
"minibuffer.  Instead, use `set-buffer-modified-p'."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを, 書き換えていない (保存しなくてよい) ことにする.\n"
"前置引数 ARG があれば, 書き換えたことにして, \\[save-buffer] で保存されるようにする.\n"
"\n"
"Lisp のプログラムでこの関数を使うのはよくない. ミニバッファにメッセージを出すから.\n"
"代わりに `set-buffer-modified-p' を使う."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:rename-uniquely"
msgid ""
"Rename current buffer to a similar name not already taken.\n"
"This function is useful for creating multiple shell process buffers or multiple mail buffers,\n"
"etc."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファの名前を, まだ使われていない似た名前に変える.\n"
"シェルのバッファやメールのバッファなどを, 複数作るときに便利."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:files--find-file-read-only"
msgid "Visit FILENAME with FINDER and make its buffer read-only."
msgstr "FINDER で FILENAME を訪れて, そのバッファを読み取り専用にする."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-file-read-only"
msgid ""
"Edit file FILENAME but don't allow changes.\n"
"Like \\[find-file], but marks buffer as read-only.\n"
"Use \\[read-only-mode] to permit editing."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME を, 変更を許さずに編集する.\n"
"\\[find-file] と同じだが, バッファを読み取り専用にする.\n"
"編集できるようにするには \\[read-only-mode] を使う."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:find-file-read-only-other-window"
msgid ""
"Edit file FILENAME in another window but don't allow changes.\n"
"Like \\[find-file-other-window], but marks buffer as read-only.\n"
"Use \\[read-only-mode] to permit editing."
msgstr ""
"ファイル FILENAME を, 別のウィンドウで, 変更を許さずに編集する.\n"
"\\[find-file-other-window] と同じだが, バッファを読み取り専用にする.\n"
"編集できるようにするには \\[read-only-mode] を使う."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "variable:list-directory-brief-switches"
msgid "Switches for `list-directory' to pass to `ls' for a brief listing."
msgstr "`list-directory' が簡単な一覧のために `ls' に渡すスイッチ."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "variable:list-directory-verbose-switches"
msgid "Switches for `list-directory' to pass to `ls' for a verbose listing."
msgstr "`list-directory' が詳しい一覧のために `ls' に渡すスイッチ."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:list-directory"
msgid ""
"Display a list of files in or matching DIRNAME, a la `ls'.\n"
"DIRNAME is globbed by the shell if necessary.\n"
"Prefix arg (second arg if noninteractive) means supply -l switch to `ls'.\n"
"Actions controlled by variables `list-directory-brief-switches' and\n"
"`list-directory-verbose-switches'."
msgstr ""
"DIRNAME の中の, または合うファイルの一覧を, `ls' のように出す.\n"
"必要ならシェルが DIRNAME をワイルドカードで展開する.\n"
"前置引数 (非対話では 2 番目の引数) があれば, `ls' に -l を付ける.\n"
"動きは変数 `list-directory-brief-switches' と `list-directory-verbose-switches' で決まる."

#: lisp/files.scm
msgctxt "function:recover-this-file"
msgid ""
"Recover the visited file from its auto save file.\n"
"Ask before replacing the buffer text. The buffer is marked as modified."
msgstr ""
"訪れているファイルを, 自動保存のファイルから復元する.\n"
"バッファの本文を置き換える前に聞く.バッファは変更ありにする."

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-language-from-locale"
msgid ""
"Return the language of LOCALE, such as \"ja\" for \"ja_JP.UTF-8\".\n"
"Return \"en\" if LOCALE is #f, empty, \"C\" or \"POSIX\"."
msgstr ""
"LOCALE の言語を返す (\"ja_JP.UTF-8\" なら \"ja\").\n"
"LOCALE が #f, 空, \"C\", \"POSIX\" なら \"en\" を返す."

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "variable:help-language"
msgid ""
"Language of the docstrings shown in *Help*, such as \"ja\".\n"
"If there is no translation in this language, or it is \"en\", show the original docstring.\n"
"The default is taken from the environment variable LANG."
msgstr ""
"*Help* に出す docstring の言語 (\"ja\" など).\n"
"この言語の翻訳が無いか, \"en\" なら, 元の docstring を出す.\n"
"既定は, 環境変数 LANG から取る."

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-file-name-nondirectory"
msgid "Return FILE without its directory."
msgstr "FILE から, ディレクトリを除いたものを返す"

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-function-names"
msgid ""
"Return the names of all functions and commands, sorted.\n"
"They are the functions defined in Lisp or Rust, and the commands written in TypeScript."
msgstr ""
"全ての関数とコマンドの名前を, 名前の順で返す.\n"
"Lisp か Rust で定義した関数と, TypeScript で書いたコマンド."

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-unique"
msgid "Return ITEMS without duplicates, keeping the first ones."
msgstr "ITEMS から重なりを除いたものを返す (始めのものを残す)"

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-lisp-function-p"
msgid "Return true if FUNCTION is defined in Lisp."
msgstr "FUNCTION が Lisp で定義した関数なら, 真を返す"

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-arglist-string"
msgid ""
"Return the argument list of the Lisp function FUNCTION as a string.\n"
"For example, \"(find-file &rest ARGS)\"."
msgstr ""
"Lisp の関数 FUNCTION の引数の形を, 文字列で返す.\n"
"例えば \"(find-file &rest ARGS)\"."

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-function-kind"
msgid ""
"Return the first line of the help of FUNCTION, such as\n"
"\"find-file is an interactive Lisp function in `files.scm'.\""
msgstr ""
"FUNCTION のヘルプの 1 行目を返す.例えば\n"
"\"find-file is an interactive Lisp function in `files.scm'.\""

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-function-text"
msgid "Return the text of the help of FUNCTION (a symbol)."
msgstr "FUNCTION (記号) のヘルプの文を返す"

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:help-show"
msgid "Show TEXT in the *Help* buffer, in another window."
msgstr "TEXT を *Help* バッファに入れ, ほかのウィンドウに出す"

#: lisp/help-fns.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-function"
msgid ""
"Display the full documentation of FUNCTION (a symbol).\n"
"Interactively, read FUNCTION in the minibuffer with completion."
msgstr ""
"FUNCTION (記号) の説明を全て出す.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, FUNCTION をミニバッファで (補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--variable-names"
msgid "Return the names of all variables, sorted."
msgstr "全ての変数の名前を, 順に並べて返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--command-names"
msgid "Return the names of all commands, sorted."
msgstr "全てのコマンドの名前を, 順に並べて返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--read-symbol"
msgid "Read a symbol with PROMPT, completing in NAMES."
msgstr "PROMPT で記号を読む (NAMES から補完する)."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help-variable-text"
msgid "Return the text of the help of VARIABLE (a symbol)."
msgstr "VARIABLE (記号)のヘルプの文章を返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-variable"
msgid ""
"Display the full documentation of VARIABLE (a symbol).\n"
"Interactively, read VARIABLE in the minibuffer with completion."
msgstr ""
"VARIABLE (記号)の完全な説明を出す.\n"
"対話では, VARIABLE をミニバッファで (補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-command"
msgid ""
"Display the full documentation of COMMAND (a symbol).\n"
"Interactively, read COMMAND in the minibuffer with completion."
msgstr ""
"COMMAND (記号)の完全な説明を出す.\n"
"対話では, COMMAND をミニバッファで (補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-symbol"
msgid ""
"Display the full documentation of SYMBOL.\n"
"Show the function and the variable of that name, if there are any.\n"
"Interactively, read SYMBOL in the minibuffer with completion."
msgstr ""
"SYMBOL の完全な説明を出す.\n"
"その名前の関数と変数があれば, 両方を出す.\n"
"対話では, SYMBOL をミニバッファで (補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--key-name"
msgid "Return the name of KEY, as `read-key' returned it, in the notation of key bindings."
msgstr "`read-key' が返した KEY を, キーの割り当ての書き方の名前にして返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--read-key-sequence"
msgid "Read keys with PROMPT until they make a complete key sequence; return it as a string such as \"C-x C-f\"."
msgstr "キーを, 1 つのキーの並びになるまで PROMPT で読んで, \"C-x C-f\" のような文字列で返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--key-command"
msgid "Return the name of the command KEYS (a string such as \"C-x C-f\") runs, or #f."
msgstr "KEYS (\"C-x C-f\" のような文字列)が動かすコマンドの名前を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-key"
msgid ""
"Display documentation of the function invoked by KEY.\n"
"Interactively, read the key sequence after the prompt."
msgstr ""
"KEY が呼ぶ関数の説明を出す.\n"
"対話では, 促しの後で, キーの並びを読む."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-key-briefly"
msgid ""
"Print the name of the function KEY invokes.  KEY is a string such as \"C-x C-f\".\n"
"Interactively, read the key sequence after the prompt."
msgstr ""
"KEY が呼ぶ関数の名前を出す. KEY は \"C-x C-f\" のような文字列.\n"
"対話では, 促しの後で, キーの並びを読む."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:where-is"
msgid ""
"Print message listing the key sequences that invoke the command DEFINITION.\n"
"Interactively, read the command name in the minibuffer with completion."
msgstr ""
"コマンド DEFINITION を呼ぶキーの並びを, メッセージに出す.\n"
"対話では, コマンドの名前をミニバッファで (補完しながら) 聞く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-bindings"
msgid "Display a buffer showing a list of all defined keys, and their definitions."
msgstr "定義された全てのキーと, その定義の一覧を, バッファに出す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:view-lossage"
msgid "Display the last 300 input keystrokes."
msgstr "最近の 300 個のキーを出す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--wrap"
msgid "Return TEXT with its lines broken between words so that none is longer than WIDTH."
msgstr "TEXT を, どの行も WIDTH より長くならないように, 単語の間で折り返して返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:view-echo-area-messages"
msgid ""
"View the log of recent echo-area messages: the `*Messages*' buffer.\n"
"The buffer is shown in another window.  A screen that does not write the messages\n"
"into the buffer by itself gets the log of `message' here."
msgstr ""
"エコー領域のメッセージの最近の記録 (`*Messages*' バッファ)を見る.\n"
"バッファは別の窓に出す. メッセージを自分でバッファに書かない画面では, ここで `message' の記録を書く."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help-for-help"
msgid ""
"You have typed \\[help-for-help], the help character.  Type a Help option.\n"
"The options are listed in the *Help* buffer."
msgstr ""
"\\[help-for-help] は, ヘルプの文字です. ヘルプの選択肢を打ってください.\n"
"選択肢は *Help* バッファに出る."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help-quit"
msgid "Just exit from the help command's prompt."
msgstr "ヘルプのコマンドの促しから抜ける (それだけ)."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help-quick-toggle"
msgid "Toggle the display of the short help of the common help commands."
msgstr "よく使うヘルプのコマンドの短い説明の表示を, 切り替える."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:search-forward-help-for-help"
msgid "Search forward in the help for help text."
msgstr "ヘルプの説明の文章を, 前向きに探す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--syntax-description"
msgid "Return the description of the syntax class character CLASS."
msgstr "構文の種類の文字 CLASS の説明を返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--char-string"
msgid "Return CODE as a string, control characters as ^X."
msgstr "CODE を文字列にして返す (制御文字は ^X)."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--syntax-run"
msgid "Return the line that says the characters START to END have the syntax CLASS."
msgstr "文字 START から END が, 構文 CLASS であることを言う行を返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:help--syntax-text"
msgid "Return the text of the syntax table of the current buffer, for the ASCII characters."
msgstr "今のバッファの構文表を, ASCII の文字について, 文章にして返す."

#: lisp/help.scm
msgctxt "function:describe-syntax"
msgid ""
"Describe the syntax specifications in the syntax table of the current buffer.\n"
"The ASCII characters are listed in runs that have the same syntax."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファの構文表の指定を説明する.\n"
"ASCII の文字を, 同じ構文が続く範囲ごとに並べる."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-try-functions-list"
msgid ""
"The list of expansion functions tried in order by `hippie-expand'.\n"
"To change the behavior of `hippie-expand', remove, change the order of,\n"
"or insert functions in this list."
msgstr ""
"`hippie-expand' が順に試す, 展開の関数の並び.\n"
"`hippie-expand' の動きを変えるには, この並びの関数を除く, 順を変える, 足す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-verbose"
msgid "Non-nil makes `hippie-expand' output which function it is trying."
msgstr "nil でなければ, `hippie-expand' は試している関数を出す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-dabbrev-skip-space"
msgid "Non-nil means tolerate trailing spaces in the abbreviation to expand."
msgstr "nil でなければ, 展開する略語の後ろの空白を許す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-dabbrev-as-symbol"
msgid "Non-nil means expand as symbols, i.e. syntax `_' is considered a letter."
msgstr "nil でなければ, シンボルとして展開する (構文 `_' を文字と見なす)."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-no-restriction"
msgid "Non-nil means that narrowed buffers are widened during search."
msgstr "nil でなければ, 探す間, ナローイングしたバッファを広げる."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-max-buffers"
msgid ""
"The maximum number of buffers (apart from the current) searched.\n"
"If nil, all buffers are searched."
msgstr ""
"(今のバッファの他に) 探すバッファの数の上限.\n"
"nil なら, 全てのバッファを探す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-ignore-buffers"
msgid ""
"A list specifying which buffers not to search (if not current).\n"
"Can contain both regexps matching buffer names (as strings) and major modes (as atoms)."
msgstr ""
"(今のバッファでなければ) 探さないバッファの並び.\n"
"バッファの名前に合う正規表現 (文字列) と, メジャーモード (記号) を入れられる."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:hippie-expand-only-buffers"
msgid ""
"A list specifying the only buffers to search (in addition to current).\n"
"Can contain both regexps matching buffer names (as strings) and major modes (as atoms).\n"
"If non-nil, this variable overrides the variable `hippie-expand-ignore-buffers'."
msgstr ""
"(今のバッファの他に) 探すバッファを, これだけにする並び.\n"
"バッファの名前に合う正規表現 (文字列) と, メジャーモード (記号) を入れられる.\n"
"nil でなければ, 変数 `hippie-expand-ignore-buffers' より優先する."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--markers"
msgid "Make the markers `he-string-beg', `he-string-end' and `he-search-loc' in the current buffer."
msgstr "今のバッファに, 印 `he-string-beg', `he-string-end', `he-search-loc' を作る."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:hippie-expand"
msgid ""
"Try to expand text before point, using multiple methods.\n"
"The expansion functions in `hippie-expand-try-functions-list' are\n"
"tried in order, until a possible expansion is found.  Repeated\n"
"application of `hippie-expand' inserts successively possible\n"
"expansions.\n"
"With a positive numeric argument, jumps directly to the ARG next\n"
"function in this list.  With a negative argument or just \\[universal-argument],\n"
"undoes the expansion."
msgstr ""
"点の前の文字を, いくつもの方法で展開してみる.\n"
"`hippie-expand-try-functions-list' の展開の関数を, 展開が見つかるまで順に試す.\n"
"`hippie-expand' を続けて使うと, 次々に別の展開を入れる.\n"
"正の数の引数なら, この並びの ARG 個先の関数へ飛ぶ.\n"
"負の引数か, \\[universal-argument] だけなら, 展開を元に戻す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-init-string"
msgid "Initialize the string to expand: the text from BEG to END."
msgstr "展開する文字を, BEG から END までの本文にする."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-reset-string"
msgid "Put back the string being expanded."
msgstr "展開している文字を元に戻す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-substitute-string"
msgid "Replace the string being expanded with STR, transferring its case if TRANS-CASE."
msgstr "展開している文字を STR に置き換える. TRANS-CASE なら, 大文字と小文字を写す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-capitalize-first"
msgid "Return STR in lower case, with its first word character in upper case."
msgstr "STR を小文字にし, 最初の単語の文字だけを大文字にして返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-transfer-case"
msgid "Return TO-STR in the case of FROM-STR."
msgstr "TO-STR を, FROM-STR の大文字と小文字にして返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-string-member"
msgid "Return non-nil if STR (in the case of the string to expand, if TRANS-CASE) is in LST."
msgstr "STR (TRANS-CASE なら, 展開する文字の大文字と小文字にしたもの) が LST に有れば, nil でないものを返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he-buffer-member"
msgid "Return non-nil if the current buffer's major mode or name is matched by LST."
msgstr "今のバッファのメジャーモードか名前が LST に合えば, nil でないものを返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--result"
msgid "Substitute EXPANSION (transferring the case if TRANS-CASE) and return #t; or reset the string and return #f."
msgstr "EXPANSION に置き換えて (TRANS-CASE なら大文字と小文字を写して) #t を返す. EXPANSION が無ければ, 文字を元に戻して #f を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "variable:he-file-name-chars"
msgid "Characters that may be part of a file name."
msgstr "ファイルの名前に使える文字."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--file-name-all-completions"
msgid "Return the names of the files in DIR starting with NAME (directories end in a slash)."
msgstr "DIR のファイルのうち, NAME で始まるものの名前を返す (ディレクトリはスラッシュで終わる)."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--file-name-completion"
msgid "Return the longest common prefix of the files in DIR starting with NAME, #t for a unique exact match, or #f."
msgstr "DIR のファイルのうち, NAME で始まるものの名前の共通の頭を返す. 一つだけで全く同じなら #t, 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--file-name-parts"
msgid "Return the name part and the directory part of `he-search-string'."
msgstr "`he-search-string' の名前の部分と, ディレクトリの部分を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-complete-file-name"
msgid ""
"Try to complete text as a file name.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"文字を, ファイルの名前として補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-complete-file-name-partially"
msgid ""
"Try to complete text as a file name, as many characters as unique.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function.  It\n"
"returns t if a unique, possibly partial, completion is found, nil\n"
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"文字を, ファイルの名前として, 一つに決まる所まで補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil にする.\n"
"一つに決まる (一部でもよい) 補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--lisp-symbols"
msgid "Return the names of the defined symbols starting with PREFIX, sorted."
msgstr "定義されたシンボルのうち, PREFIX で始まるものの名前を, 順に並べて返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-complete-lisp-symbol"
msgid ""
"Try to complete word as an Emacs Lisp symbol.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"単語を, Emacs Lisp のシンボルとして補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-complete-lisp-symbol-partially"
msgid ""
"Try to complete as an Emacs Lisp symbol, as many characters as unique.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function.  It\n"
"returns t if a unique, possibly partial, completion is found, nil\n"
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lisp のシンボルとして, 一つに決まる所まで補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil にする.\n"
"一つに決まる (一部でもよい) 補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--search-around"
msgid ""
"Search backward from the string to expand with SEARCH, then forward.\n"
"BEG is the start of the string on the first call (OLD is false)."
msgstr ""
"展開する文字から, SEARCH で後ろへ, 次に前へ探す.\n"
"BEG は, 最初に呼ぶとき (OLD が偽) の, 文字の始まり."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--all-buffers"
msgid "Search the other buffers with SEARCH-FUNCTION for an expansion of the text from BEG-FUNCTION."
msgstr "BEG-FUNCTION の位置からの文字の展開を, ほかのバッファから SEARCH-FUNCTION で探す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-line"
msgid ""
"Try to complete the current line to an entire line in the buffer.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"今の行を, バッファの中の行全体に補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-line-all-buffers"
msgid ""
"Try to complete the current line, searching all other buffers.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"今の行を, ほかの全てのバッファから探して補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-list"
msgid ""
"Try to complete the current beginning of a list.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"今のリストの始まりを補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-list-all-buffers"
msgid ""
"Try to complete the current list, searching all other buffers.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"今のリストを, ほかの全てのバッファから探して補完してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-all-abbrevs"
msgid ""
"Try to expand word before point according to all abbrev tables.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible expansions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new expansion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"点の前の単語を, 全ての略語の表で展開してみる.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の展開) は t にする.\n"
"新しい展開が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-dabbrev"
msgid ""
"Try to expand word \"dynamically\", searching the current buffer.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible expansions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new expansion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"単語を「動的に」展開してみる. 今のバッファを探す.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の展開) は t にする.\n"
"新しい展開が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-dabbrev-all-buffers"
msgid ""
"Try to expand word \"dynamically\", searching all other buffers.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible expansions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new expansion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"単語を「動的に」展開してみる. ほかの全てのバッファを探す.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の展開) は t にする.\n"
"新しい展開が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:he--kill-ring"
msgid "Return the strings in the kill ring, the most recent first."
msgstr "kill-ring の文字列を, 新しいものから順に返す."

#: lisp/hippie-exp.scm
msgctxt "function:try-expand-dabbrev-from-kill"
msgid ""
"Try to expand word \"dynamically\", searching the kill ring.\n"
"The argument OLD has to be nil the first call of this function, and t\n"
"for subsequent calls (for further possible completions of the same\n"
"string).  It returns t if a new completion is found, nil otherwise."
msgstr ""
"単語を「動的に」展開してみる. kill-ring を探す.\n"
"引数 OLD は, この関数を最初に呼ぶときは nil, 続けて呼ぶとき (同じ文字の次の補完) は t にする.\n"
"新しい補完が見つかれば t, 見つからなければ nil を返す."

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-directory"
msgid "Directory where memos are stored."
msgstr "メモを置くディレクトリ"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-file-name-format"
msgid ""
"Format of a new memo file name, relative to `howm-directory'.\n"
"It is passed to `format-time-string'."
msgstr "メモのファイルの名前 (format-time-string の書式. howm-directory からのパス)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-file-name-regexp"
msgid "Regexp of the file names treated as memos."
msgstr "メモのファイルの名前 (正規表現. これに合うファイルを, メモとして扱う)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-excluded-file-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp of the paths not treated as memos.\n"
"The menu file, the history, backups and so on match it."
msgstr "メモとして扱わないファイル (パスの正規表現. メニューのファイル, 履歴, バックアップなど)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-file"
msgid ""
"Menu file, or #f to use the default one in `howm-directory'.\n"
"The default menu is written if the file does not exist."
msgstr "メニューのファイル (無ければ, 既定のメニューを書く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-schedule-days"
msgid "Number of days of the schedule shown in the menu, counted from today."
msgstr "メニューに出す, 予定の日数 (今日から), todo の数, 最近のメモの数, ランダムなメモの数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-todo-num"
msgid "Number of todo items shown in the menu."
msgstr "メニューに出す todo の数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-recent-num"
msgid "Number of recent memos shown in the menu."
msgstr "メニューに出す, 最近のメモの数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-random-num"
msgid "Number of random memos shown in the menu."
msgstr "メニューに出す, 無作為に選んだメモの数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-allow"
msgid "Procedures that %here% in the menu may call."
msgstr "メニューの %here% で呼べる手続き"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-view-title-header"
msgid "String that starts the title line of a memo."
msgstr "メモの題の行の始め"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-date-format"
msgid "Format of a date inserted into a memo."
msgstr "日付と日時の書式 (メモを作るとき, 日付を入れるときに使う)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-dtime-format"
msgid "Format of a date and time inserted into a memo."
msgstr "メモに入れる日時の書式"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-view-contents"
msgid ""
"If true, show the memo of the current line in the other window.\n"
"This is used when moving in the summary buffer."
msgstr "一覧で動くと, その行のメモを, もう 1 つの窓に出す (#f なら出さない)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-history-file"
msgid ""
"File of the search history.\n"
"If #f, use .howm-history in `howm-directory'."
msgstr "検索の履歴のファイル (#f なら, howm-directory の .howm-history) と, 覚える数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-history-limit"
msgid "Number of keywords kept in the search history."
msgstr "検索の履歴に残すキーワードの数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-date-repeat-max"
msgid "Maximum number of lines added when repeating a date (~yymmdd)."
msgstr "日付を繰り返すとき (~yymmdd) に, 足す行の数の上限"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-name"
msgid "Name of the menu buffer."
msgstr "メニュー, 一覧, 速記のバッファの名前"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-summary-name"
msgid "Name of the summary buffer."
msgstr "一覧のバッファの名前"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-remember-name"
msgid "Name of the buffer for quick notes (`howm-remember')."
msgstr "手早く書くメモ (`howm-remember') のバッファの名前"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-set-mode-on-find-file"
msgid ""
"If true, turn on `howm-mode' for memos opened by \\[find-file].\n"
"If #f, only memos opened from howm use it."
msgstr "C-x C-f などで開いたメモも, メモのバッファ (howm-mode) にする (#f なら, howm から開いたメモだけ)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-refresh-after-save"
msgid "If true, underline the memo again after saving it."
msgstr "保存したら, 下線を引き直す. メニューを出していれば, 出し直す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-refresh-after-save"
msgid "If true, refresh the menu after saving a memo."
msgstr "真なら, メモを保存したあとに, メニューを作り直す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-after-save-hook"
msgid "Hook run after saving a memo."
msgstr "メモを保存したあとに実行するフック"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-default-menu"
msgid ""
"Default menu, written when the menu file does not exist.\n"
"It is taken from ja/0000-00-00-000000.txt of howm."
msgstr "既定のメニュー (howm の ja/0000-00-00-000000.txt から, この版で使えるものを残した)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-buttons"
msgid ""
"Alist of button labels and commands.\n"
"A command marked menu runs in the menu; the others run in the buffer\n"
"shown before the menu."
msgstr "ボタンの名前と, コマンド. menu と書いたものはメニューで, ほかはメニューを開く前のバッファで動かす"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-summary-items"
msgid ""
"Items of the current summary, a list of (FILE LINE TEXT).\n"
"If FILE is #f, TEXT is searched for."
msgstr "今の一覧の項目 ((ファイル 行の番号 文字) のリスト. ファイルが #f なら, 文字を探す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-data"
msgid ""
"Data of each menu buffer.\n"
"A list of (BUFFER-NAME REFRESH SHORTCUTS ITEMS FILE)."
msgstr "メニューのバッファごとの, ((バッファの名前 出し直す手続き ショートカット 項目 ファイル) ...)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-previous-buffer"
msgid "Name of the buffer shown before the menu."
msgstr "メニューと速記を開く前のバッファの名前"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-remember-previous-buffer"
msgid "Name of the buffer shown before `howm-remember'."
msgstr "`howm-remember' の前に出していたバッファの名前"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-history-list"
msgid "Search history, newest first, or #f before it is loaded."
msgstr "検索の履歴 (新しい順. 読む前は #f) と, キーワード (\"<<< 言葉\" の言葉. 集める前は #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-keyword-cache"
msgid "Keywords (words of \"<<< word\"), or #f before they are collected."
msgstr "キーワード (\"<<< 語\" の語). 集める前は #f"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-replace-all"
msgid "Return TEXT with every FROM replaced by TO."
msgstr "文字列の中の from を, 全て to にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-take"
msgid "Return the first N elements of ITEMS."
msgstr "ITEMS の始めの N 個を返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-drop"
msgid "Return ITEMS without the first N elements."
msgstr "ITEMS から, 始めの N 個を除いたものを返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-unique"
msgid "Return ITEMS without duplicates, keeping the first ones."
msgstr "同じものを除く (始めのものを残す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-range"
msgid "Return the list of numbers from 0 to N - 1."
msgstr "0 から n - 1 までの数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-index-of"
msgid "Return the position of ITEM in ITEMS, counted from 0, or #f."
msgstr "リストの中の位置 (0 から. 無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-pick"
msgid "Return a random element of ITEMS."
msgstr "ランダムに 1 つ"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-floor"
msgid "Return X rounded down."
msgstr "数の切り捨て"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-case-fold"
msgid ""
"Make REGEXP ignore case if KEYWORD has no upper case letters.\n"
"This is the same as howm."
msgstr "大文字を含まなければ, 大文字と小文字を区別しない正規表現にする (howm と同じ)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-matches"
msgid ""
"Return the positions of the matches of REGEXP in LINE.\n"
"Each element is the list of (START END) of the match and of each group,\n"
"counted in characters.  A group that did not match is #f."
msgstr "行の中の, 正規表現に合う所の位置のリスト. それぞれ, 合った所と括弧ごとの (始め 終わり) (文字の数. 合わなかった括弧は #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-group"
msgid "Return the text of LINE at POSITION, a list of (START END)."
msgstr "位置 ((始め 終わり)) の文字"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-replace-matches"
msgid "Replace each match of REGEXP in LINE with (PROC LINE POSITION)."
msgstr "正規表現に合う所を, 全て (proc 行 位置) の文字にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-trim-trailing-lines"
msgid "Return LINES without the empty lines at the end."
msgstr "終わりの空の行を除く"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-pad2"
msgid "Return N as a string of 2 digits, such as \"01\"."
msgstr "2 桁の数 (1 → \"01\")"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-day"
msgid "Number of seconds in a day."
msgstr "1 日の秒の数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-day-of-week-names"
msgid "Names of the days of the week in Japanese, from Sunday."
msgstr "曜日の名前 (日本語. 日曜から)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-time"
msgid ""
"Return the time of DATE at noon.\n"
"Noon keeps the date right across daylight saving time."
msgstr "日付の時刻 (その日の昼. 夏時間でずれないように)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-today-date"
msgid "Return the date of today, such as \"2026-10-25\"."
msgstr "今日の日付"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-shift"
msgid "Return the date DAYS days after DATE."
msgstr "日付の n 日後"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-day-of-week"
msgid "Return the day of the week of DATE in Japanese."
msgstr "曜日 (日, 月, ...)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-parts"
msgid "Return the year, the month and the day of DATE as numbers."
msgstr "年, 月, 日の数と, 日付"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-make-date"
msgid "Return the date of year Y, month M and day D."
msgstr "Y 年 M 月 D 日の日付を返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-days-in-month"
msgid "Return the number of days of month M of year Y."
msgstr "月の日数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-add-months"
msgid ""
"Return the date MONTHS months after DATE.\n"
"The day is limited to the end of the month."
msgstr "日付の n か月後 (日は, その月の終わりまでにする)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-expand"
msgid ""
"Return the date written as DIGITS (yyyymmdd, yymmdd, mmdd or dd).\n"
"Omitted parts and parts of 0 are taken from BASE."
msgstr "数字 (yyyymmdd, yymmdd, mmdd, dd) の日付. 省いた所 (と 0 の所) は, base の年, 月, 日にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-dir"
msgid "Return the absolute path of `howm-directory'."
msgstr "メモのディレクトリ (絶対パス)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-files"
msgid ""
"Return the memo files, sorted by name.\n"
"Files matching `howm-excluded-file-regexp' are excluded."
msgstr "メモのファイル (名前の順). 除くファイルは, howm-directory からのパスで決める"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-memo-file?"
msgid "Return #t if FILE is under `howm-directory'."
msgstr "howm-directory の下のファイルなら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-file-label"
msgid "Return the name of FILE without its directory and .txt."
msgstr "ファイルの名前 (ディレクトリと .txt を除く. 一覧に出す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-file-directory"
msgid "Return the directory of FILE."
msgstr "ファイルのディレクトリ"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-title-line?"
msgid "Return #t if LINE is a title line, which starts with \"= \"."
msgstr "題の行なら #t (\"= \" で始まる行)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-title-of"
msgid "Return the title of the title LINE."
msgstr "題の行の, 題"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-title"
msgid ""
"Return the title of the memo FILE, or \"\" if it has none.\n"
"The title is the first line starting with \"= \"."
msgstr "メモの題 (最初の \"= \" の行. 無ければ空)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-title-or-label"
msgid "Return the title of FILE, or its name if it has no title."
msgstr "題 (無ければ, ファイルの名前)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-recent-files"
msgid "Return the memo files, newest first by modification time."
msgstr "新しい順 (更新の時刻)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-random-files"
msgid "Return N random memo files."
msgstr "ランダムに n 個"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-new-file"
msgid ""
"Return the path of a new memo file.\n"
"If the file exists, use a time one second later."
msgstr "新しいメモのファイルのパス (同じ名前のファイルがあれば, 1 秒ずつ後の時刻にする)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-write-memo"
msgid "Write a new memo with TITLE, the date and time, and LINES."
msgstr "新しいメモを書く (題, 日時, 本文の行)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-come-from-regexp"
msgid "Regexp of a keyword definition, \"<<< word\"."
msgstr "キーワード (メモの \"<<< 言葉\" の言葉. 集めたものを使い回す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-keywords"
msgid ""
"Return the keywords, the words of \"<<< word\" in the memos.\n"
"The collected keywords are reused."
msgstr ""
"キーワード (メモの \"<<< 語\" の語) を返す.\n"
"集めたキーワードは, 使い回す."

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-keyword-regexp"
msgid "Return a regexp matching any of KEYWORDS, longer ones first."
msgstr "キーワードのどれかに合う正規表現 (長いものを先に)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-set-buffer-text"
msgid "Replace the whole text of the current buffer with TEXT."
msgstr "バッファの本文を, 全て置き換える"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-current-line"
msgid "Return the line number of point, counted from 1."
msgstr "カーソルの行の番号 (1 から)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-line-start"
msgid "Return the position of the start of LINE in TEXT, counted from 1."
msgstr "行の始めの位置 (1 から)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-current-line-start"
msgid "Return the position of the start of the current line."
msgstr "カーソルの行の始めの位置"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-current-line-and-column"
msgid "Return the current line and the column of point in it, counted from 0."
msgstr "カーソルの行の文字と, 行の中の位置 (0 から)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-replace-in-line"
msgid ""
"Replace the text from FROM to TO in the current line with TEXT.\n"
"FROM and TO are columns.  Point does not move."
msgstr "カーソルの行の, from から to まで (行の中の位置) を, text にする. カーソルは動かさない"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-section-range"
msgid ""
"Return the range of the memo containing LINE in LINES.\n"
"A memo runs from a title line to the line before the next title line.\n"
"LINE counts from 1; the range is (START END), counted from 0, END excluded."
msgstr "行の中の, line 行目 (1 から) を含むメモ (題の行から, 次の題の行の前まで) の, 始めと終わりの行 (0 から. 終わりは含まない)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-lines-in"
msgid "Return the lines of LINES in RANGE."
msgstr "行の中の, 範囲の行"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-current-section"
msgid "Return the lines of the memo at point."
msgstr "カーソルのメモ (題の行から, 次の題の行の前まで) の行"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-current-title"
msgid "Return the title of the memo at point, or #f."
msgstr "カーソルのメモの題 (無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-switch-back"
msgid "Switch to the buffer NAME if it exists."
msgstr "バッファがあれば, そこへ移る"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-open"
msgid "Open FILE and go to LINE."
msgstr "ファイルを開いて, 行へ動く"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-mode"
msgid ""
"Make the current buffer a memo buffer.\n"
"RET runs actions and links are underlined.  The keywords are collected again."
msgstr "メモのバッファにする (RET で動かし, 下線を引く. キーワードは集め直す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-set-mode-p"
msgid ""
"Return #t if the current buffer visits a memo file.\n"
"The file must be under `howm-directory' and match `howm-file-name-regexp'."
msgstr "今のバッファが, メモのファイルなら #t (howm-directory の下で, howm-file-name-regexp に合う)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-find-file-hook"
msgid ""
"Turn on `howm-mode' when a memo is opened.\n"
"This is added to `find-file-hook'."
msgstr "ファイルを開いたとき (find-file-hook): メモなら, メモのバッファにする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-after-save"
msgid ""
"Refresh keywords, underlines and the menu after saving a memo.\n"
"This is added to `after-save-hook'."
msgstr "保存したとき (after-save-hook): メモなら, キーワードを集め直し, 下線を引き直し, メニューを出し直す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-refresh-background"
msgid "Refresh the menu if it is shown, and return to the current buffer."
msgstr "メニューを出していれば, 出し直して, 今のバッファに戻る"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-highlight-regexps"
msgid "Regexps to underline, written as JavaScript regexps for the editor."
msgstr "下線を引く正規表現 (画面のエディタの, JavaScript の正規表現で書く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-highlight"
msgid "Underline links, dates, keywords and the regexps in EXTRA again."
msgstr "下線を引き直す (リンク, 日付, キーワードと, extra の正規表現)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-line"
msgid "Return the line of the summary for ITEM."
msgstr "一覧の 1 行"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-show-summary"
msgid ""
"Show ITEMS, a list of (FILE LINE TEXT), in the summary buffer.\n"
"If there are no items, show EMPTY-MESSAGE."
msgstr "項目 ((ファイル 行の番号 文字) のリスト) を, 一覧のバッファに出す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-item"
msgid "Return the item of the current line of the summary, or #f."
msgstr "カーソルの行の項目 (無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-contents"
msgid "Show the memo of the current line in the other window."
msgstr "カーソルの行のメモを, もう 1 つの窓に出す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-open"
msgid ""
"Open the item of the current line.\n"
"If the item has no file, search for its text."
msgstr "カーソルの行の項目を開く (ファイルが無ければ, 文字を探す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-next"
msgid "Move to the next line and show its memo."
msgstr "次と前の行へ動いて, その行のメモを出す (一覧の n と p)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-summary-previous"
msgid "Move to the previous line and show its memo."
msgstr "前の行へ動き, その行のメモを出す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-file-items"
msgid "Return the title lines of FILES as summary items."
msgstr "ファイルごとに, 題の行を項目にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search"
msgid ""
"Search the memos for REGEXP.\n"
"Lines of \"<<< KEYWORD\" come first, then newer files first."
msgstr "正規表現で探して, come-from (<<< 言葉) の行を先に, あとは新しいファイルの順に並べる"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-keyword"
msgid "Search the memos for KEYWORD as a fixed string."
msgstr "言葉 (そのままの文字) で探す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-keyword-with-history"
msgid "Search the memos for KEYWORD and add it to the history."
msgstr "履歴に残して, 言葉で探す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-fixed"
msgid "Read a keyword with completion and search the memos for it."
msgstr "言葉を (キーワードを補完して) 聞いて探す (C-c , s. メニューの s)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-regexp"
msgid "Read a regexp and search the memos for it."
msgstr "正規表現を聞いて探す (C-c , g. メニューの g)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-day"
msgid "Search the memos for the date DAYS days after today."
msgstr "今日から n 日後の日付の, メモ"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-today"
msgid "Search the memos for the date of today."
msgstr "今日と昨日の日付のメモ (メニューの . と :)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-yesterday"
msgid "Search the memos for the date of yesterday."
msgstr "昨日の日付で, メモを探す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-occur"
msgid "Read a regexp and list its matches in the current buffer."
msgstr "今のバッファの中を, 正規表現で探す (C-c , o. メニューの o)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-roma-table"
msgid "Alist of romaji and hiragana."
msgstr "ローマ字と, ひらがなの表"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-hiragana"
msgid "Hiragana letters, in the same order as `howm-katakana'."
msgstr "ひらがな (`howm-katakana' と同じ順)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-katakana"
msgid "Katakana letters, in the same order as `howm-hiragana'."
msgstr "カタカナ (`howm-hiragana' と同じ順)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-roma-lookup"
msgid ""
"Return the romaji spelling at index I of ROMA, or #f.\n"
"The result is (ROMAJI KANA); longer spellings are tried first."
msgstr "ローマ字の, i 文字目からの綴り ((ローマ字 かな). 長いものを先に. 無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-roma-to-hiragana"
msgid ""
"Convert ROMA to hiragana.\n"
"Letters that cannot be converted are kept."
msgstr "ローマ字を, ひらがなにする (かなにできない文字は, そのまま)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-hiragana-to-katakana"
msgid "Convert the hiragana in TEXT to katakana."
msgstr "ひらがなを, カタカナにする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-migemo-regexp"
msgid "Return a regexp matching ROMA as romaji, hiragana or katakana."
msgstr "ローマ字, ひらがな, カタカナのどれかに合う正規表現"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-search-migemo"
msgid ""
"Read romaji and search the memos for it.\n"
"Hiragana and katakana are also searched for."
msgstr "ローマ字を聞いて探す (C-c , m. メニューの m)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-history-path"
msgid "Return the path of the history file."
msgstr "履歴のファイル"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-history-load"
msgid ""
"Return the search history, newest first.\n"
"The history is read from the file the first time."
msgstr "履歴 (新しい順. 始めに, ファイルから読む)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-history-add"
msgid "Add KEYWORD to the search history and write the history file."
msgstr "履歴に足して, ファイルに書く"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-history"
msgid ""
"List the search history.\n"
"RET on a line searches for its keyword."
msgstr "履歴の一覧 (C-c , h. RET で, その言葉を探す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-all"
msgid "List all memos, newest first."
msgstr "全てのメモの一覧 (新しい順. C-c , a)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-recent"
msgid "List the recent memos."
msgstr "最近のメモの一覧 (C-c , l)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-around"
msgid "List all memos with point on the current memo."
msgstr "前後のメモ (全てのメモの一覧で, 今のメモの行にカーソルを置く. C-c , A)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-buffer-links"
msgid ""
"Return the words to search for in the current buffer.\n"
"These are the links and the keywords."
msgstr "今のバッファの, 探せる言葉 (リンクとキーワード)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-random-walk"
msgid ""
"Take one step of a random walk.\n"
"In the summary, open a random line.  In a memo, search for a random link,\n"
"or open a random memo if there are no links.  Call it again to continue."
msgstr "酔歩 (C-c , w): 一覧なら, ランダムな行を開く. メモなら, ランダムなリンクを探す. リンクが無ければ, ランダムなメモを開く. 1 回に 1 歩なので, 続けるときは, もう一度呼ぶ"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-reminder-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp of a reminder, such as [2026-10-25]+7.\n"
"The groups are the date, the type, the laziness and the rest."
msgstr "予定と todo の正規表現 ([2026-10-25]+7 の, 日付, 種類, 猶予, 残り)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-reminder-action-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp of the parts of a reminder that RET acts on.\n"
"The groups are the date, the type and laziness, the type and the laziness."
msgstr "RET で動かす所 (日付, 種類と猶予, 種類, 猶予)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-reminder-laziness"
msgid "Alist of reminder types and their default laziness in days."
msgstr "種類ごとの, 猶予の既定の日数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-huge"
msgid "Priority of the bottom and the top, as howm-huge of howm."
msgstr "底と天井 (howm の howm-huge)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-huge+"
msgid "Priority above `howm-huge'."
msgstr "`howm-huge' より上の優先度"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-huge++"
msgid "Priority above `howm-huge+'."
msgstr "`howm-huge+' より上の優先度"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-priority"
msgid ""
"Return the priority of a reminder of TYPE.\n"
"LATE is the number of days since its date; LAZINESS is in days.\n"
"This is howm-todo-priority-* of howm."
msgstr "優先度 (howm の howm-todo-priority-*). late は, 日付から今までの日数"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-reminders"
msgid ""
"Return the reminders in the memos.\n"
"Each is a list of (PRIORITY DATE TYPE FILE LINE TEXT)."
msgstr "予定と todo の項目 ((優先度 日付 種類 ファイル 行の番号 文字) のリスト)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-reminder-item"
msgid "Return REMINDER as a summary item, (FILE LINE TEXT)."
msgstr "項目を, 一覧の項目 ((ファイル 行の番号 文字)) にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-schedule"
msgid ""
"Return the schedule (@), sorted by date.\n"
"If DAYS is a number, only the next DAYS days from today."
msgstr "予定 (@) を日付の順に. days が数なら, 今日からその日数先まで"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-todo"
msgid ""
"Return the todo items, sorted by priority.\n"
"Schedules, done items and items sunk to the bottom are excluded."
msgstr "todo (@ と . のほか) を優先度の順に (底に沈んだものは除く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-schedule"
msgid "List the schedule."
msgstr "予定と todo の一覧 (C-c , y と C-c , t)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-todo"
msgid "List the todo items."
msgstr "todo を一覧にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-reminder-action"
msgid ""
"Act on the type of the reminder in the current line.\n"
"RET marks it done, x cancels it, a type letter or a number changes the\n"
"type or the laziness.  FROM is the column of the date."
msgstr "予定と todo の記号の上の RET: 済み (RET), 取り消し (x), 種類 (記号) と猶予 (数) を変える. from は, 行の中の, 日付の位置"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-action"
msgid ""
"Act on the date from FROM to TO in the current line.\n"
"RET lists it (unless NEW?), +3 or -1 shifts it, yymmdd changes it, . sets\n"
"today, ~yymmdd repeats it, and [ or ] shifts it by one day."
msgstr "日付の上の RET: 一覧 (RET. new? なら何もしない), ずらす (+3, -1), 変える (yymmdd), 今日 (.), 繰り返す (~yymmdd), 1 日ずつずらす ([ と ]). 日付は, カーソルの行の from から to まで"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-quickshift"
msgid ""
"Shift DATE by DAYS days and call REPLACE with the new date.\n"
"Then read [ or ] to shift it by one more day, or . for today; anything\n"
"else ends."
msgstr "1 日ずつずらす (続けて [ か ] を入れる. . は今日. ほかは終わり)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-date-repeat"
msgid ""
"Repeat the current line below it with the date changed until UNTIL.\n"
"The date is DATE, from FROM to TO in the line."
msgstr "カーソルの行を, until の日付まで, 日付を変えて繰り返す (下に足す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-create-memo"
msgid ""
"Create a new memo with TITLE and open it.\n"
"If TITLE is empty, put point where the title goes."
msgstr "新しいメモを作って開く (題の行と日時を入れる. 題が空なら, 題の所にカーソルを置く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-create"
msgid "Create a new memo."
msgstr "新しいメモ (C-c , c)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-wiki"
msgid ""
"Act on [[KEYWORD]].\n"
"Create a memo of \"<<< KEYWORD\" if there is none, or search for it.\n"
"If KEYWORD is %name%, open that menu."
msgstr "[[言葉]] の上の RET: \"<<< 言葉\" のメモが無ければ作り, あれば探す. %名前% なら, そのメニューを開く"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-remember"
msgid ""
"Write a quick note in a buffer of its own.\n"
"\\[howm-remember-submit] saves it as a new memo whose title is its first line.\n"
"\\[howm-remember-discard] discards it."
msgstr "速記 (C-c , e): *howm-remember* に書いて, C-c C-c で新しいメモにする (1 行目が題). C-c C-k で取り消す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-remember-close"
msgid "Kill the quick note buffer and return to the previous buffer."
msgstr "速記のバッファを消して, 前のバッファに戻る"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-remember-submit"
msgid "Save the quick note as a new memo."
msgstr "手早く書いたメモを, 新しいメモとして保存する"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-remember-discard"
msgid "Discard the quick note."
msgstr "手早く書いたメモを捨てる"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-dup"
msgid "Copy the memo at point to a new memo and open it."
msgstr "複製 (C-c , D): カーソルのメモ (題の行から, 次の題の行の前まで) を, 新しいメモにして開く"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-title-to-kill-ring"
msgid ""
"Put the title of the memo at point in the kill ring.\n"
"If it has no title, use the file name."
msgstr "カーソルのメモの題を, kill ring に入れる (無ければ, ファイルの名前. C-c , K)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-name-to-kill-ring"
msgid "Put the file name of the current buffer in the kill ring."
msgstr "ファイルの名前を, kill ring に入れる"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-insert-keyword"
msgid "Read a keyword with completion and insert it."
msgstr "キーワードを補完して入れる (C-c , i)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-insert-date"
msgid "Insert the date of today and act on it as RET on a date does."
msgstr "今日の日付を入れて, 日付の RET と同じく変えられるようにする (C-c , d)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-insert-dtime"
msgid "Insert the current date and time."
msgstr "今の日時を入れる (C-c , T)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-buffer?"
msgid ""
"Return #t if NAME is a howm buffer.\n"
"Memos, the menu, the summary and quick notes are howm buffers."
msgstr "howm のバッファ (メモ, メニュー, 一覧, 速記) なら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-kill-all"
msgid "Kill all howm buffers except modified ones."
msgstr "howm のバッファを全て消す (書き換えたものは残す. C-c , Q)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-list-buffers"
msgid "List the buffers."
msgstr "バッファの一覧 (C-c , b)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-refresh"
msgid "Underline the current buffer again, or refresh it if it is the menu."
msgstr "下線を引き直す (メニューなら, 出し直す. C-c , r)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-settings"
msgid "Open the init file."
msgstr "初期設定ファイルを開く ([設定])"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-link-action"
msgid ""
"Act on the word of \">>> KEYWORD\".\n"
"If KEYWORD is %name%, open that menu; otherwise search for it."
msgstr ">>> の言葉 (%名前% なら, そのメニューを開く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-action-rules"
msgid ""
"Return the rules of the parts that RET acts on.\n"
"Each is (REGEXP GROUP MAKE-ACTION); earlier rules win.\n"
"If MENU? is true, the rules of the menu are included."
msgstr "RET で動く所の規則 ((正規表現 位置の括弧 動きを作る手続き) のリスト). 先のものを優先する"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-line-actions"
msgid ""
"Return the parts of LINE that RET acts on, a list of (START END ACTION).\n"
"If MENU? is true, the rules of the menu are used too."
msgstr "行の中の, RET で動く所 ((始め 終わり 動き) のリスト. 規則の順)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-action-at"
msgid ""
"Return the action at COLUMN of LINE, or #f.\n"
"If MENU? is true, the rules of the menu are used too."
msgstr "行の中の, 位置 (0 から) で動くもの (無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-run-action"
msgid "Run ACTION."
msgstr "動かす"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-action-at-point"
msgid "Run the action at point.  Return #t if there was one."
msgstr "カーソルの所のものを動かす. 動かしたら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-open-item"
msgid ""
"Open the menu item of the current line among ITEMS.\n"
"On a reminder type or a date, act on it in the memo.  Return #t if opened."
msgstr "メニューの項目を開く. 予定と todo の記号か日付の上なら, メモのその所で RET を押す. 開いたら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-action"
msgid ""
"Act on the thing at point.\n"
"In the summary, open the memo of the line.  In the menu, open the item.\n"
"On a button or a link, run it."
msgstr "RET: 一覧なら, その行のメモを開く. メニューの項目なら開く. ボタンやリンクなら動かす"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-action-or-newline"
msgid ""
"Act on the thing at point, or insert a newline if there is none.\n"
"This is RET in memo buffers."
msgstr "動くものがあれば動かし, 無ければ改行する (メモのバッファの RET)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-buffer?"
msgid "Return #t if the current buffer is a menu."
msgstr "メニューのバッファなら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-keyword?"
msgid "Return #t if KEYWORD has the form %name%."
msgstr "%名前% の形なら #t"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-button"
msgid "Return the button of LABEL, (LABEL COMMAND [menu]), or #f."
msgstr "ボタン ((名前 コマンド [menu])). 無ければ #f"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-in-previous"
msgid "Call THUNK in the buffer shown before the menu."
msgstr "メニューを開く前のバッファに戻って, 動かす"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-run-button"
msgid "Press the button of LABEL."
msgstr "ボタンを押す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-path"
msgid ""
"Return the path of the menu file.\n"
"Write the default menu if the file does not exist."
msgstr "メニューのファイル (無ければ, 既定のメニューを書く)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-section-of"
msgid ""
"Return the memo of \"<<< KEYWORD\" in TEXT, or #f.\n"
"It runs from the title line to the line before the next title line."
msgstr "文字の中の, \"<<< 言葉\" の題の行から, 次の題の行の前まで (無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-find-section"
msgid ""
"Find the menu of \"<<< KEYWORD\".\n"
"The menu file is searched first, then the memos.\n"
"Return (FILE TEXT), or #f."
msgstr "\"<<< %名前%\" のメニュー ((ファイル 文字). メニューのファイル, メモの順に探す. 無ければ #f)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-current-data"
msgid "Return the entry of `howm-menu-data' for the current buffer, or #f."
msgstr "今のメニューのバッファの, データ (無ければ #f) と項目"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-items"
msgid "Return the items of the current menu buffer."
msgstr "今のメニューのバッファの項目を返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu"
msgid "Show the howm menu."
msgstr "メニューを出す (M-x howm, C-c , ,)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm"
msgid "Show the howm menu."
msgstr "howm のメニューを出す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-open-section"
msgid "Show the menu of \"<<< KEYWORD\" (>>> %name%)."
msgstr "\"<<< %名前%\" のメニューを出す (>>> %名前%)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-open"
msgid ""
"Show FILE, relative to `howm-directory', as a menu.\n"
"For example, %eval%(howm-menu-open \"file.txt\")."
msgstr "ファイルを, メニューとして出す (howm-directory からのパス. %eval%(howm-menu-open \"file.txt\"))"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-refresh"
msgid "Refresh the menu."
msgstr "メニューを出し直す ([menu 更新])"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-edit"
msgid "Open the menu file."
msgstr "メニューのファイルを開く ([menu 編集])"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-key-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp of a shortcut in the menu, such as %\"c\"[New] or %\"fuga%\".\n"
"The groups are the word, the key, the rest of the word and the action-only %."
msgstr "メニューのショートカット (%\"c\"[新規] と %\"fuga%\") の正規表現 (言葉, キー, 言葉の続き, 動くだけの %)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-line-shortcuts"
msgid ""
"Return the shortcuts of LINE of the menu, a list of (KEY ACTION).\n"
"A shortcut runs the first action after its \"."
msgstr "メニューの元の 1 行の, ショートカット ((キー 動き) のリスト). \" の後の, 最初の動くものを動かす"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-visible"
msgid ""
"Return (TEXT HIDDEN) for LINE of the menu.\n"
"TEXT is the part made visible by %|; HIDDEN is #t if the end of the line\n"
"is hidden, and then the newline is removed too."
msgstr "%| で切り替える, 見せる所だけの文字と, 行の終わりを見せないなら #t (改行も消す)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-display-rules"
msgid "Rules that turn %sdays and others into the form of %here%."
msgstr "%sdays などを, %here% の形にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "variable:howm-menu-here-regexp"
msgid "Regexp of %here%."
msgstr "%here% の正規表現"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-here"
msgid ""
"Return the value of the %here% expression TEXT.\n"
"It is the value of a variable, or of a procedure in `howm-menu-allow'.\n"
"The arguments are not evaluated."
msgstr "%here% の式の値 (変数の値か, howm-menu-allow の手続きを呼んだ値. 引数は評価しない)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-value-lines"
msgid ""
"Return VALUE as menu lines.\n"
"Each line is a string or (STRING FILE LINE)."
msgstr "値を, メニューの行 (文字か (文字 ファイル 行の番号)) のリストにする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-value-text"
msgid "Return VALUE as a string."
msgstr "値を, 文字にする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-expand"
msgid ""
"Replace the %here% in the visible LINE with its value.\n"
"If LINE is only %here%, it is replaced with the lines of the value."
msgstr "見せる 1 行の %here% を, 値にする (行が %here% だけなら, 値の行に置き換える)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-strip-keys"
msgid "Show the shortcuts of LINE as they look (%\"c\" to c, %\"fuga%\" to fuga)."
msgstr "ショートカットを, 見せる形にする (%\"c\" → c. %\"fuga%\" → fuga)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-render"
msgid ""
"Render the menu TEMPLATE into lines and shortcuts.\n"
"Each line is a string or (STRING FILE LINE)."
msgstr "メニューの元を, 行 (文字か (文字 ファイル 行の番号)) とショートカットにする"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-item-lines"
msgid "Return the item lines of LINES, a list of (LINE FILE FILE-LINE)."
msgstr "行の中の, 項目の行 ((行の番号 ファイル 行の番号))"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-key-command"
msgid ""
"Return the command of the shortcut KEY.\n"
"It runs the action of KEY in the current menu."
msgstr "ショートカットのキーのコマンド (キーごとに作る. 今のメニューの, そのキーの動きを動かす)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-run-key"
msgid "Run the action of the shortcut KEY in the current menu."
msgstr "今のメニューで, ショートカットのキー KEY の動作を実行する"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-show"
msgid ""
"Show the menu NAME, such as %menu%, rendered from TEMPLATE.\n"
"FILE is the file of the template; RELOAD refreshes the menu."
msgstr "メニューを出す. name は %menu% など, file は元のファイル, reload は出し直す手続き"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-legend"
msgid "Return the legend of the reminder types, for %here%."
msgstr "%here% で呼べる手続き (予定と todo の説明, 予定, todo, 最近, ランダム, 検索, 出した時刻)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-reminder-lines"
msgid "Return REMINDERS as menu lines."
msgstr "REMINDERS を, メニューの行にして返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-schedule"
msgid "Return the schedule for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの予定を返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-todo"
msgid "Return the todo items for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの todo を返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-reminder"
msgid "Return the schedule and the todo items for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの予定と todo を返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-file-lines"
msgid "Return FILES as menu lines."
msgstr "FILES を, メニューの行にして返す"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-recent"
msgid "Return the recent memos for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの, 最近のメモを返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-random"
msgid "Return random memos for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの, 無作為に選んだメモを返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-search"
msgid "Return the memos matching KEYWORD for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの, KEYWORD に合うメモを返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/howm.scm
msgctxt "function:howm-menu-last-update"
msgid "Return the current date and time for the menu, for %here%."
msgstr "メニューの, 今の日時を返す (%here% 用)"

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "variable:Info-directory-list"
msgid "List of directories to search for Info files."
msgstr "Info のファイルを探すディレクトリのリスト."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info--file"
msgid "Return the file of MANUAL in `Info-directory-list', or #f."
msgstr "`Info-directory-list' から, MANUAL のファイルを返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info--read"
msgid "Return the text of the Info FILE (decompressed, if it ends in .gz)."
msgstr "Info のファイル FILE の文章を返す (.gz なら, 展開する)."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info--show"
msgid "Show MANUAL in the *info* buffer and return the buffer name."
msgstr "MANUAL を *info* バッファに出して, バッファの名前を返す."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info--manual-argument"
msgid "Return the manual name in ARGS, or read one with PROMPT."
msgstr "ARGS にあるマニュアルの名前を返す. 無ければ, PROMPT で読む."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info"
msgid ""
"Enter Info, the documentation browser.\n"
"Show the Info directory, the list of the manuals.  With a file name argument,\n"
"show that manual."
msgstr ""
"Info (文書の閲覧)に入る.\n"
"Info のディレクトリ (マニュアルの一覧)を出す. ファイル名の引数があれば, そのマニュアルを出す."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info-other-window"
msgid "Like `info' but show the manual in another window."
msgstr "`info' と同じだが, マニュアルを別の窓に出す."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info-display-manual"
msgid "Display an Info buffer showing MANUAL, a manual name such as \"elisp\"."
msgstr "MANUAL (\"elisp\" のようなマニュアルの名前)を出す Info のバッファを出す."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info-emacs-manual"
msgid "Display the Emacs manual in Info mode."
msgstr "Emacs のマニュアルを, Info で出す."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:info--goto-index-entry"
msgid "In the Emacs manual, go to the node of the index entry NAME."
msgstr "Emacs のマニュアルの, 索引の項目 NAME の節へ移る."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:Info-goto-emacs-command-node"
msgid "Go to the Info node in the Emacs manual for command COMMAND."
msgstr "コマンド COMMAND の, Emacs のマニュアルの Info の節へ移る."

#: lisp/info.scm
msgctxt "function:Info-goto-emacs-key-command-node"
msgid ""
"Go to the node in the Emacs manual which describes the command bound to KEY.\n"
"KEY is a string such as \"C-x C-f\"."
msgstr ""
"KEY に割り当てたコマンドを説明する, Emacs のマニュアルの節へ移る.\n"
"KEY は \"C-x C-f\" のような文字列."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "variable:isearch-ring"
msgid "List of the previous search strings (the newest first)."
msgstr "前の検索の文字列の一覧 (新しい順)."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "variable:isearch-regexp-ring"
msgid "List of the previous regexp search strings (the newest first)."
msgstr "前の正規表現の検索の文字列の一覧 (新しい順)."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--pattern"
msgid "Return the regexp to search for, or #f to search for the string itself."
msgstr "検索する正規表現を返す. 文字列そのものを検索するなら #f を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--update-fold"
msgid "Fold case while the search string has no upper case letter, unless M-c fixed it."
msgstr "検索の文字列に大文字が無い間は, 大文字と小文字を区別しない. M-c で決めたときは, そのまま."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--search-string"
msgid "Search from point for the search string.  Return #t (point moved to the match) or #f."
msgstr "点から検索の文字列を検索する. 一致すれば (点を一致の位置へ動かして) #t を, 無ければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--search"
msgid "Do the search with the current search string."
msgstr "今の検索の文字列で検索する."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--looking-at"
msgid "Return #t if the search string matches at point."
msgstr "検索の文字列が点の位置で一致すれば #t を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--odd-backslashes"
msgid "Return #t if STRING ends in an odd number of backslashes."
msgstr "STRING が奇数個のバックスラッシュで終わっていれば #t を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--fallback"
msgid "Return point to the previous successful match so that a regexp can be made liberal (Emacs isearch-fallback)."
msgstr "正規表現を緩くできるように, 前に成功した一致の位置へ点を戻す (Emacs の isearch-fallback)."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--yank-word"
msgid "Add the word after point (or after the current match) to the search string."
msgstr "点の後ろの単語 (今の一致があれば, その後ろの単語) を, 検索の文字列に加える."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--ring-adjust1"
msgid "Set the search string to the next (ADVANCE) or the previous element of the search ring."
msgstr "検索の文字列を, 検索の履歴の次 (ADVANCE) か前の要素にする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--edit-string"
msgid ""
"Edit the search string in the minibuffer, and search again with it (Emacs's `isearch-edit-string').\n"
"The search resumes from the start (or the end, searching backward) of the current match.\n"
"DEL after that goes back to the state before the edit."
msgstr ""
"検索の文字列をミニバッファで直し, それで探し直す (Emacs の `isearch-edit-string').\n"
"今の一致の初め (後ろへの検索なら終わり) から探し直す.\n"
"その後の DEL は, 直す前の状態に戻る."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--ring-adjust"
msgid "Edit the next (ADVANCE) or the previous search string of the ring (`search-ring-update' is nil)."
msgstr "履歴の次 (ADVANCE) か前の検索の文字列を直させる (`search-ring-update' が nil)."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--printing-key"
msgid "Return the string to add to the search string for KEY, or #f if KEY is not a printing key."
msgstr "KEY を検索の文字列に加える文字列を返す. KEY が表示できる文字のキーでなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-mode"
msgid ""
"Search incrementally.  FORWARD is the direction, REGEXP #t for a regexp search, FUNCTION #f, `word' or `symbol'.\n"
"INITIAL is (STRING GOTO ERROR): the initial search string, a position to move to, and an error to show.\n"
"The keys: C-s and C-r repeat the search forward or backward, DEL deletes the last character,\n"
"C-w adds the word at point, C-q quotes the next key, M-r toggles the regexp mode, M-c toggles case folding,\n"
"M-e edits the search string in the minibuffer, M-p and M-n edit the previous or next search string,\n"
"RET exits, C-g backs up to the last match or, if it was found, cancels the search.\n"
"Another key exits the search, and is ignored."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタルサーチをする. FORWARD は向き, REGEXP が #t なら正規表現の検索, FUNCTION は #f, `word' か `symbol'.\n"
"INITIAL は (STRING GOTO ERROR): 検索の文字列の初めの値, 動く先の位置, 出すエラー.\n"
"キー: C-s と C-r で前か後ろへの検索を繰り返す. DEL は最後の文字を消す,\n"
"C-w は点の単語を加える. C-q は次のキーをそのまま入れる. M-r は正規表現のモードを切り替える. M-c は大文字と小文字の区別を切り替える,\n"
"M-e は検索の文字列をミニバッファで直す. M-p と M-n は前か次の検索の文字列を直させる,\n"
"RET で終わる. C-g は最後の一致まで戻る. 一致が見つかっていれば, 検索をやめる.\n"
"ほかのキーで検索を終わり, そのキーは無視する."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward"
msgid "Do incremental search forward.  With a prefix argument, do a regexp search."
msgstr "前向きのインクリメンタルサーチをする. 前置引数があれば正規表現の検索をする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-backward"
msgid "Do incremental search backward.  With a prefix argument, do a regexp search."
msgstr "後ろ向きのインクリメンタルサーチをする. 前置引数があれば正規表現の検索をする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward-regexp"
msgid "Do incremental search forward for a regexp."
msgstr "正規表現で前向きのインクリメンタルサーチをする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-backward-regexp"
msgid "Do incremental search backward for a regexp."
msgstr "正規表現で後ろ向きのインクリメンタルサーチをする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward-word"
msgid "Do incremental search forward for a sequence of words, ignoring punctuation."
msgstr "句読点を無視して, 単語の並びを前向きにインクリメンタルサーチする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward-symbol"
msgid "Do incremental search forward for a symbol."
msgstr "シンボルを前向きにインクリメンタルサーチする."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "variable:isearch-forward-thing-at-point-things"
msgid ""
"A list of things to try to get the \"thing\" at point, for isearch-forward-thing-at-point\n"
"(Emacs names this variable isearch-forward-thing-at-point too, but here a name is one binding).\n"
"Each element is `region', `url', `symbol' or `sexp'."
msgstr ""
"isearch-forward-thing-at-point が, 点の「物」を得るために試す物の並び.\n"
"(Emacs ではこの変数も isearch-forward-thing-at-point だが, ここでは名前が 1 つの束縛なので別の名前にした.)\n"
"要素は `region', `url', `symbol', `sexp' のどれか."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--bounds-of-thing"
msgid "Return (START END), the thing at point found with BEGIN-OP and END-OP, or #f."
msgstr "BEGIN-OP と END-OP で見つけた点の物の (START END) を返す. 無ければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--symbol-end"
msgid "Move point to the end of the next symbol, or to the end of the buffer."
msgstr "次のシンボルの終わりへ点を動かす. 無ければ, バッファの終わりへ動かす."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--symbol-beginning"
msgid "Move point to the beginning of the current symbol."
msgstr "今のシンボルの始めへ点を動かす."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--sexp-end"
msgid ""
"Move point to the end of the next sexp, or stay at a scan error.\n"
"Emacs compares the syntax descriptor of the char after point with a char here, so it always moves by sexp."
msgstr ""
"次の S 式の終わりへ点を動かす. 走査のエラーなら動かない.\n"
"Emacs は点の後ろの文字の構文記述子を文字と比べるので, 常に S 式の単位で動く."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--sexp-beginning"
msgid "Move point to the beginning of the current sexp."
msgstr "今の S 式の始めへ点を動かす."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch--thing-bounds"
msgid "Return (START END) for THING (`region', `url', `symbol' or `sexp') at point, or #f."
msgstr "点にある THING (`region', `url', `symbol', `sexp') の (START END) を返す. 無ければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward-thing-at-point"
msgid ""
"Do incremental search forward for the \"thing\" found near point.\n"
"Like ordinary incremental search except that the \"thing\" found at point\n"
"is added to the search string initially.  The variable isearch-forward-thing-at-point-things\n"
"lists the things to try; with `region' in the list and the region active, the region is used."
msgstr ""
"点の近くにある「物」を前向きにインクリメンタルサーチする.\n"
"普通のインクリメンタルサーチと同じだが, 点にある「物」を検索の文字列の初めに加える.\n"
"試す物は変数 isearch-forward-thing-at-point-things の並びで, `region' があってリージョンが有効なら, リージョンを使う."

#: lisp/isearch.scm
msgctxt "function:isearch-forward-symbol-at-point"
msgid ""
"Do incremental search forward for a symbol found near point.\n"
"Like ordinary incremental search except that the symbol found at point\n"
"is added to the search string initially, as a symbol search."
msgstr ""
"点の近くにあるシンボルを前向きにインクリメンタルサーチする.\n"
"普通のインクリメンタルサーチと同じだが, 点にあるシンボルを検索の文字列の初めに加え, シンボルの検索にする."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "variable:completion-at-point-functions"
msgid ""
"List of functions to be used by `completion-at-point'.\n"
"Each function is called with no argument and returns (START END CANDIDATES) for the text at\n"
"point, or #f if it does not apply."
msgstr ""
"`completion-at-point' が使う関数の一覧.\n"
"各関数は引数なしで呼ばれ, ポイントの所の文字について (START END CANDIDATES) を返す.\n"
"当てはまらなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:completion--common-prefix"
msgid "Return the longest string that is a prefix of every string in STRINGS."
msgstr "STRINGS の全ての文字列の先頭に共通する, 一番長い文字列を返す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:completion--dedupe"
msgid "Return STRINGS without duplicates, keeping the first of each."
msgstr "STRINGS から重複を除いて返す (同じものは, 先のものを残す)."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:completion--show-list"
msgid "Show CANDIDATES in the *Completions* buffer, in another window."
msgstr "CANDIDATES を, 別のウィンドウの *Completions* バッファに出す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:completion-in-region"
msgid ""
"Complete the text between START and END using CANDIDATES (a list of strings).\n"
"Insert the longest common prefix of the candidates that start with the text.  If that adds\n"
"nothing, list the candidates in the *Completions* buffer.  Return #t if there was a match."
msgstr ""
"START と END の間の文字を, CANDIDATES (文字列の一覧) で補完する.\n"
"文字で始まる候補の, 共通する先頭の部分を挿入する. 何も増えなければ,\n"
"候補を *Completions* バッファに一覧する. 合うものがあれば #t を返す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:completion-at-point"
msgid ""
"Perform completion on the text around point.\n"
"The completion method is determined by `completion-at-point-functions'."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの所の文字を補完する.\n"
"補完の方法は `completion-at-point-functions' で決まる."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:complete-symbol--candidates"
msgid "Return the names defined in the evaluator that start with PREFIX."
msgstr "評価器で定義されている名前のうち, PREFIX で始まるものを返す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:complete-symbol--capf"
msgid "Return (START END CANDIDATES) for the symbol before point."
msgstr "ポイントの前の記号の (START END CANDIDATES) を返す."

#: lisp/minibuffer.scm
msgctxt "function:complete-symbol"
msgid ""
"Perform completion on the symbol preceding point.\n"
"Complete with the names defined in the Scheme evaluator."
msgstr ""
"ポイントの前の記号を補完する.\n"
"Scheme の評価器で定義されている名前で補完する."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "function:org-lint-add-checker"
msgid ""
"Add a new checker for the linter.\n"
"NAME is a unique symbol, SUMMARY is a short description, and FUN is called with the scanned buffer\n"
"and returns a list of (POSITION MESSAGE).  The optional PROPS are the trust level (low or high, or #f)\n"
"and the list of categories."
msgstr ""
"org-lint のチェッカーを足す.\n"
"NAME は他と重ならないシンボル, SUMMARY は短い説明, FUN は調べたバッファを受け取り (POSITION MESSAGE) の並びを返す.\n"
"省略できる PROPS は, 信頼度 (low か high か #f) と, 分類の並び."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-lint-buffer-name"
msgid "Name of the buffer that shows the reports of `org-lint'."
msgstr "`org-lint' の報告を出すバッファの名前."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "function:org-lint-reports"
msgid ""
"Check the current Org buffer for syntax mistakes, and return the reports.\n"
"With a list of checker names (symbols) as the argument, run only those checkers.\n"
"Each report is (ID (LINE TRUST DESCRIPTION CHECKER)), sorted by line."
msgstr ""
"今の Org のバッファの書き方の誤りを調べ, 報告を返す.\n"
"引数にチェッカーの名前 (シンボル) の並びを渡すと, それだけを動かす.\n"
"報告は (ID (LINE TRUST DESCRIPTION CHECKER)) で, 行の順."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "function:org-lint"
msgid ""
"Check the current Org buffer for syntax mistakes.\n"
"Show the reports in the *Org Lint* buffer; RET there moves to the line of the report.\n"
"With a list of checker names (symbols) as the argument, run only those checkers and return the reports."
msgstr ""
"今の Org のバッファの書き方の誤りを調べる.\n"
"報告を *Org Lint* のバッファに出す. そこで RET を押すと, 報告の行に移る.\n"
"引数にチェッカーの名前 (シンボル) の並びを渡すと, それだけを動かして報告を返す."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "function:org-lint-goto"
msgid "Move to the line of the report at point."
msgstr "ポイントの所の報告の行に移る."

#: lisp/org-lint.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-lint-unsupported-checkers"
msgid ""
"Checkers of Emacs's org-lint that are not ported.\n"
"They need the syntax tree (links, timestamps, items), the exporter, Babel, org-id or org-cite."
msgstr ""
"移していない, Emacs の org-lint のチェッカー.\n"
"構文木 (リンク, 日時, 項目), 書き出し, Babel, org-id, org-cite が要る."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-directory"
msgid "Directory where Org files are kept."
msgstr "Org のファイルを置くディレクトリ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-default-notes-file"
msgid "Default file for capture."
msgstr "キャプチャの既定のファイル."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-files"
msgid ""
"Files shown in the agenda.\n"
"A directory means the .org files in it."
msgstr ""
"アジェンダに出すファイル.\n"
"ディレクトリなら, その中の .org のファイル."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-todo-keywords"
msgid ""
"TODO states, written like ((sequence \"TODO\" \"|\" \"DONE\")).\n"
"The words after | are done states; without |, the last word is the done state.\n"
"A key to select the state can be written in parentheses, like \"TODO(t)\"."
msgstr ""
"TODO の状態.((sequence \"TODO\" \"|\" \"DONE\")) のように書く.\n"
"| の後が済みの状態.| が無ければ, 最後が済みの状態.\n"
"\"TODO(t)\" のように, 括弧の中に, 選ぶキーを書ける."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-log-done"
msgid ""
"Whether to record the time when an entry is marked done.\n"
"If it is 'time or 'note, write CLOSED: [DATE]; if #f, write nothing."
msgstr ""
"済みにした時刻を書くか.\n"
"'time か 'note なら, CLOSED: [日時] を書く.#f なら書かない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-log-repeat"
msgid ""
"Whether to record the time when a repeating entry is marked done.\n"
"If #f, write nothing."
msgstr ""
"繰り返しの予定を済みにしたとき, 時刻を書くか.\n"
"#f なら書かない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-tags-column"
msgid ""
"Column to align tags to.\n"
"If negative, align the end of the tags to its absolute value."
msgstr ""
"タグを揃える桁.\n"
"負なら, タグの終わりを, その桁 (の絶対値) に揃える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-priority-highest"
msgid "Highest priority."
msgstr "一番高い優先度."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-priority-lowest"
msgid "Lowest priority."
msgstr "一番低い優先度."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-priority-default"
msgid "Priority of an entry without one."
msgstr "優先度が無いときの, 既定の優先度."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-capture-templates"
msgid ""
"Capture templates, a list of (KEY DESCRIPTION TYPE (TARGET) TEMPLATE).\n"
"If empty, use the default one.\n"
"TYPE is entry (heading), item (list item), checkitem (checkbox) or plain (text).\n"
"TARGET is (file \"FILE\") or (file+headline \"FILE\" \"HEADING\"); \"\" means `org-default-notes-file'."
msgstr ""
"キャプチャのテンプレート.((キー 説明 種類 (行き先) テンプレート) のリスト.\n"
"空なら, 既定のもの.\n"
"種類は entry (見出し), item (リストの項目), checkitem (チェックボックス), plain (文).\n"
"行き先は (file \"ファイル\") か (file+headline \"ファイル\" \"見出し\").\"\" は org-default-notes-file."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-hide-leading-stars"
msgid "If true, show only the last star of a heading."
msgstr "#t なら, 見出しの * を, 最後の 1 つだけ見せる (前の星を重ねて見せない)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-return-follows-link"
msgid "If true, RET opens the link at point."
msgstr "#t なら, RET でリンクを開く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-deadline-warning-days"
msgid "Number of days before a deadline to show it in today's agenda."
msgstr "締め切りの何日前から, 今日のアジェンダに出すか."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-span"
msgid "Number of days in the agenda."
msgstr "アジェンダの日数."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-start-on-weekday"
msgid ""
"Weekday the agenda starts on (1 is Monday).\n"
"If #f, start from today."
msgstr ""
"アジェンダの始めの曜日 (1 が月曜).\n"
"#f なら, 今日から."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-mode-hook"
msgid "Procedures called when Org mode is turned on."
msgstr "Org mode にしたとき, 呼ぶ手続き."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-capture-after-finalize-hook"
msgid "Procedures called when a capture is finished."
msgstr "キャプチャを終えたとき, 呼ぶ手続き."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-take"
msgid "Return the first N elements of ITEMS."
msgstr "リスト ITEMS の始めの N 個を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-drop"
msgid "Return ITEMS without the first N elements."
msgstr "リスト ITEMS の始めの N 個を除いたものを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-last"
msgid "Return the last element of ITEMS."
msgstr "リスト ITEMS の最後の要素を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-index-of"
msgid "Return the index of X in ITEMS, counted from 0, or #f if it is not found."
msgstr "リスト ITEMS の中の X の位置 (0 から) を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-unique"
msgid "Return ITEMS without duplicates, keeping the first ones."
msgstr "ITEMS から重なりを除いたものを返す (始めのものを残す)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-range"
msgid "Return the list of numbers from 0 to N - 1."
msgstr "0 から N - 1 までの数のリストを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-repeat"
msgid "Return the string S repeated N times."
msgstr "文字列 S を N 回つなげたものを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-spaces"
msgid "Return a string of N spaces."
msgstr "空白 N 個の文字列を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-pad-right"
msgid ""
"Pad S with spaces on the right to WIDTH.\n"
"If S is longer, return it as it is."
msgstr ""
"S の右を空白で埋めて, 幅を WIDTH にする.\n"
"長ければ, そのまま返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-pad-left"
msgid "Pad S with spaces on the left to WIDTH."
msgstr "S の左を空白で埋めて, 幅を WIDTH にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-2d"
msgid "Return N as two digits, padded with 0."
msgstr "N を, 前を 0 で埋めた 2 桁の文字列にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-blank?"
msgid "Return #t if S consists only of whitespace."
msgstr "S が空白だけの文字列なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-indentation"
msgid "Return the width of the indentation of LINE."
msgstr "行 LINE の始めの空白の幅を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-all-matches"
msgid ""
"Return all matches of REGEXP in S.\n"
"Each match is a list with (START END) or #f for each group."
msgstr ""
"文字列 S の中の, 正規表現 REGEXP に合う所を全て返す.\n"
"それぞれ, 括弧ごとの (始め 終わり) か #f のリスト."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-match-string"
msgid "Return the string of group N of the match M in S, or #f if the group did not match."
msgstr "S の中の合った所 M の, N 番目の括弧の文字列を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-replace-all"
msgid "Replace all occurrences of FROM in S with TO."
msgstr "文字列 S の中の FROM を, 全て TO にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-char"
msgid "Return the Nth character of S as a string, counted from 0."
msgstr "文字列 S の N 文字目 (0 から) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-lines"
msgid ""
"Return the lines of the buffer.\n"
"If the buffer ends with a newline, the last line is empty."
msgstr ""
"バッファの行 (改行で分けたもの) を返す.\n"
"最後が改行なら, 最後は空の文字列."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-line-count"
msgid "Return the number of LINES, not counting the empty line after the last newline."
msgstr "行の数を返す.最後の改行の後の, 空の行は数えない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-line"
msgid "Return line N of LINES, counted from 1."
msgstr "LINES の N 行目 (1 から) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-line-start"
msgid "Return the position of the start of line N."
msgstr "N 行目の始めの位置を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-line-end"
msgid "Return the position of the end of line N, before the newline."
msgstr "N 行目の終わりの位置 (改行の前) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-pos-line"
msgid ""
"Return the line and column of POS as (LINE COLUMN).\n"
"The column is counted from 0."
msgstr ""
"位置 POS の行と桁を (行 桁) で返す.\n"
"桁は 0 から."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-current-line"
msgid "Return the line of point."
msgstr "カーソルの行を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-current-column"
msgid "Return the column of point, counted from 0."
msgstr "カーソルの桁 (0 から) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-goto-line-column"
msgid "Move to column COL of line N."
msgstr "N 行目の桁 COL へ動く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-replace-region"
msgid ""
"Replace the text between START and END with NEW.\n"
"If point is after the replaced text, it moves with the text."
msgstr ""
"START と END の間を, 文字列 NEW に置き換える.\n"
"カーソルは, 置き換えた所の後なら, 一緒に動く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-replace-lines"
msgid "Replace lines FROM to TO with the list of lines NEW."
msgstr "FROM 行から TO 行までを, 新しい行のリスト NEW に置き換える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-line"
msgid "Replace line N with NEW."
msgstr "N 行目を NEW に置き換える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-line-changed"
msgid ""
"Replace line N with NEW, changing only the part that differs.\n"
"Point moves with the unchanged text."
msgstr ""
"N 行目を NEW に置き換える.変わった所だけを置き換える.\n"
"カーソルは, 変わらない所と一緒に動く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-lines-after"
msgid "Insert the lines NEW after line N."
msgstr "N 行目の後に, 行 NEW を入れる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-delete-lines"
msgid "Delete lines FROM to TO, including the newlines."
msgstr "FROM 行から TO 行までを消す (改行も)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-level"
msgid "Return the level of the heading LINE, or #f if it is not a heading."
msgstr "見出し LINE の深さを返す.見出しでなければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-headings"
msgid "Return the headings of LINES as a list of (LINE LEVEL)."
msgstr "見出しの行と深さを, (行 深さ) のリストで返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-heading-line"
msgid "Return the nearest heading line at or before line N, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "N 行目か, その前の, 一番近い見出しの行を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-subtree-end"
msgid "Return the last line of the subtree of the heading at line N."
msgstr "N 行目の見出しの木の, 最後の行を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-end"
msgid "Return the last line of the body of the heading at line N, before the next heading."
msgstr "N 行目の見出しの, 本文の最後の行 (次の見出しの前) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-back-to-heading"
msgid ""
"Return the heading line of point.\n"
"Signal an error if there is none."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの見出しの行を返す.\n"
"無ければ, 失敗にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-at-heading-p"
msgid "Return #t if point is on a heading."
msgstr "カーソルが見出しにあれば #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-regexp"
msgid "Return the regexp of the TODO keywords, in a group."
msgstr "TODO のキーワードの正規表現 (括弧の中) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-parse-heading"
msgid ""
"Split the heading LINE into (STARS TODO PRIORITY TITLE TAGS).\n"
"Missing parts are #f. Return #f if LINE is not a heading."
msgstr ""
"見出し LINE を (星 TODO 優先度 題 タグ) に分ける.\n"
"無いものは #f.見出しでなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-make-heading"
msgid "Return a heading line made of STARS, TODO, PRIORITY, TITLE and TAGS, with the tags aligned."
msgstr "STARS, TODO, PRIORITY, TITLE, TAGS から見出しの行を作る (タグは揃える)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-tags-line"
msgid "Return HEAD followed by TAGS aligned to `org-tags-column'."
msgstr "HEAD の後に, タグ TAGS を揃えた行を返す (org-tags-column)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-heading-tags"
msgid "Return the tags of the parsed heading PARSED as a list."
msgstr "分けた見出し PARSED のタグを, リストで返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-tags-string"
msgid "Return TAGS as a string like :a:b:, or #f if TAGS is empty."
msgstr "タグのリスト TAGS を :a:b: にする.空なら #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-keyword-name"
msgid "Return the name of the keyword WORD: \"TODO\" for \"TODO(t)\"."
msgstr "キーワード WORD の名前を返す (\"TODO(t)\" なら \"TODO\")."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-keyword-key"
msgid ""
"Return the key to select the keyword WORD: \"t\" for \"TODO(t)\".\n"
"Return #f if there is none."
msgstr ""
"キーワード WORD を選ぶキーを返す (\"TODO(t)\" なら \"t\").\n"
"無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-sets"
msgid "Return the sets of TODO keywords as a list of ((NOT-DONE...) (DONE...))."
msgstr "TODO の組を, ((未完の言葉) (済みの言葉)) のリストで返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-keywords-1"
msgid "Return all the TODO keywords."
msgstr "全ての TODO のキーワードを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-done-keywords"
msgid "Return the done keywords."
msgstr "済みのキーワードを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-done-keyword?"
msgid "Return #t if WORD is a done keyword."
msgstr "キーワード WORD が済みなら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-set"
msgid "Return the set of keywords containing WORD, or the first set if there is none."
msgstr "WORD を含むキーワードの組を返す.無ければ, 始めの組."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-keys"
msgid "Return the keys and keywords as a list of (KEY KEYWORD)."
msgstr "キーとキーワードを, (キー キーワード) のリストで返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-font-lock-keywords"
msgid ""
"Return the regexps and faces for highlighting, as a list of (REGEXP FACE GROUP).\n"
"The regexps are JavaScript regexps of the editor, matched line by line.\n"
"Later ones are drawn over earlier ones."
msgstr ""
"色付けの正規表現と face を, (正規表現 face 括弧の番号) のリストで返す.\n"
"正規表現は, 画面のエディタの, JavaScript の正規表現.行ごとに合わせる.\n"
"後のものを上に重ねる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fontify"
msgid "Highlight the buffer."
msgstr "バッファに色を付ける."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-mode-keys"
msgid "Key bindings of Org mode."
msgstr "Org mode のキー."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-mode"
msgid "Turn on Org mode: set the keys and highlighting, and read #+STARTUP."
msgstr "Org mode にする (キー, 色, #+STARTUP)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-find-file-hook"
msgid ""
"Turn on Org mode if the visited file is an .org file.\n"
"This is called from `find-file-hook'."
msgstr ""
"開いたファイルが .org なら, Org mode にする.\n"
"find-file-hook から呼ぶ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-startup-visibility"
msgid "Set the visibility by #+STARTUP: (overview, content or showall)."
msgstr "#+STARTUP: の見せ方 (overview, content, showall) にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-cycle-last"
msgid ""
"Last cycling state, as (BUFFER POINT STATUS).\n"
"Whether the key was pressed again is decided by whether point has moved."
msgstr ""
"直前の開け閉め.(バッファ カーソル 状態).\n"
"続けて押したかを, カーソルが動いていないかで決める."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-repeated?"
msgid "Return #t if the key is pressed again and the previous state was STATUS."
msgstr "続けて押していて, 前の状態が STATUS なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-remember"
msgid "Remember STATUS as the last cycling state."
msgstr "開け閉めの状態 STATUS を覚える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fold-end"
msgid ""
"Return the end of the region to hide: the end of line TO.\n"
"On the last line, it is before the last newline."
msgstr ""
"隠す範囲の終わり (TO 行の終わり) を返す.\n"
"最後の行なら, 最後の改行の前."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fold-showing"
msgid ""
"Show the headings SHOWN (a list of lines), hiding the body of each one\n"
"up to the next shown heading (up to line LAST)."
msgstr ""
"見せる見出し SHOWN (行のリスト) の, それぞれの本文を,\n"
"次の見せる見出しの前まで隠す (LAST 行まで)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-local"
msgid ""
"Cycle the subtree of the heading at line N.\n"
"The order is EMPTY ENTRY, CHILDREN, SUBTREE and FOLDED."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の見出しの木を開け閉めする.\n"
"EMPTY ENTRY, CHILDREN, SUBTREE, FOLDED の順."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-overview"
msgid "Show only the top-level headings."
msgstr "一番上の見出しだけを見せる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-content"
msgid "Show all the headings, hiding the bodies."
msgstr "全ての見出しを見せる (本文は隠す)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-global-cycle"
msgid "Cycle the whole buffer: OVERVIEW, CONTENTS and SHOW ALL."
msgstr "全体を開け閉めする (OVERVIEW, CONTENTS, SHOW ALL の順)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle"
msgid ""
"Move to the next table field, cycle the heading, or indent.\n"
"In a table, move to the next field; on a heading, cycle its subtree; otherwise indent."
msgstr "表なら次の欄へ, 見出しなら開け閉め, ほかは字下げ (TAB)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shifttab"
msgid "Move to the previous table field, or cycle the whole buffer."
msgstr "表なら前の欄へ, ほかは全体の開け閉め (S-TAB)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-reveal"
msgid "Show POS if it is hidden."
msgstr "位置 POS が隠れていれば, 見せる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-heading-title-range"
msgid "Return the range of the title in the heading LINE as (START END), or #f if there is no title."
msgstr "見出し LINE の題の, 行の中の範囲を (始め 終わり) で返す.題が無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-new-heading-todo"
msgid ""
"Return the TODO state of a new heading after line N.\n"
"If TODO is true, it is the not-done state of the previous heading, or the first state."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の後の, 新しい見出しの TODO を返す.\n"
"TODO が #t なら, 前の見出しの, 済みでない状態.無ければ, 始めの状態."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-heading-1"
msgid ""
"Insert a heading (M-RET).\n"
"If TODO is true, insert a TODO heading."
msgstr ""
"見出しを入れる (M-RET).\n"
"TODO が #t なら, TODO の見出し."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-heading-after-subtree"
msgid ""
"Insert a heading after the current subtree (C-RET).\n"
"If TODO is true, insert a TODO heading."
msgstr ""
"木の後に見出しを入れる (C-RET).\n"
"TODO が #t なら, TODO の見出し."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-heading"
msgid "Insert a heading, even in a list item."
msgstr "見出しを入れる (リストの項目でも)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-heading-respect-content"
msgid "Insert a heading after the current subtree."
msgstr "今の木の後に, 見出しを入れる (C-RET)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-todo-heading-respect-content"
msgid "Insert a TODO heading after the current subtree."
msgstr "今の木の後に, TODO の見出しを入れる (C-S-RET)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-meta-return"
msgid ""
"Insert a list item or a heading.\n"
"In a table, do nothing; in a list, insert an item; otherwise insert a heading."
msgstr "M-RET: 表なら何もしない, リストなら項目を, ほかは見出しを入れる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-todo-heading"
msgid "Insert a TODO heading, or a checkbox item in a list."
msgstr "M-S-RET: TODO の見出しを入れる (リストなら, チェックボックスの項目)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shift-headings"
msgid "Change the level of the headings from line FROM to line TO by DELTA."
msgstr "FROM 行から TO 行までの見出しの深さを, DELTA だけ変える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shift-heading"
msgid ""
"Change the level of the heading at line N by DELTA.\n"
"Add or remove stars and realign the tags; point moves with the text."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の見出しの深さを, DELTA だけ変える.\n"
"星を足すか消して, タグを揃え直す (カーソルは, 文と一緒に動く)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-promote-1"
msgid ""
"Promote or demote the heading by DELTA.\n"
"If SUBTREE is true, change the whole subtree."
msgstr ""
"見出しを DELTA だけ浅く, 深くする.\n"
"SUBTREE が #t なら, 木ごと."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-do-promote"
msgid "Promote the current heading."
msgstr "今の見出しを浅くする (M-左)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-do-demote"
msgid "Demote the current heading."
msgstr "今の見出しを深くする (M-右)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-promote-subtree"
msgid "Promote the current subtree."
msgstr "今の木を浅くする (M-S-左)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-demote-subtree"
msgid "Demote the current subtree."
msgstr "今の木を深くする (M-S-右)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-sibling"
msgid ""
"Return the line of the previous or next heading at the same level as line N.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one. Return #f if it would cross the parent."
msgstr ""
"N 行目と同じ深さの, 前か後の見出しの行を返す.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら後.親を越えるなら #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-move-subtree"
msgid ""
"Swap the current subtree with the previous or next one at the same level.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one."
msgstr ""
"木を, 前か後の, 同じ深さの木と入れ換える.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-move-subtree-up"
msgid "Move the current subtree up past the previous one."
msgstr "今の木を, 前の木の前へ動かす (M-上)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-move-subtree-down"
msgid "Move the current subtree down past the next one."
msgstr "今の木を, 次の木の後へ動かす (M-下)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-drag-line"
msgid ""
"Swap the current line with the previous or next line.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one."
msgstr ""
"今の行と, その前か後の行を入れ換える.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-ctrl-c-star"
msgid ""
"Turn a heading into text, or an item or text into a heading.\n"
"Point moves with the text."
msgstr "C-c *: 見出しを文に, 項目と文を見出しにする (カーソルは, 文と一緒に動く)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-goto-heading"
msgid "Move to the heading at line N, showing it."
msgstr "N 行目の見出しへ動く (見せる)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-visible-heading"
msgid ""
"Move to the next or previous visible heading.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one. Without one, move to the end or start of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"次か前の, 見えている見出しへ動く.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら次.無ければ, バッファの終わりか始めへ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-next-visible-heading"
msgid "Move to the next visible heading."
msgstr "次の, 見えている見出しへ動く (C-c C-n)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-previous-visible-heading"
msgid "Move to the previous visible heading."
msgstr "前の, 見えている見出しへ動く (C-c C-p)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-heading-same-level"
msgid ""
"Move to the next or previous heading at the same level, within the parent.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one. Without one, do not move."
msgstr ""
"同じ深さの, 次か前の見出しへ動く (親の中だけ).\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら次.無ければ動かない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-forward-heading-same-level"
msgid "Move to the next heading at the same level."
msgstr "同じ深さの, 次の見出しへ動く (C-c C-f)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-backward-heading-same-level"
msgid "Move to the previous heading at the same level."
msgstr "同じ深さの, 前の見出しへ動く (C-c C-b)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-parent"
msgid "Return the line of the parent heading of line N, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "N 行目の上の見出しの行を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:outline-up-heading"
msgid "Move to the parent heading."
msgstr "C-c C-u: 上の見出しへ動く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-parse-item"
msgid ""
"Split the list item LINE into (INDENT BULLET CHECKBOX TEXT).\n"
"CHECKBOX is #f if there is none. Return #f if LINE is not an item."
msgstr ""
"リストの項目 LINE を (字下げ 印 チェックボックス 文) に分ける.\n"
"チェックボックスが無ければ #f.項目でなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-make-item"
msgid "Return an item line made of INDENT, BULLET, BOX and TEXT."
msgstr "INDENT, BULLET, BOX, TEXT から, 項目の行を作る."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-ordered-bullet?"
msgid "Return #t if BULLET is a number."
msgstr "印 BULLET が数なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-end"
msgid ""
"Return the last line of the item at line N.\n"
"It includes the child items and continuation lines, but not trailing empty lines."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の項目の, 最後の行を返す.\n"
"子の項目と, 続きの行を含む.後ろの空の行は含まない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-at"
msgid "Return the line of the item containing line N, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "N 行目を含む項目の行を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-in-item"
msgid "Return the line of the item at point, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "カーソルの項目の行を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-sibling"
msgid ""
"Return the previous or next item at the same level as line N, or #f if there is none.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one."
msgstr ""
"N 行目と同じ深さの, 前か後の項目を返す.無ければ #f.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-siblings"
msgid "Return the lines of the items at the same level as line N in the list, from the first."
msgstr "リストの, N 行目と同じ深さの項目の行を, 始めから返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-parent"
msgid "Return the parent item of line N, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "N 行目の項目の上の項目を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-children"
msgid "Return the child items of line N, one level deeper."
msgstr "N 行目の項目の子の項目 (すぐ下の深さのもの) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fix-bullets"
msgid ""
"Make the bullets of the list at line N the same, and renumber them.\n"
"They follow the bullet of the first item."
msgstr ""
"N 行目のリストの印を揃え, 数を振り直す.\n"
"始めの項目の印に合わせる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-item"
msgid ""
"Insert a list item.\n"
"If CHECKBOX is true, add a checkbox."
msgstr ""
"項目を入れる.\n"
"CHECKBOX が #t なら, チェックボックスを付ける."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-move-item"
msgid ""
"Swap the current item with the previous or next one.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one."
msgstr ""
"項目を, 前か後の項目と入れ換える.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-indent-item"
msgid ""
"Change the indentation of the current item by DELTA (1 deeper, -1 shallower).\n"
"If SUBTREE is true, change the children too."
msgstr ""
"項目の字下げを DELTA だけ変える (1 なら深く, -1 なら浅く).\n"
"SUBTREE が #t なら, 子も."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-list-bullets"
msgid "Order of the bullets used by S-left, S-right and C-c -."
msgstr "印の順 (S-左右, C-c -)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-cycle-list-bullet"
msgid ""
"Change the bullet of the list.\n"
"If FORWARD is #f, use the previous bullet."
msgstr ""
"リストの印を変える.\n"
"FORWARD が #f なら, 前の印."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-item-move-point"
msgid ""
"Move to the next or previous item (S-up, S-down).\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one."
msgstr ""
"次か前の項目へ動く (S-上下).\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら次."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-ctrl-c-minus"
msgid "Insert a table rule, change the list bullet, or turn a heading or text into an item."
msgstr "C-c -: 表なら横線, 項目なら印を変える, 見出しと文は項目にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-toggle-checkbox"
msgid "Toggle the checkbox of the current item."
msgstr "チェックボックスを切り換える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fix-parent-checkboxes"
msgid ""
"Update the checkboxes of the parents of item I from their children.\n"
"A parent is [X] if all children are done, and [-] if some are."
msgstr ""
"項目 I の上の項目のチェックボックスを, 子に合わせる.\n"
"全て済みなら [X], 一部なら [-]."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-statistics"
msgid "Return the done and total counts for the statistics cookie at line N, as (DONE TOTAL)."
msgstr "N 行目の数える印の, 済みと全ての数を (済み 全て) で返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-update-cookies-in-line"
msgid "Rewrite the statistics cookies in line N."
msgstr "N 行目の, 数える印を書き直す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-update-statistics-cookies"
msgid "Rewrite all the statistics cookies in the buffer."
msgstr "バッファの, 全ての数える印を書き直す (C-c #)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-update-statistics"
msgid "Rewrite all the statistics cookies in the headings and items of the buffer."
msgstr "バッファの見出しと項目の, 全ての数える印を書き直す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-today"
msgid "Return today's date, like 2026-10-26."
msgstr "今日の日付を返す (2026-10-26 の形)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-date-time"
msgid ""
"Return the time of noon on DATE, in seconds.\n"
"Noon keeps the date right when adding days across daylight saving time."
msgstr ""
"日付 DATE の昼の時刻 (秒) を返す.\n"
"夏時間でも, 日を足して日付がずれないように, 昼にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-date-add"
msgid "Add DAYS days to DATE."
msgstr "日付 DATE に, DAYS 日を足す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-make-date"
msgid ""
"Return the date of YEAR, MONTH and DAY.\n"
"A month or day out of range carries over."
msgstr ""
"YEAR, MONTH, DAY から日付を作る.\n"
"月と日が範囲を越えれば, 繰り上げる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-date-parts"
msgid "Return DATE as (YEAR MONTH DAY)."
msgstr "日付 DATE を (年 月 日) で返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-date-add-months"
msgid "Add MONTHS months to DATE."
msgstr "日付 DATE に, MONTHS か月を足す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-days-between"
msgid "Return the number of days from A to B."
msgstr "A から B までの日数を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-weekday"
msgid "Return the weekday of DATE, like Mon."
msgstr "日付 DATE の曜日 (Mon など) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-date-shift"
msgid "Add N units to DATE. UNIT is d, w, m or y."
msgstr "日付 DATE に, 数 N と単位 UNIT (d w m y) で足す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-make-timestamp"
msgid ""
"Return a timestamp of DATE and TIME, like <2026-10-26 Mon 10:00 +1w>.\n"
"If ACTIVE is #f, use [ ] instead of < >."
msgstr ""
"DATE と TIME から日付の文字を作る (<2026-10-26 Mon 10:00 +1w> の形).\n"
"ACTIVE が #f なら [ ]."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-now-inactive"
msgid "Return the current date and time, like [2026-10-26 Mon 10:00]."
msgstr "今の日時を返す ([2026-10-26 Mon 10:00] の形)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-ts-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp of a timestamp.\n"
"Groups: 1 bracket, 2 date, 3 time, 4 end time, 5 repeater and warning."
msgstr ""
"日付の正規表現.\n"
"括弧: 1 括弧, 2 日付, 3 時刻, 4 終わりの時刻, 5 繰り返しと警告."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-parse-timestamp"
msgid ""
"Split the timestamp S into (BRACKET DATE TIME END-TIME REPEATER).\n"
"Return #f if S is not a timestamp."
msgstr ""
"日付 S を (括弧 日付 時刻 終わりの時刻 繰り返しと警告) に分ける.\n"
"日付でなければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-string"
msgid "Return the timestamp of the parsed timestamp PARSED."
msgstr "分けた日付 PARSED から, 文字を作る."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-repeater"
msgid "Return the repeater of PARSED as (MARK NUMBER UNIT), or #f if there is none."
msgstr "PARSED の繰り返しを (印 数 単位) で返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-warning"
msgid "Return the warning period of PARSED, like -3d, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "PARSED の警告の日数 (-3d など) を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-weekdays"
msgid "Names of the weekdays."
msgstr "曜日の名前."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-read-date-analyze"
msgid ""
"Read the date INPUT relative to DEFAULT, and return (DATE TIME).\n"
"TIME is #f if there is none. This is part of the syntax of `org-read-date':\n"
"empty (DEFAULT), +3 (3 days from today), +2w, -1d, ++1w (from DEFAULT),\n"
"2026-10-30, 10-30, 10/30, 30, fri (next Friday), 10:00, 10:00-11:00 and 3pm."
msgstr ""
"入れた日付 INPUT を, DEFAULT をもとに読み, (日付 時刻) を返す.\n"
"時刻が無ければ #f.org-read-date と同じ書き方の一部:\n"
"空 (既定), +3 (今日から 3 日後), +2w, -1d, ++1w (既定から),\n"
"2026-10-30, 10-30, 10/30, 30, fri (次の金曜), 10:00, 10:00-11:00, 3pm."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-normalize-time"
msgid "Make the hour of TIME two digits (9:00 to 09:00)."
msgstr "時刻 TIME の時を 2 桁にする (9:00 → 09:00)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-read-date"
msgid ""
"Read a date in the minibuffer with PROMPT, and return (DATE TIME).\n"
"DEFAULT is the default date."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファで PROMPT を出して日付を聞き, (日付 時刻) を返す.\n"
"DEFAULT は既定の日付."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-at"
msgid ""
"Return the timestamp at column COL of line N as (START END PARSED), or #f if there is none.\n"
"START and END are columns."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の, 桁 COL にある日付を (始め 終わり 分けたもの) で返す.無ければ #f.\n"
"始めと終わりは桁."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-timestamp-command"
msgid ""
"Insert a timestamp, or change the one at point (C-c . and C-c !).\n"
"If ACTIVE is #f, insert an inactive timestamp."
msgstr ""
"日付を入れる (日付の上なら, 変える.C-c . と C-c !).\n"
"ACTIVE が #f なら, [ ] の日付."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-time-stamp"
msgid "Insert a timestamp, or change the one at point."
msgstr "C-c .: 日付を入れる (日付の上なら, 変える)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-time-stamp-inactive"
msgid "Insert an inactive timestamp, or change the one at point."
msgstr "C-c !: [ ] の日付を入れる (日付の上なら, 変える)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-change"
msgid ""
"Change the part WHAT of PARSED by N (S-arrows).\n"
"WHAT is year, month, day, hour or minute."
msgstr ""
"PARSED の WHAT を N だけ変える (S-上下左右).\n"
"WHAT は year, month, day, hour, minute."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-part"
msgid "Return the part of the timestamp AT at column COL: year, month, day, hour or minute."
msgstr "日付 AT の, 桁 COL の部分を返す (year month day hour minute)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shift-timestamp"
msgid ""
"Change the timestamp at point by N.\n"
"If BY-DAY is true, change the day; otherwise the part at point.\n"
"Return #f if there is no timestamp at point."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの日付を N だけ変える.\n"
"BY-DAY が #t なら日を, ほかはカーソルの所を変える.\n"
"日付が無ければ #f を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-planning-line?"
msgid "Return #t if LINE is a planning line (SCHEDULED: and so on)."
msgstr "行 LINE が予定の行 (SCHEDULED: など) なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-planning-items"
msgid "Return the planning items of LINE as ((KEYWORD TIMESTAMP) ...)."
msgstr "予定の行 LINE の, ((言葉 日付) ...) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-get-planning"
msgid "Return the timestamp of KEYWORD in the planning of the heading at line N, or #f."
msgstr "N 行目の見出しの予定の, 言葉 KEYWORD の日付を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-planning"
msgid ""
"Set the timestamp of KEYWORD in the planning of the heading at line N to STAMP.\n"
"If STAMP is #f, remove it. A new one is written at the start of the line."
msgstr ""
"N 行目の見出しの予定の, 言葉 KEYWORD の日付を STAMP にする.\n"
"STAMP が #f なら消す.新しいものは, 行の始めに書く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-planning-command"
msgid "Read a date and write it as KEYWORD (C-c C-s and C-c C-d)."
msgstr "日付を聞いて, KEYWORD の予定として書く (C-c C-s と C-c C-d)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-schedule"
msgid "Write the SCHEDULED date of the current heading."
msgstr "C-c C-s: 見出しの予定 (SCHEDULED) を書く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-deadline"
msgid "Write the DEADLINE date of the current heading."
msgstr "C-c C-d: 見出しの締め切り (DEADLINE) を書く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-next-todo"
msgid ""
"Return the state after or before OLD.\n"
"FORWARD selects the next one. If ALL is true, cycle through all the states;\n"
"otherwise cycle within the set of OLD (C-c C-t)."
msgstr ""
"OLD の次か前の状態を返す.\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら次.ALL が #t なら, 全ての状態を回す (S-左右).\n"
"ほかは, 同じ組の中で回す (C-c C-t)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-fast-todo-selection"
msgid "Select a state by its key (SPC removes the state)."
msgstr "状態をキーで選ぶ (SPC で消す)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-todo"
msgid ""
"Set the state of the heading at line H to NEW, or remove it if NEW is #f.\n"
"Marking it done writes CLOSED, and moves a repeating date forward."
msgstr ""
"H 行目の見出しの状態を NEW にする.NEW が #f なら消す.\n"
"済みにすれば CLOSED を書き, 繰り返しなら日付を進める."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-repeating-stamps"
msgid "Return the repeating timestamps of the heading at line H as ((KEYWORD TIMESTAMP) ...)."
msgstr "H 行目の見出しの, 繰り返す予定を ((言葉 日付) ...) で返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-auto-repeat"
msgid ""
"Move the repeating timestamps REPEATS forward, and reset the state of line H.\n"
"DONE-WORD is the done state. LAST_REPEAT and a log of the state change are written."
msgstr ""
"繰り返しの予定 REPEATS を進め, H 行目を始めの状態に戻す.\n"
"DONE-WORD は済みの状態.LAST_REPEAT と, 状態の変わった記録を書く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-log-beginning"
msgid ""
"Return the line to write a log of the heading at line H.\n"
"It is after the heading, the planning line and PROPERTIES."
msgstr ""
"H 行目の見出しの, 記録を書く行を返す.\n"
"見出しと, 予定の行と, PROPERTIES の後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-put"
msgid "Set the property NAME of the heading at line H to VALUE, creating PROPERTIES if needed."
msgstr "H 行目の見出しの PROPERTIES に, NAME の値 VALUE を書く (無ければ, 作る)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-get"
msgid "Return the property NAME of the heading at line H, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "H 行目の見出しの PROPERTIES の, NAME の値を返す.無ければ #f."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo"
msgid ""
"Change the TODO state of the current heading.\n"
"If some states have keys, select one by its key."
msgstr ""
"C-c C-t: 状態を変える.\n"
"キーの付いた状態があれば, キーで選ぶ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-priority-chars"
msgid "Return the priority characters, highest first."
msgstr "優先度の文字を, 高い順に返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-priority"
msgid "Set the priority of the current heading to NEW, or remove it if NEW is #f."
msgstr "見出しの優先度を NEW にする.NEW が #f なら消す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-priority-shift"
msgid ""
"Raise the priority if UP is true, or lower it (S-up, S-down).\n"
"Going out of range removes it."
msgstr ""
"UP が #t なら優先度を上げ, ほかは下げる (S-上下).\n"
"範囲を越えれば消す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-priority-up"
msgid "Raise the priority of the current heading."
msgstr "見出しの優先度を上げる (S-上)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-priority-down"
msgid "Lower the priority of the current heading."
msgstr "見出しの優先度を下げる (S-下)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-priority"
msgid "Select the priority of the current heading (SPC removes it)."
msgstr "C-c ,: 優先度を選ぶ (SPC で消す)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-buffer-tags"
msgid "Return all the tags in LINES."
msgstr "バッファ (LINES) の全てのタグを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-tags"
msgid "Set the tags of the heading at line H to TAGS."
msgstr "H 行目の見出しのタグを TAGS にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-set-tags-command"
msgid "Read the tags of the current heading, separated by : or spaces."
msgstr "C-c C-q: タグを入れる (: か空白で分ける)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-line?"
msgid "Return #t if LINE is a table line."
msgstr "行 LINE が表の行なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-hline?"
msgid "Return #t if LINE is a table rule."
msgstr "行 LINE が横線の行なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-bounds"
msgid "Return the first and last lines of the table containing line N, as (START END)."
msgstr "N 行目を含む表の, 始めと終わりの行を (始め 終わり) で返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-cells"
msgid "Return the fields of the table LINE, or 'hline for a rule."
msgstr "表の行 LINE の欄を返す.横線なら 'hline."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-number?"
msgid "Return #t if the field S is a number."
msgstr "欄 S が数なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-render"
msgid ""
"Return the aligned lines of the table ROWS, indented by INDENT.\n"
"ROWS is a list of field lists or 'hline."
msgstr ""
"表の行 ROWS を揃えた行のリストを返す (字下げは INDENT).\n"
"ROWS は, 欄のリストか 'hline のリスト."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-context"
msgid ""
"Return the table at point as (START END INDENT ROW COLUMN OFFSET).\n"
"OFFSET is the column within the field."
msgstr "カーソルの表を (始め 終わり 字下げ 行 欄の番号 欄の中の桁) で返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-align-and-go"
msgid ""
"Align the table and move to row ROW, field COLUMN, OFFSET from the start of its text.\n"
"ROWS-CHANGE changes the rows before aligning."
msgstr ""
"表を揃え, 行 ROW, 欄 COLUMN (の, 文字の始めから OFFSET) へ動く.\n"
"ROWS-CHANGE で, 行を変えてから揃える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-cell-column"
msgid ""
"Return the column OFFSET from the start of the text of field COLUMN in the aligned LINE.\n"
"For an empty field, it is after the space after |."
msgstr ""
"揃えた行 LINE の, 欄 COLUMN の文字の始めから OFFSET の桁を返す.\n"
"空の欄なら, | の後の空白の後."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-columns"
msgid "Return the number of fields of ROWS."
msgstr "ROWS の欄の数を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-align"
msgid "Align the table at point."
msgstr "表を揃える (C-c C-c)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-empty-row"
msgid "Return an empty row for ROWS."
msgstr "ROWS の空の行を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-next-field"
msgid "Move to the next field; in the last field, add a row."
msgstr "次の欄へ動く (TAB).最後の欄なら, 行を足す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-previous-field"
msgid "Move to the previous field."
msgstr "前の欄へ動く (S-TAB)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-next-row"
msgid ""
"Move to the same field in the next row.\n"
"If there is no next row or it is a rule, add a row."
msgstr ""
"次の行の, 同じ欄へ動く (RET).\n"
"次が無いか横線なら, 行を足す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-insert-hline"
msgid "Insert a rule below the current row."
msgstr "今の行の下に横線を入れる (C-c -)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-swap"
msgid "Swap elements I and J of ITEMS."
msgstr "リスト ITEMS の I 番目と J 番目を入れ換える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-map-cells"
msgid "Apply F to the fields of each row of ROWS, keeping rules."
msgstr "ROWS の各行の欄を F で変える (横線はそのまま)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-pad"
msgid "Pad each row of ROWS to the number of fields."
msgstr "ROWS の各行を, 欄の数に揃える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-move-column"
msgid ""
"Move the current column left or right (M-left, M-right).\n"
"FORWARD moves it right."
msgstr ""
"列を動かす (M-左右).\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら右へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-move-row"
msgid ""
"Move the current row up or down (M-up, M-down).\n"
"FORWARD moves it down."
msgstr ""
"行を動かす (M-上下).\n"
"FORWARD が #t なら下へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-delete-column"
msgid "Delete the current column (M-S-left)."
msgstr "列を消す (M-S-左)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-insert-column"
msgid "Insert a column on the left (M-S-right)."
msgstr "列を左に足す (M-S-右)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-kill-row"
msgid "Delete the current row (M-S-up)."
msgstr "行を消す (M-S-上)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-insert-row"
msgid "Insert a row above (M-S-down)."
msgstr "行を上に足す (M-S-下)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-table-create-or-convert-from-region"
msgid "Create a table."
msgstr "C-c |: 表を作る."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-sort"
msgid ""
"Sort the children of the current heading.\n"
"Sort by a (title), n (number), o (TODO order), p (priority) or t (date);\n"
"uppercase letters sort in reverse."
msgstr ""
"C-c ^: 見出しの子を並べ替える.\n"
"a: 題, n: 数, o: TODO の順, p: 優先度, t: 日付.大文字は逆."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-modifier-cursor-error"
msgid "Signal an error for a key pressed outside tables, headings and items."
msgstr "表, 見出し, 項目のほかの所で押したときの, 失敗にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftselect-error"
msgid "Signal an error for a shift key pressed where Org mode does not use it."
msgstr "Org mode の使わない所で, S- のキーを押したときの, 失敗にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-context"
msgid "Return the kind of the line of point: table, heading, item or text."
msgstr "カーソルの行の種類 (table heading item text) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-metaleft"
msgid "Move the column left, promote the heading, outdent the item, or move back a word."
msgstr "M-左: 表なら列を左へ, 見出しなら浅く, 項目なら字下げを浅く, ほかは前の単語へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-metaright"
msgid "Move the column right, demote the heading, indent the item, or move forward a word."
msgstr "M-右: 表なら列を右へ, 見出しなら深く, 項目なら字下げを深く, ほかは次の単語へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-metaup"
msgid "Move the table row, subtree, item or line up."
msgstr "M-上: 表の行, 木, 項目, 行を上へ動かす."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-metadown"
msgid "Move the table row, subtree, item or line down."
msgstr "M-下: 表の行, 木, 項目, 行を下へ動かす."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftmetaleft"
msgid "Delete the table column, promote the subtree, or outdent the item with its children."
msgstr "M-S-左: 表なら列を消す, 見出しなら木を浅く, 項目なら子と一緒に字下げを浅く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftmetaright"
msgid "Insert a table column, demote the subtree, or indent the item with its children."
msgstr "M-S-右: 表なら列を足す, 見出しなら木を深く, 項目なら子と一緒に字下げを深く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftmetaup"
msgid "Delete the table row, or move the subtree, item or line up."
msgstr "M-S-上: 表なら行を消す, ほかは木, 項目, 行を上へ動かす."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftmetadown"
msgid "Insert a table row, or move the subtree, item or line down."
msgstr "M-S-下: 表なら行を足す, ほかは木, 項目, 行を下へ動かす."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-at-item-bullet-p"
msgid "Return #t if point is on the bullet of a list item."
msgstr "カーソルがリストの印の上なら #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftup"
msgid "Change the timestamp, raise the priority, or move to the previous item."
msgstr "S-上: 日付を変える, 見出しなら優先度を上げる, 項目なら前の項目へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftdown"
msgid "Change the timestamp, lower the priority, or move to the next item."
msgstr "S-下: 日付を変える, 見出しなら優先度を下げる, 項目なら次の項目へ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftright"
msgid "Change the timestamp by a day, the TODO state, or the list bullet."
msgstr "S-右: 日付の日を進める, 見出しなら次の状態, リストの印の上なら次の印."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-shiftleft"
msgid "Change the timestamp back by a day, the TODO state, or the list bullet."
msgstr "S-左: 日付の日を戻す, 見出しなら前の状態, リストの印の上なら前の印."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-ctrl-c-ctrl-c"
msgid "Align the table, toggle the checkbox, set the heading tags, or reread the #+ lines."
msgstr "C-c C-c: 表を揃える, チェックボックス, 見出しのタグ, #+ の行を読み直す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-return"
msgid ""
"Move to the next table row, open the link at point, or insert a newline.\n"
"Links are opened if `org-return-follows-link' is true."
msgstr "RET: 表なら次の行, リンクの上なら開く (org-return-follows-link), ほかは改行."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-stored-links"
msgid "Stored links, a list of (LINK DESCRIPTION), newest first."
msgstr "覚えたリンク.(リンク 説明) のリスト.新しい順."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-abbreviate-file-name"
msgid "Replace the home directory in FILE with ~."
msgstr "FILE のホームを ~ にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-file-directory"
msgid "Return the directory of FILE, up to the last /."
msgstr "FILE のディレクトリ (最後の / まで) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-file-base"
msgid "Return the name of FILE without the directory and extension."
msgstr "FILE の名前 (ディレクトリと拡張子を除く) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-link-at-point"
msgid ""
"Return the link at point as (LINK DESCRIPTION START END), or #f if there is none.\n"
"START and END are columns."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの所のリンクを (リンク 説明 始め 終わり) で返す.無ければ #f.\n"
"始めと終わりは桁."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-make-link-string"
msgid "Return the link LINK with DESCRIPTION, like [[LINK][DESCRIPTION]]."
msgstr "リンクの文字 ([[LINK][DESCRIPTION]]) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-store-link"
msgid "Store a link to the current location."
msgstr "C-c l: 今の所へのリンクを覚える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-strip-cookies"
msgid "Remove the statistics cookies ([2/3] [66%]) from TITLE."
msgstr "題 TITLE から, 数える印 ([2/3] [66%]) を除く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-insert-link"
msgid "Insert a link, or change the link at point."
msgstr "C-c C-l: リンクを入れる (リンクの上なら, 変える)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-open-at-point"
msgid "Open the link at point."
msgstr "C-c C-o: カーソルの所のリンクを開く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-link-open"
msgid ""
"Open LINK.\n"
"http and so on use `browse-url', file: opens in the editor,\n"
"and others are searched in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"リンク LINK を開く.\n"
"http などは browse-url, file: はエディタで開き,\n"
"ほかはバッファの中を探す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-link-search"
msgid ""
"Search the buffer for TARGET.\n"
"TARGET is *HEADING, #ID, a line number, /REGEXP/, <<TARGET>>, a title or words."
msgstr ""
"バッファの中で TARGET を探す.\n"
"TARGET は *見出し, #id, 行の数, /正規表現/, <<目当て>>, 題, 言葉."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-buffer-name"
msgid "Name of the agenda buffer."
msgstr "アジェンダのバッファの名前."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-markers"
msgid "Entries of the agenda lines, a list of (LINE FILE HEADING-LINE)."
msgstr "アジェンダの行の項目.(行 ファイル 見出しの行) のリスト."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-redo-command"
msgid "Procedure to rebuild the agenda (called by r and g)."
msgstr "アジェンダを作り直す手続き (r と g で呼ぶ)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-start-day"
msgid "First day of the weekly agenda."
msgstr "週のアジェンダの始めの日."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-agenda-previous-buffer"
msgid "Buffer shown before the agenda."
msgstr "アジェンダを出す前のバッファ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-file-list"
msgid ""
"Return the agenda files.\n"
"A directory in `org-agenda-files' means the .org files in it."
msgstr ""
"アジェンダのファイルを返す.\n"
"ディレクトリは, その中の .org のファイル."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-file-text"
msgid "Return the contents of FILE, or of its buffer if the buffer is modified."
msgstr "FILE の中身を返す.書き換えたバッファがあれば, そのバッファの中身."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-entries"
msgid ""
"Return the headings of FILE as a list of\n"
"(FILE LINE TODO PRIORITY TITLE TAGS CATEGORY SCHEDULED DEADLINE (DATES...) BODY)."
msgstr ""
"FILE の見出しを,\n"
"(ファイル 行 状態 優先度 題 タグ 分類 予定 締め切り (日付...) 本文) のリストで返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-all-entries"
msgid "Return the headings of all the agenda files."
msgstr "全てのアジェンダのファイルの見出しを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-file"
msgid "Return the file of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E のファイルを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-line"
msgid "Return the line of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E の行を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-todo"
msgid "Return the TODO state of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E の状態を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-priority"
msgid "Return the priority of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E の優先度を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-title"
msgid "Return the title of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E の題を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-tags"
msgid "Return the tags of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E のタグを返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-entry-category"
msgid "Return the category of the agenda entry E."
msgstr "アジェンダの項目 E の分類を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-timestamp-on?"
msgid "Return #t if the timestamp PARSED falls on DAY, including repeats."
msgstr "日付 PARSED が, 繰り返しも含めて, 日 DAY に当たれば #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-line"
msgid ""
"Return an agenda line of the entry E with TIME and EXTRA.\n"
"It shows the category, time, planning mark, state, title and tags."
msgstr ""
"項目 E の, TIME と EXTRA を付けたアジェンダの 1 行を返す.\n"
"分類, 時刻, 予定の印, 状態, 題, タグを出す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-time"
msgid ""
"Return the time of PARSED as shown in the agenda, like 10:00...... or 10:00-11:00.\n"
"A one-digit hour is padded with a space."
msgstr ""
"PARSED の時刻の見せ方を返す (10:00...... か 10:00-11:00).\n"
"時が 1 桁なら, 前に空白."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-day-items"
msgid ""
"Return the agenda lines of DAY from ENTRIES, as a list of (TIME LINE ENTRY PRIORITY).\n"
"TODAY is today's date."
msgstr ""
"ENTRIES から, 日 DAY の行を (時刻 行 項目 優先度) のリストで返す.\n"
"TODAY は今日の日付."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-priority"
msgid ""
"Return the priority of the entry E as a number, like `org-get-priority' in Emacs.\n"
"The lowest priority is 0, and each step up adds 1000."
msgstr ""
"項目 E の優先度の数を返す (Emacs の org-get-priority).\n"
"一番低いものが 0 で, 1 つ上がるごとに 1000."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-sort"
msgid ""
"Sort ITEMS: lines with a time first, in time order;\n"
"lines with the same time or no time by priority, highest first.\n"
"This is the default of `org-agenda-sorting-strategy' in Emacs\n"
"(time-up priority-down category-keep)."
msgstr ""
"時刻のある行を先に, 時刻の順に並べる.同じ時刻と, 時刻の無い行は, 優先度の高い順.\n"
"Emacs の org-agenda-sorting-strategy の既定 (time-up priority-down category-keep)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-show"
msgid ""
"Show ROWS in the agenda buffer, and remember REDO to rebuild it.\n"
"ROWS is a list of (LINE ENTRY); ENTRY is #f for a heading line."
msgstr ""
"ROWS をアジェンダのバッファに出し, 作り直す手続き REDO を覚える.\n"
"ROWS は (行 項目) のリスト.項目が #f なら, 見出しの行."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-mode"
msgid "Set the keys and highlighting of the agenda buffer."
msgstr "アジェンダのキーと色を付ける."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-date-line"
msgid "Return the line of DAY, like \"Monday     26 October 2026 W44\"."
msgstr "日 DAY の行を返す (Monday     26 October 2026 W44)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-list-from"
msgid "Show the weekly agenda for `org-agenda-span' days from START."
msgstr "START の日から, org-agenda-span 日の, 週のアジェンダを出す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-week-start"
msgid "Return the first day of the week of DAY, on `org-agenda-start-on-weekday'."
msgstr "DAY の週の始めの日 (org-agenda-start-on-weekday の曜日) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-list"
msgid "Show the weekly agenda."
msgstr "週のアジェンダを出す (a)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-todo-list"
msgid "Show the list of TODO entries."
msgstr "TODO の一覧を出す (t)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-tags-view"
msgid ""
"Show the entries matching tags.\n"
"a+b means both, a|b either, and -a without a."
msgstr ""
"タグの一覧を出す (m).\n"
"a+b は両方, a|b はどちらか, -a は無いもの."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-tags-match?"
msgid "Return #t if TAGS match MATCH."
msgstr "タグ TAGS が MATCH に合えば #t を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-search-view"
msgid "Show the headings containing all the words, ignoring case."
msgstr "言葉の一覧を出す (s).全ての言葉を含む見出し.大文字と小文字は区別しない."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda"
msgid "Select an agenda view."
msgstr "C-c a: アジェンダを選ぶ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-marker"
msgid ""
"Return the entry of the agenda line at point as (FILE LINE).\n"
"Signal an error if there is none."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの行の項目を (ファイル 行) で返す.\n"
"無ければ失敗にする."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-switch-to"
msgid "Open the file of the entry at point."
msgstr "RET: 項目のファイルを開く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-show-and-scroll-up"
msgid "Show the entry at point in another window."
msgstr "SPC と TAB: 項目を, ほかの窓に出す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-goto"
msgid "Show the entry at point in another window."
msgstr "項目を, ほかの窓に出す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-next-line"
msgid "Move to the next line of the agenda."
msgstr "アジェンダの次の行へ動く (n)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-previous-line"
msgid "Move to the previous line of the agenda."
msgstr "アジェンダの前の行へ動く (p)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-move"
msgid "Move the weekly agenda by DAYS days (f and b)."
msgstr "週のアジェンダを DAYS 日動かす (f と b)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-later"
msgid "Show the next week."
msgstr "次の週を出す (f)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-earlier"
msgid "Show the previous week."
msgstr "前の週を出す (b)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-goto-today"
msgid "Show the week of today."
msgstr "今日の週を出す (.)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-redo"
msgid "Rebuild the agenda."
msgstr "r と g: アジェンダを作り直す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-todo"
msgid "Change the TODO state of the entry at point."
msgstr "t: 項目の状態を変える."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-agenda-quit"
msgid "Kill the agenda buffer."
msgstr "q: アジェンダを消す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-capture-buffer-name"
msgid "Name of the capture buffer."
msgstr "キャプチャのバッファの名前."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "variable:org-capture-current"
msgid ""
"Current capture, as (TEMPLATE BUFFER POSITION).\n"
"BUFFER and POSITION are where the capture started."
msgstr "書いているキャプチャ.(テンプレート 元のバッファ 元の位置)."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-templates-list"
msgid "Return the capture templates, or the default ones if there are none."
msgstr "キャプチャのテンプレートを返す.無ければ, 既定のもの."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-expand-file"
msgid ""
"Return the target file of FILE.\n"
"\"\" means `org-default-notes-file'; a relative name is in `org-directory'."
msgstr ""
"行き先のファイル FILE を返す.\n"
"\"\" は org-default-notes-file.相対なら org-directory から."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-fill-template"
msgid ""
"Fill TEMPLATE, and return (TEXT POSITION).\n"
"ANNOTATION is the link to the original location, and FILE is its file."
msgstr ""
"テンプレート TEMPLATE を埋め, (文 カーソルの位置) を返す.\n"
"ANNOTATION は元の所へのリンク, FILE は元のファイル."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture"
msgid "Select a template and write in *Capture*."
msgstr "C-c c: テンプレートを選び, *Capture* で書く."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-place"
msgid ""
"Insert the captured TEXT of TYPE into TARGET.\n"
"This is called in the target buffer."
msgstr ""
"TYPE のキャプチャの文 TEXT を, 行き先 TARGET に入れる.\n"
"行き先のバッファで呼ぶ."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-adjust-level"
msgid "Change the levels of the headings in TEXT to LEVEL."
msgstr "TEXT の見出しの深さを, LEVEL に合わせる."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-finalize"
msgid "Finish the capture, add it to the target and save it."
msgstr "C-c C-c: キャプチャを終え, 行き先に足して保存する."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-capture-kill"
msgid "Abort the capture."
msgstr "C-c C-k: キャプチャを止める."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-buffer-list"
msgid "Return the Org buffers (.org files)."
msgstr "Org のバッファ (.org のファイル) を返す."

#: lisp/org.scm
msgctxt "function:org-switchb"
msgid "Switch to an Org buffer."
msgstr "Org のバッファに移る."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "variable:killed-rectangle"
msgid "Rectangle for `yank-rectangle' to insert: a list of strings, one for each line."
msgstr "`yank-rectangle` が入れる矩形. 行ごとの文字列の並び."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "variable:string-rectangle-history"
msgid "History list for `string-rectangle'."
msgstr "`string-rectangle` の入力の履歴."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--without-tabs"
msgid "Call THUNK with indent-tabs-mode turned off."
msgstr "`indent-tabs-mode` を切って, THUNK を呼ぶ."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:apply-on-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Call FUNCTION for each line of the rectangle with corners at START and END.\n"
"FUNCTION is called with the start and end columns of the rectangle, plus ARGS,\n"
"and point is at the beginning of the line.  Return point after the last call."
msgstr ""
"START と END を角とする矩形の各行について, FUNCTION を呼ぶ.\n"
"FUNCTION には, 矩形の左と右の桁と, ARGS を渡す. 呼ぶときの点は, 行の始め.\n"
"最後に呼んだ後の点を返す."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--delete-line"
msgid "Delete the columns from LEFT to RIGHT of the current line."
msgstr "今の行の, LEFT から RIGHT までの桁を消す."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--delete-extract-line"
msgid "Delete the columns from LEFT to RIGHT of the current line, and return the deleted text."
msgstr "今の行の, LEFT から RIGHT までの桁を消して, 消した文字を返す."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-extract-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Delete the contents of the rectangle with corners at START and END.\n"
"Return it as a list of strings, one for each line of the rectangle.\n"
"With an optional FILL argument, also fill lines where nothing has to be deleted."
msgstr ""
"START と END を角とする矩形の中身を消す.\n"
"消した中身を, 矩形の行ごとの文字列の並びで返す.\n"
"オプションの FILL があれば, 消す物が無い行も桁まで埋める."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Insert text of RECTANGLE with upper left corner at point.\n"
"RECTANGLE's first line is inserted at point, its second line is inserted at a point\n"
"vertically under point, etc.  RECTANGLE should be a list of strings.\n"
"After this command, the mark is at the upper left corner and point is at the lower right corner."
msgstr ""
"RECTANGLE の文字を, 点を左上の角として入れる.\n"
"RECTANGLE の 1 行目は点に入れ, 2 行目は点の真下に入れ, 以下も同じ.\n"
"RECTANGLE は文字列の並び.\n"
"入れた後は, マークが左上の角で, 点が右下の角になる."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Delete the region-rectangle and save it as the last killed one.\n"
"Called from a program with the corners START and END, delete that rectangle.\n"
"With a prefix argument (or a FILL argument), also fill lines where nothing has to be deleted."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの矩形を消して, 最後に消した矩形として覚える.\n"
"プログラムから呼ぶときは, 角の START と END で矩形を決めて消す.\n"
"前置引数 (か FILL) があれば, 消す物が無い行も桁まで埋める."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:yank-rectangle"
msgid "Yank the last killed rectangle with upper left corner at point."
msgstr "最後に消した矩形を, 点を左上の角として入れる."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--string-line"
msgid "Replace the columns from LEFT to RIGHT of the current line with STRING."
msgstr "今の行の, LEFT から RIGHT までの桁を STRING に置き換える."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:string-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Replace rectangle contents with STRING on each line.\n"
"The length of STRING need not be the same as the rectangle width.\n"
"Called from a program, takes three arguments: START, END and STRING."
msgstr ""
"矩形の中身を, 各行で STRING に置き換える.\n"
"STRING の長さは, 矩形の幅と同じでなくてよい.\n"
"プログラムから呼ぶときの引数は, START と END と STRING の 3 つ."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--args"
msgid "Return (START END FILL) for a rectangle command: from ARGS (START END [FILL]), or the region and the prefix argument."
msgstr "矩形のコマンドの (START END FILL) を返す. ARGS (START END [FILL]) か, リージョンと前置引数から."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--extract-line"
msgid "Return the text of the columns from LEFT to RIGHT of the current line, with tabs and missing columns as spaces."
msgstr "今の行の LEFT 列から RIGHT 列までの文字列を返す. タブと足りない桁は空白にする."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:extract-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Return the contents of the rectangle with corners at START and END.\n"
"Return it as a list of strings, one for each line of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"START と END を角とする矩形の内容を返す.\n"
"矩形の各行を 1 つずつの文字列にした一覧で返す."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-rectangle-as-kill"
msgid "Copy the region-rectangle and save it as the last killed one."
msgstr "リージョンの矩形をコピーして, 最後に kill したものとして覚える."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Delete (don't save) text in the region-rectangle.\n"
"The same range of columns is deleted in each line starting with the\n"
"line where the region begins and ending with the line where the region ends.\n"
"With a prefix (or a FILL) argument, also fill lines where nothing has to be deleted."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの矩形の文字を (kill せずに) 削除する.\n"
"リージョンの始まる行から終わる行まで, 各行で同じ範囲の桁を削除する.\n"
"前置引数 (か FILL) があれば, 削除するものが無い行も埋める."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--open-line"
msgid "Open a blank of the width of the rectangle at column LEFT of the current line."
msgstr "今の行の LEFT 列に, 矩形の幅の空白を開ける."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:open-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Blank out the region-rectangle, shifting text right.\n"
"The text previously in the region is not overwritten by the blanks,\n"
"but instead winds up to the right of the rectangle.\n"
"With a prefix (or a FILL) argument, fill with blanks even if there is\n"
"no text on the right side of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの矩形を空白にして, 文字を右にずらす.\n"
"矩形にあった文字は空白で上書きされず, 矩形の右に移る.\n"
"前置引数 (か FILL) があれば, 矩形の右に文字が無くても空白で埋める."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--clear-line"
msgid "Blank out the columns from LEFT to RIGHT of the current line."
msgstr "今の行の LEFT 列から RIGHT 列までを空白にする."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:clear-rectangle"
msgid ""
"Blank out the region-rectangle.\n"
"The text previously in the region is overwritten with blanks.\n"
"With a prefix (or a FILL) argument, also fill with blanks the parts of the\n"
"rectangle which were empty."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの矩形を空白にする.\n"
"矩形にあった文字は空白で上書きされる.\n"
"前置引数 (か FILL) があれば, 矩形のうち空だった部分も空白で埋める."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rect--default-line-number-format"
msgid "Return the default format string for numbering the lines from START-AT."
msgstr "START-AT から行に番号を付けるときの, 既定の書式の文字列を返す."

#: lisp/rect.scm
msgctxt "function:rectangle-number-lines"
msgid ""
"Insert numbers in front of the region-rectangle.\n"
"START-AT, if given, is the number from which to begin counting.  FORMAT, if given,\n"
"is a format string for the line count.  With a prefix argument, read START-AT and FORMAT."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの矩形の前に番号を挿入する.\n"
"START-AT があれば, 数え始める数. FORMAT があれば, 行の番号の書式の文字列.\n"
"前置引数があれば, START-AT と FORMAT を読む."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "variable:register-alist"
msgid ""
"List of elements (NAME CONTENTS), one for each Emacs register.\n"
"NAME is a one-character string, and CONTENTS is a string, a number or a rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Emacs のレジスタごとの (NAME CONTENTS) の並び.\n"
"NAME は 1 文字の文字列で, CONTENTS は文字列か数か矩形."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:get-register"
msgid "Return the contents of the register REGISTER, or #f if it is empty."
msgstr "レジスタ REGISTER の中身を返す. 空なら #f."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:set-register"
msgid "Set the contents of the register REGISTER to VALUE, and return VALUE."
msgstr "レジスタ REGISTER の中身を VALUE にして, VALUE を返す."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:register--read"
msgid "Read the name of a register with PROMPT."
msgstr "PROMPT で, レジスタの名前を読む."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-to-register"
msgid ""
"Copy the region into the register REGISTER.\n"
"Called from a program with REGISTER, START and END (and a true DELETE-FLAG to delete the text),\n"
"copy the text between START and END.  Interactively, with a prefix argument, delete the region."
msgstr ""
"リージョンをレジスタ REGISTER に入れる.\n"
"プログラムから REGISTER と START と END (と, 文字を消すなら真の DELETE-FLAG) を渡すと,\n"
"START と END の間を入れる. 対話的に使うときは, 前置引数があれば, リージョンを消す."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-register"
msgid ""
"Insert contents of the register REGISTER.  REGISTER is a one-character string.\n"
"Normally puts point before and mark after the inserted text.\n"
"If the optional second argument ARG is true, puts mark before and point after.\n"
"Interactively, ARG is true unless there is a prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"レジスタ REGISTER の中身を入れる. REGISTER は 1 文字の文字列.\n"
"普通は, 入れた文字の前に点を, 後ろにマークを置く.\n"
"オプションの第 2 引数 ARG が真なら, 前にマークを, 後ろに点を置く.\n"
"対話的に使うときは, 前置引数が無ければ ARG は真."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-rectangle-to-register"
msgid ""
"Copy rectangular region of text between START and END into REGISTER.\n"
"If DELETE-FLAG is true (interactively, with a prefix argument), delete the region after copying.\n"
"Called from Lisp, takes four arguments: REGISTER, START, END and DELETE-FLAG."
msgstr ""
"START と END の間の矩形の文字を REGISTER にコピーする.\n"
"DELETE-FLAG が真 (対話では前置引数があるとき) なら, コピーしたあとリージョンを削除する.\n"
"Lisp からは, REGISTER, START, END, DELETE-FLAG の 4 つの引数を取る."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:number-to-register"
msgid ""
"Store NUMBER in REGISTER.  If NUMBER is false, read a decimal number from the buffer\n"
"at point, and move point to the end of that number.\n"
"Interactively, NUMBER is the prefix argument (none means false)."
msgstr ""
"NUMBER を REGISTER に入れる. NUMBER が偽なら, ポイントにある 10 進数を\n"
"バッファから読み, ポイントをその数の終わりに動かす.\n"
"対話では, NUMBER は前置引数 (無ければ偽)."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:append-to-register"
msgid ""
"Append the region between START and END to REGISTER.\n"
"If DELETE-FLAG is true (interactively, with a prefix argument), delete the region after appending."
msgstr ""
"START と END の間のリージョンを REGISTER に追加する.\n"
"DELETE-FLAG が真 (対話では前置引数があるとき) なら, 追加したあとリージョンを削除する."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:increment-register"
msgid ""
"Augment contents of REGISTER using PREFIX.\n"
"If REGISTER contains a number, add the numeric value of PREFIX to it.\n"
"If REGISTER is empty or contains text, append the region to it, deleting the region\n"
"if PREFIX is true.  Interactively, PREFIX is the raw prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"PREFIX を使って REGISTER の内容を増やす.\n"
"REGISTER が数なら, PREFIX の数値を足す.\n"
"REGISTER が空か文字列なら, リージョンを追加し, PREFIX が真ならリージョンを削除する.\n"
"対話では, PREFIX は生の前置引数."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:point-to-register"
msgid ""
"Store the current location of point in REGISTER.\n"
"Use jump-to-register to go to that location."
msgstr ""
"今のポイントの位置を REGISTER に入れる.\n"
"その位置へ行くには jump-to-register を使う."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:window-configuration-to-register"
msgid ""
"Store the window configuration of the selected frame in REGISTER.\n"
"Use jump-to-register to restore the configuration."
msgstr ""
"選んでいるフレームのウィンドウの構成を REGISTER に入れる.\n"
"構成を戻すには jump-to-register を使う."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:jump-to-register"
msgid ""
"Go to the location stored in REGISTER, or restore the configuration stored there.\n"
"Push the mark if going to the location moves point, unless called in succession."
msgstr ""
"REGISTER に入れた位置へ行く. 構成が入っていれば, それを戻す.\n"
"位置へ行くとポイントが動くときは, 続けて呼んだ場合を除き, マークを積む."

#: lisp/register.scm
msgctxt "function:prepend-to-register"
msgid ""
"Prepend the region between START and END to REGISTER.\n"
"If DELETE-FLAG is true (interactively, with a prefix argument), delete the region after prepending."
msgstr ""
"リージョン START から END を, レジスタ REGISTER の前に足す.\n"
"DELETE-FLAG が真 (対話的には, 前置引数がある) なら, 足した後でリージョンを消す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "variable:case-replace"
msgid "Non-nil means `query-replace' should preserve case in replacements."
msgstr "非 nil なら, `query-replace' は置換で大文字と小文字を保つ."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "variable:query-replace-from-history"
msgid "History list for the search strings of `query-replace'."
msgstr "`query-replace' の検索の文字列の履歴の一覧."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--no-upper-p"
msgid "Return #t if STRING has no uppercase letter (a letter after a backslash does not count in a regexp)."
msgstr "STRING に大文字が無ければ #t を返す (正規表現では, バックスラッシュの後ろの文字は数えない)."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--search"
msgid "Search for STRING from point up to LIMIT.  Return #t on success, leaving point after (before if BACKWARD) the match."
msgstr "点から LIMIT までに STRING を検索する. 成功すれば #t を返し, 点は一致の後ろに (BACKWARD なら前に) 残す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--shift"
msgid "Shift every position of the match data DATA by DELTA."
msgstr "一致のデータ DATA の全ての位置を DELTA だけずらす."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:perform-replace"
msgid ""
"Replace some occurrences of FROM with TO, and return #f.\n"
"QUERY means ask about each match.  REGEXP means FROM is a regexp, and TO may use \\& and \\N.\n"
"DELIMITED means match only whole words.  START and END (or #f) bound the replacement; BACKWARD searches backward."
msgstr ""
"FROM を TO に置き換えて, #f を返す.\n"
"QUERY は一致ごとに聞く. REGEXP は FROM が正規表現であることを表し, TO では \\& と \\N を使える.\n"
"DELIMITED は単語全体の一致だけを対象にする. START と END (または #f) は置換の範囲を表す. BACKWARD は後ろへ検索する."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--read-args"
msgid "Read the string to replace and its replacement from the minibuffer.  Return (FROM TO)."
msgstr "置換する文字列と, その置き換えをミニバッファで読む. (FROM TO) を返す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--region-bounds"
msgid "Return (START END) of the active region, or (#f #f)."
msgstr "有効なリージョンの (START END) を返す. 無ければ (#f #f)."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--command"
msgid "Run a replace command: ARGS are (FROM TO DELIMITED START END BACKWARD), read interactively if empty."
msgstr "置換のコマンドを実行する. ARGS は (FROM TO DELIMITED START END BACKWARD). 空なら対話的に読む."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace-string"
msgid ""
"Replace occurrences of FROM-STRING with TO-STRING, from point to the end of the buffer (or in the region).\n"
"Arguments: FROM-STRING TO-STRING [DELIMITED START END BACKWARD]."
msgstr ""
"点から, バッファの終わり (またはリージョン) まで, FROM-STRING を TO-STRING に置き換える.\n"
"引数: FROM-STRING TO-STRING [DELIMITED START END BACKWARD]."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace-regexp"
msgid ""
"Replace things after point matching REGEXP with TO-STRING.\n"
"In TO-STRING, \\& stands for the whole match, and \\N for the Nth parenthesized group."
msgstr ""
"点の後ろで REGEXP に一致するものを TO-STRING に置き換える.\n"
"TO-STRING の中で, \\& は一致全体を, \\N は N 番目の括弧のグループを表す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:query-replace"
msgid ""
"Replace some occurrences of FROM-STRING with TO-STRING, asking about each.\n"
"Keys: SPC or y replaces, DEL or n skips, RET or q exits, . replaces and exits, , replaces and asks again, ! replaces all the rest."
msgstr ""
"FROM-STRING を TO-STRING に置き換える. 一致ごとに聞く.\n"
"キー: SPC か y で置換, DEL か n で飛ばす, RET か q で終わる, . で置換して終わる, , で置換してまた聞く, ! で残り全てを置換する."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:query-replace-regexp"
msgid ""
"Replace some things after point matching REGEXP with TO-STRING, asking about each.\n"
"See `query-replace' for the keys."
msgstr ""
"点の後ろで REGEXP に一致するものを TO-STRING に置き換える. 一致ごとに聞く.\n"
"キーは `query-replace' と同じ."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "variable:occur--targets"
msgid "Alist of the occur buffers and their targets: (BUFFER-NAME (OCCUR-LINE SOURCE-BUFFER POSITION) ...)."
msgstr "*Occur* バッファと, その対象の alist: (BUFFER-NAME (OCCUR-LINE SOURCE-BUFFER POSITION) ...)."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur--collect"
msgid "Return the matching lines of the current buffer as a list of (LINE TEXT POSITION MATCHES), and the number of matches."
msgstr "今のバッファで一致した行を (LINE TEXT POSITION MATCHES) のリストとして, 一致の数とともに返す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur--indent-continuation"
msgid "Prefix each line of TEXT after the first (a match across lines) with the context marker."
msgstr "TEXT の 1 行目より後ろの各行 (行をまたぐ一致) の前に, 文脈の印を付ける."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur--lines-of"
msgid "Return the line numbers to show: each matching line (in TEXT-LINES, with the lines it spans) and NLINES lines around it."
msgstr "出す行の番号を返す: 一致した各行 (TEXT-LINES の中で, その行が覆う行とともに) と, その前後の NLINES 行."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur"
msgid ""
"Show all lines in the current buffer containing a match for REGEXP, in the *Occur* buffer.\n"
"With a numeric prefix argument NLINES, also show NLINES lines of context around each match.\n"
"In the *Occur* buffer, RET goes to the match on the current line."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファで REGEXP に一致する全ての行を, *Occur* バッファに出す.\n"
"前置の数の引数 NLINES があれば, 各一致の前後 NLINES 行の文脈も出す.\n"
"*Occur* バッファでは, RET で今の行の一致へ行く."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur--current-target"
msgid "Return (SOURCE POSITION) of the occurrence on the current line of the *Occur* buffer, or #f."
msgstr "*Occur* バッファで今の行にある出現の (SOURCE POSITION) を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur-mode-goto-occurrence"
msgid "Go to the occurrence on the current line of the *Occur* buffer."
msgstr "*Occur* バッファで今の行にある出現へ行く."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur-next"
msgid "Move to the next occurrence in the *Occur* buffer."
msgstr "*Occur* バッファで次の出現へ動く."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:occur-prev"
msgid "Move to the previous occurrence in the *Occur* buffer."
msgstr "*Occur* バッファで前の出現へ動く."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "variable:hi-lock-face-defaults"
msgid "Default face names for the hi-lock commands."
msgstr "hi-lock のコマンドの既定の face の名前."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:hi-lock--next-face"
msgid "Return the next face of `hi-lock-face-defaults', cycling through them."
msgstr "`hi-lock-face-defaults' の次の face を返す (一周したら最初に戻る)."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:highlight-regexp"
msgid ""
"Highlight each match of REGEXP in the current buffer with FACE (SUBEXP selects a group).\n"
"Interactively, read REGEXP and use the next face of `hi-lock-face-defaults'."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファで REGEXP の各一致を FACE で強調する (SUBEXP はグループを選ぶ).\n"
"対話的に使うと, REGEXP を読み, `hi-lock-face-defaults' の次の face を使う."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:unhighlight-regexp"
msgid ""
"Remove the highlighting of REGEXP set by `highlight-regexp'.\n"
"With #t, or with a prefix argument interactively, remove all of it."
msgstr ""
"`highlight-regexp' で付けた, REGEXP の強調を消す.\n"
"#t のとき, または対話的に前置引数を付けたときは, 全ての強調を消す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:highlight-phrase"
msgid "Highlight each match of PHRASE, in which any run of white space matches any other."
msgstr "PHRASE の各一致を強調する. 空白の並びは, どの空白の並びとも一致する."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:hi-lock--symbol-at-point"
msgid "Return the symbol at or next to point, or #f."
msgstr "点にあるか, 点の隣にあるシンボルを返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:highlight-symbol-at-point"
msgid "Highlight each occurrence of the symbol at point."
msgstr "点にあるシンボルの出現を, それぞれ強調する."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:highlight-lines-matching-regexp"
msgid "Highlight the lines that match REGEXP."
msgstr "REGEXP に一致する行を強調する."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:replace--line-bounds"
msgid "Return (START END) with default values: from point to the end of the buffer."
msgstr "(START END) を返す. 省略したときは, カーソルからバッファの終わりまで."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:flush-lines"
msgid ""
"Delete lines containing matches for REGEXP.\n"
"When called from Lisp, delete lines between START and END (default: from point to the end of the\n"
"buffer).  If a match is split across lines, all the lines it lies in are deleted.\n"
"Return the number of deleted matching lines."
msgstr ""
"正規表現 REGEXP に合う行を消す.\n"
"Lisp から呼ぶと, START から END の間 (省略すると, カーソルからバッファの終わりまで) の行を消す.\n"
"合う所が複数の行にまたがれば, またがった行を全部消す.\n"
"消した行の数を返す."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:keep-lines"
msgid ""
"Delete all lines except those containing matches for REGEXP.\n"
"When called from Lisp, operate between START and END (default: from point to the end of the\n"
"buffer).  Start at the next line when point is not at the beginning of a line."
msgstr ""
"正規表現 REGEXP に合う行以外を全部消す.\n"
"Lisp から呼ぶと, START から END の間 (省略すると, カーソルからバッファの終わりまで) で行う.\n"
"カーソルが行の始めでなければ, 次の行から始める."

#: lisp/replace.scm
msgctxt "function:how-many"
msgid ""
"Print and return number of matches for REGEXP following point.\n"
"When called from Lisp, count between START and END (default: from point to the end of the buffer)."
msgstr ""
"カーソルより後ろで, 正規表現 REGEXP に合う所の数を返す.\n"
"Lisp から呼ぶと, START から END の間 (省略すると, カーソルからバッファの終わりまで) で数える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-command"
msgid ""
"The name (a symbol) of the previous command.\n"
"A command can look at it, for example to append a kill to the previous one."
msgstr ""
"前のコマンドの名前 (記号).\n"
"コマンドが見て, 例えば前の kill に続けて足すかを決められる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:this-command"
msgid ""
"The name (a symbol) of the running command.\n"
"A command can set it, so that the next command sees it as last-command."
msgstr ""
"動いているコマンドの名前 (記号).\n"
"コマンドが決められる. 次のコマンドからは last-command として見える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:temporary-goal-column"
msgid "The column that next-line and previous-line try to stay in."
msgstr "next-line と previous-line が, 留まろうとする桁."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:pending-undo-list"
msgid "The undo records that are not undone yet, while undo is repeated."
msgstr "undo を続けているときの, まだ元に戻していない記録."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:simple--interactive"
msgid "True while a command is run from the keyboard (the terminal app sets it), like called-interactively-p."
msgstr "コマンドをキーから動かしている間は真 (ターミナルのアプリが決める. called-interactively-p に当たる)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--allow-extend"
msgid "Return the ALLOW-EXTEND argument of a mark command: the second of ARGS, or true when called from the keyboard."
msgstr "マークのコマンドの ALLOW-EXTEND 引数を返す: ARGS の 2 番目. 無ければ, キーから動かしたとき真."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:call-interactively"
msgid "Call COMMAND as if it was typed with a key (the commands then act as called interactively)."
msgstr "COMMAND を, キーで打ったかのように呼ぶ (コマンドは, 対話的に呼ばれたように動く)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--arg"
msgid "Return the first of ARGS, or the numeric value of the prefix argument if ARGS is empty."
msgstr "ARGS の最初の値を返す. ARGS が空なら, 前置引数の数としての値を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:goal-column"
msgid ""
"The goal column of next-line and previous-line, or #f.\n"
"If it is a number, those commands move to that column of the line they move to."
msgstr ""
"next-line と previous-line の目標の桁. 無ければ #f.\n"
"数なら, それらのコマンドは, 動いた先の行のその桁に動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--raw-arg"
msgid "Return the first of ARGS, or the raw prefix argument (#f, a number, - or a list like (4)) if ARGS is empty."
msgstr "ARGS の最初の値を返す. ARGS が空なら, 前置引数そのまま (#f, 数, -, (4) のようなリスト) を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--match-around"
msgid ""
"Return #t if a match for REGEXP in the line contains point, and set the match data to it\n"
"(like thing-at-point-looking-at)."
msgstr ""
"行の中の REGEXP の一致が点を含めば #t を返し, 一致の情報をそれにする\n"
"(thing-at-point-looking-at と同じ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:number-at-point"
msgid ""
"Return the number at point, or #f if none is found.\n"
"Decimal numbers like \"14\" or \"-14.5\", as well as hex numbers like \"0xBEEF09\" or \"#xBEEF09\", are recognized."
msgstr ""
"点の数を返す. 無ければ #f.\n"
"\"14\" や \"-14.5\" のような 10 進の数と, \"0xBEEF09\" や \"#xBEEF09\" のような 16 進の数を読む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--read-natnum"
msgid ""
"Return the numeric prefix argument, or read a number with PROMPT (like goto-char--read-natnum-interactive).\n"
"The number at point, if it is a natural number, is the default."
msgstr ""
"数の前置引数を返す. 無ければ, PROMPT で数を聞く (goto-char--read-natnum-interactive と同じ).\n"
"点の数が自然数なら, それが既定の値."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:goto-char"
msgid ""
"Set point to POSITION, a number.\n"
"Interactively, POSITION is the numeric prefix argument, or read in the minibuffer;\n"
"the default is the natural number at point, and M-n also offers point."
msgstr ""
"点を位置 POSITION (数) にする.\n"
"対話的には, POSITION は数の前置引数か, ミニバッファで聞く数.\n"
"既定の値は点の自然数で, M-n では点の位置も出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-char"
msgid ""
"Move point N characters forward (backward if N is negative).\n"
"N is the prefix argument, or 1.  Signal an error at the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"点を N 文字進める (N が負なら戻す).\n"
"N は前置引数, または 1. バッファの終わりではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-char"
msgid ""
"Move point N characters backward (forward if N is negative).\n"
"N is the prefix argument, or 1.  Signal an error at the beginning of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"点を N 文字戻す (N が負なら進める).\n"
"N は前置引数, または 1. バッファの始めではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:left-char"
msgid ""
"Move point N characters to the left (to the right if N is negative).\n"
"The text is written from left to right, so this is backward-char."
msgstr ""
"点を N 文字左へ動かす (N が負なら右へ).\n"
"本文は左から右へ書くので, これは backward-char と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:right-char"
msgid ""
"Move point N characters to the right (to the left if N is negative).\n"
"The text is written from left to right, so this is forward-char."
msgstr ""
"点を N 文字右へ動かす (N が負なら左へ).\n"
"本文は左から右へ書くので, これは forward-char と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--move-line"
msgid ""
"Move point N lines, one line at a time, and to the goal column.\n"
"Signal an error if there are not N lines: point is then at the end of the buffer\n"
"(moving down) or at the beginning of the buffer (moving up)."
msgstr ""
"N 行を, 1 行ずつ動いて, 目標の桁に置く.\n"
"N 行無ければ, エラーにする. 点は, バッファの終わり (下へ動くとき) か, 始め (上へ動くとき) になる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:next-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to the next line, staying in the same column if possible.\n"
"If goal-column is a number, move to that column instead.  Signal an error at the last line."
msgstr ""
"点を次の行に動かす. できれば同じ桁に留まる.\n"
"goal-column が数なら, その桁に動く. 最後の行ではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:previous-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to the previous line, staying in the same column if possible.\n"
"If goal-column is a number, move to that column instead.  Signal an error at the first line."
msgstr ""
"点を前の行に動かす. できれば同じ桁に留まる.\n"
"goal-column が数なら, その桁に動く. 最初の行ではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:disabled-command-function"
msgid "Non-nil means that a disabled command asks before it runs.  Answering ! turns this off for the session."
msgstr "真なら, 使えないコマンドは動かす前に確かめる. ! と答えると, このセッションでは確かめなくなる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:disabled-commands"
msgid "The commands that ask before they run when they are invoked from a key or M-x (Emacs marks them disabled)."
msgstr "キーか M-x から呼ぶと, 動かす前に確かめるコマンド (Emacs で使えないとされているもの)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--disabled-ok"
msgid ""
"Return #t if COMMAND may run now.  A disabled command invoked from a key or M-x asks first:\n"
"n or C-g cancels it, y enables it for the session, SPC runs it once, ! enables all disabled commands."
msgstr ""
"COMMAND を今動かしてよければ #t を返す. キーか M-x から呼んだ使えないコマンドは, 先に確かめる:\n"
"n か C-g でやめる. y でこのセッションでは使えるようにする. SPC で 1 回だけ動かす. ! で使えないコマンドを全て使えるようにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-goal-column"
msgid ""
"Set the current column as the goal column of next-line and previous-line.\n"
"With an argument, clear the goal column."
msgstr ""
"今の桁を, next-line と previous-line の目標の桁にする.\n"
"引数があれば, 目標の桁を消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:move-beginning-of-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning of the line.\n"
"With argument N other than 1, move forward N - 1 lines first."
msgstr ""
"点を行の始めに動かす.\n"
"引数 N が 1 でなければ, 先に N - 1 行先へ動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:move-end-of-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to the end of the line.\n"
"With argument N other than 1, move forward N - 1 lines first.\n"
"If there are not that many lines above, go to the beginning of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"点を行の終わりに動かす.\n"
"引数 N が 1 でなければ, 先に N - 1 行先へ動く.\n"
"上にその行数が無ければ, バッファの始めに動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:back-to-indentation"
msgid "Move point to the first non-whitespace character on this line."
msgstr "点を, この行の空白でない最初の文字に動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:beginning-of-buffer"
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning of the buffer.\n"
"With numeric argument N, put point N/10 of the way from the beginning.\n"
"Push the mark at the previous position, unless the argument is a list like (4)\n"
"or the mark is active."
msgstr ""
"点をバッファの始めに動かす.\n"
"数の引数 N があれば, 始めから 10 分の N の所に置く.\n"
"引数が (4) のようなリストか, マークを使っているときを除いて, 前の位置にマークを置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:end-of-buffer"
msgid ""
"Move point to the end of the buffer.\n"
"With numeric argument N, put point N/10 of the way from the end.\n"
"Push the mark at the previous position, unless the argument is a list like (4)\n"
"or the mark is active."
msgstr ""
"点をバッファの終わりに動かす.\n"
"数の引数 N があれば, 終わりから 10 分の N の所に置く.\n"
"引数が (4) のようなリストか, マークを使っているときを除いて, 前の位置にマークを置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-word"
msgid ""
"Move point forward over N words (backward if N is negative).\n"
"Where a word ends is decided as in Emacs: Japanese kanji followed by kana make one word,\n"
"and so do other runs of characters of the same script."
msgstr ""
"点を N 個の単語の先に動かす (N が負なら後ろへ).\n"
"単語の切れ目は Emacs と同じに決める: 日本語の漢字とそれに続くかなは 1 語になり,\n"
"同じ書記体系の文字が続けば, 1 語になる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-word"
msgid "Move point backward over N words (forward if N is negative)."
msgstr "点を N 個の単語の前に動かす (N が負なら前へ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:left-word"
msgid ""
"Move point N words to the left (to the right if N is negative).\n"
"The text is written from left to right, so this is backward-word."
msgstr ""
"点を N 個の単語の左へ動かす (N が負なら右へ).\n"
"本文は左から右へ書くので, これは backward-word と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:right-word"
msgid ""
"Move point N words to the right (to the left if N is negative).\n"
"The text is written from left to right, so this is forward-word."
msgstr ""
"点を N 個の単語の右へ動かす (N が負なら左へ).\n"
"本文は左から右へ書くので, これは forward-word と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--goto-line"
msgid ""
"Go to the line given by ARGS (or the prefix argument, or read with PROMPT).\n"
"If RELATIVE, count from the beginning of the accessible part; otherwise widen first, then\n"
"widen the buffer for good if the line is outside the accessible part."
msgstr ""
"ARGS(なければ前置引数, それもなければ PROMPT で読んだ数)の行へ行く.\n"
"RELATIVE なら, 見えている部分の始めから数える. そうでなければ, 先に絞り込みをやめて数え,\n"
"行が見えている部分の外なら, 絞り込みをそのままやめる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:goto-line"
msgid ""
"Go to line N, counting from line 1 at the beginning of the buffer.\n"
"N is the argument or the numeric prefix argument; otherwise read it in the minibuffer.\n"
"Push the mark at the previous position, unless the mark is active.\n"
"If the line is outside the narrowed part, widen the buffer."
msgstr ""
"N 行目へ行く. 数えるのは, バッファの始めの行(1 行目)から.\n"
"N は引数か前置引数の数で, なければミニバッファで読む.\n"
"マークが有効でなければ, 前の位置にマークを置く.\n"
"行が絞り込みの外なら, 絞り込みをやめる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:goto-line-relative"
msgid ""
"Go to line N, counting from the line at the beginning of the accessible part.\n"
"N is the argument or the numeric prefix argument; otherwise read it in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"N 行目へ行く. 数えるのは, 見えている部分の始めの行から.\n"
"N は引数か前置引数の数で, なければミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:scroll-up-command"
msgid ""
"Scroll the text of the window up by almost one window height.\n"
"Signal an error at the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"窓の本文を, ほぼ 1 画面分, 上へ送る.\n"
"バッファの終わりではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:scroll-down-command"
msgid ""
"Scroll the text of the window down by almost one window height.\n"
"Signal an error at the beginning of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"窓の本文を, ほぼ 1 画面分, 下へ送る.\n"
"バッファの始めではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:recenter-top-bottom"
msgid "Put the line of point in the middle of the window."
msgstr "点のある行を, 窓の真ん中に置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:indent-tabs-mode"
msgid "Non-nil means indentation can use tab characters."
msgstr "字下げにタブ文字を使えるか."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:fill-prefix"
msgid "The string that is inserted after a line break in filled text, or #f."
msgstr "詰めた本文の, 改行の後に入れる文字列. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--spaces"
msgid "Return a string of N spaces (the empty string if N is not positive)."
msgstr "空白を N 個並べた文字列を返す (N が正でなければ, 空の文字列)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--indent-to"
msgid "Insert tabs (if indent-tabs-mode) and spaces so that point gets to COLUMN."
msgstr "点が COLUMN の桁になるように, タブ (indent-tabs-mode のとき) と空白を入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:move-to-column"
msgid ""
"Move point to column COLUMN in the current line, and return the column where it ends up.\n"
"The column of a tab or a wide character can be beyond COLUMN.\n"
"If the optional second argument FORCE is #t and the line is too short, add spaces (and tabs if\n"
"indent-tabs-mode) at the end of the line to reach COLUMN.  If FORCE is another true value and COLUMN\n"
"is in the middle of a tab, change the tab into spaces.\n"
"Interactively, COLUMN is the numeric prefix argument, or read in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"今の行の桁 COLUMN へ点を動かして, 着いた桁を返す.\n"
"タブや幅の広い文字の桁は, COLUMN を越えることがある.\n"
"オプションの第 2 引数 FORCE が #t で行が短ければ, 行の終わりに空白 (`indent-tabs-mode` ならタブも) を足して COLUMN まで届かせる.\n"
"FORCE がほかの真の値で COLUMN がタブの途中なら, そのタブを空白にする.\n"
"対話的には, COLUMN は数の前置引数か, ミニバッファで聞く数."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:newline"
msgid ""
"Insert N newlines.  N is the prefix argument, or 1.\n"
"Signal an error if N is negative."
msgstr ""
"改行を N 個入れる. N は前置引数, または 1.\n"
"N が負なら, エラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:open-line"
msgid "Insert N newlines and leave point before them.  N is the prefix argument, or 1."
msgstr "改行を N 個入れて, 点は改行の前に置く. N は前置引数, または 1."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:split-line"
msgid ""
"Split the current line, moving the part beyond point to a new line below.\n"
"The new line gets the same indentation as the column of point."
msgstr ""
"今の行を分けて, 点より後ろを下の行にする.\n"
"新しい行は, 点の桁まで字下げする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-for-tab-command"
msgid ""
"Indent the current line or the region, or insert whitespace at point.\n"
"In a Lisp buffer, fix the indentation of the line; with an active region, indent the region.\n"
"Elsewhere, move to the next indent point of the previous line (indent-relative)."
msgstr ""
"今の行かリージョンを字下げする. または点に空白を入れる.\n"
"Lisp のバッファでは, 行の字下げを直す. リージョンが有効なら, リージョンを字下げする.\n"
"ほかでは, 前の行の次の字下げの位置 (indent-relative) へ動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-region"
msgid ""
"Indent each nonblank line in the region (the lines from START to END).\n"
"Without arguments, the region is used.  With a third argument COLUMN, indent every nonblank line to COLUMN."
msgstr ""
"リージョン (START から END の行) の, 空でない行を字下げする.\n"
"引数が無ければ, リージョンを使う. 3 つ目の引数 COLUMN があれば, 空でない行を全部 COLUMN に字下げする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-sexp"
msgid "Indent each line of the list starting just after point (Lisp buffers only)."
msgstr "点の後ろのリストの, 各行を字下げする (Lisp のバッファだけ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-rigidly"
msgid ""
"Indent all lines starting in the region by ARG columns (the prefix argument, default 1).\n"
"Without START and END, the region is used."
msgstr ""
"リージョンで始まる行を全て ARG 桁だけ字下げする (前置引数, 既定は 1).\n"
"START と END を省くと, リージョンを使う."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:tab-to-tab-stop"
msgid "Insert whitespace at point, then move to the next tab stop (a multiple of 8 columns)."
msgstr "点の所に空白を入れて, 次のタブの位置 (8 桁の倍数) まで動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-fill-prefix"
msgid ""
"Set the fill prefix to the current line up to point.\n"
"At the beginning of a line, cancel the fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"点までの今の行を, 詰めの接頭辞にする.\n"
"行の先頭にいるときは, 詰めの接頭辞を取り消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:fill-paragraph"
msgid ""
"Fill the paragraph at or after point.\n"
"With an active region (from the keyboard), fill each paragraph of the region.\n"
"In a Lisp buffer, fill the comment or the docstring around point, or break a long line of code."
msgstr ""
"点の所か, 次の段落を詰める.\n"
"有効なリージョンがあれば (キーボードから), リージョンの各段落を詰める.\n"
"Lisp のバッファでは, 点の回りのコメントか docstring を詰めるか, 長いコードの行を折る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:fill-region"
msgid ""
"Fill each of the paragraphs in the region.\n"
"Called from Lisp with FROM and TO, fill the paragraphs between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの段落を, それぞれ詰める.\n"
"Lisp から呼ぶと, FROM から TO の間の段落を詰める."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:comment-column"
msgid "Column to indent a comment to."
msgstr "コメントを字下げする桁."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:comment-dwim"
msgid "Comment or uncomment the region, or insert a comment or move to the one on this line."
msgstr "リージョンをコメントにするか外す. 無ければ, この行のコメントを作るか, そこへ動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:comment-line"
msgid ""
"Comment or uncomment the current line, then move to the next line.\n"
"With an active region, comment or uncomment the lines it covers instead."
msgstr ""
"今の行をコメントにするか, コメントを外して, 次の行へ動く.\n"
"有効なリージョンがあれば, 代わりにそれが覆う行をコメントにするか, コメントを外す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:comment-set-column"
msgid "Set the comment column to the argument, or to the current column."
msgstr "コメントの桁を, 引数か, 今の桁にする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:default-indent-new-line"
msgid ""
"Break the line at point and delete the spaces around the break.\n"
"The new line is not indented yet: indentation comes with the indentation commands."
msgstr ""
"点で行を分けて, 分けた所の空白を消す.\n"
"新しい行はまだ字下げしない. 字下げは, 字下げのコマンドで行う."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-char"
msgid ""
"Delete the following N characters (previous if N is negative).\n"
"Optional second arg KILLFLAG non-nil means to kill (save in kill ring) instead of delete.\n"
"Interactively, N is the prefix argument, and KILLFLAG is true if there is a prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"後ろの N 文字を消す (N が負なら前の文字).\n"
"オプションの第 2 引数 KILLFLAG が真なら, 消さずに切る (kill-ring に入れる).\n"
"対話的に使うときは, N は前置引数で, 前置引数があれば KILLFLAG は真."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-forward-char"
msgid "Delete the N characters after point (the N characters before point if N is negative)."
msgstr "点の後ろの N 文字を消す (N が負なら点の前の N 文字を消す)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-backward-char"
msgid "Delete the N characters before point (the N characters after point if N is negative)."
msgstr "点の前の N 文字を消す (N が負なら点の後ろの N 文字を消す)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--delete-space"
msgid "Delete the characters of CHARS around point (only before point if BACKWARD-ONLY is true)."
msgstr "点の前後の CHARS の文字を消す (BACKWARD-ONLY が真なら, 点の前だけ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-horizontal-space"
msgid ""
"Delete all spaces and tabs around point.\n"
"With an argument, delete them only before point."
msgstr ""
"点の前後の空白とタブを全て消す.\n"
"引数があれば, 点の前だけ消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--fixup-whitespace"
msgid "Fix up white space between objects around point: leave no space or one space."
msgstr "点の前後の空白を整える: 空白を無くすか, 1 つにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:just-one-space"
msgid ""
"Delete all spaces and tabs around point, leaving one space (or N spaces).\n"
"If N is negative, delete newlines as well, leaving -N spaces."
msgstr ""
"点の前後の空白とタブを全て消して, 空白を 1 つ (か N 個) 残す.\n"
"N が負なら, 改行も消して, 空白を -N 個残す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:simple--cycle-context"
msgid "The state of cycle-spacing: (original-point whitespace-string n last-action)."
msgstr "cycle-spacing の状態: (元の点 空白の文字列 N 前の動作)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--cycle-restore"
msgid "Put back the white space cycle-spacing found."
msgstr "cycle-spacing が見つけた空白を, 元に戻す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:cycle-spacing"
msgid ""
"Manipulate the white space around point in a cycle.\n"
"The first call leaves one space (just-one-space), the second deletes all the\n"
"white space, and the third restores it.  Repeat the command to cycle."
msgstr ""
"点の前後の空白を, 順に変える.\n"
"1 回目は空白を 1 つ残し (just-one-space), 2 回目は全て消し, 3 回目は元に戻す. 続けて呼ぶと, 巡る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-indentation"
msgid ""
"Join this line to the previous one and fix up the white space at the join.\n"
"With an argument, join the current line to the following line.\n"
"When BEG and END are given, join all lines in the region they define.\n"
"Interactively, BEG and END are the start and the end of the region if it is\n"
"active (the region is ignored if there is a prefix argument)."
msgstr ""
"この行を前の行につなぎ、つなぎ目の空白を整える.\n"
"引数があれば、この行を次の行につなぐ.\n"
"BEG と END を渡すと、その範囲の全ての行をつなぐ.\n"
"対話的には、リージョンが有効ならその始めと終わりが BEG と END になる (前置引数があれば、リージョンは無視する)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-blank-lines"
msgid ""
"On a blank line, delete all the surrounding blank lines, leaving just one.\n"
"On an isolated blank line, delete that one.\n"
"On a nonblank line, delete any blank lines that follow it."
msgstr ""
"空行の上では, 周りの空行を消して 1 つ残す.\n"
"1 つだけの空行なら, それを消す.\n"
"空行でない行の上では, 続く空行を消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:select-enable-clipboard"
msgid ""
"Non-nil means kills also go to the clipboard, and a yank uses the clipboard text if another program changed it.\n"
"The terminal app and the batch mode have no clipboard (like Emacs in a terminal)."
msgstr ""
"nil でなければ, kill をクリップボードにも書き, ほかのアプリがクリップボードを変えていれば, yank はその文字を使う.\n"
"ターミナルのアプリとバッチモードには, クリップボードが無い (端末の Emacs と同じ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:simple--last-selected-text"
msgid "The text that this editor put on the clipboard last."
msgstr "このエディタが最後にクリップボードに書いた文字."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--gui-set-selection"
msgid "Put TEXT on the clipboard if select-enable-clipboard (Emacs's interprogram-cut-function)."
msgstr "select-enable-clipboard なら, TEXT をクリップボードに書く (Emacs の interprogram-cut-function)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--gui-selection-value"
msgid ""
"Return the clipboard text if select-enable-clipboard and another program changed it, or #f\n"
"(Emacs's interprogram-paste-function)."
msgstr ""
"select-enable-clipboard で, ほかのアプリがクリップボードを変えていれば, その文字を返す. そうでなければ #f\n"
"(Emacs の interprogram-paste-function)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-new"
msgid ""
"Make STRING the latest kill in the kill ring, and put it on the clipboard (see select-enable-clipboard).\n"
"If REPLACE (the optional second argument) is true, replace the latest kill instead."
msgstr ""
"STRING を kill-ring の最新の kill にし, クリップボードに書く (select-enable-clipboard を見る).\n"
"REPLACE (オプションの第 2 引数) が真なら, 最新の kill を置き換える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-append"
msgid "Append STRING to the end of the latest kill (to the beginning if BEFORE-P), and put the kill on the clipboard."
msgstr "STRING を最新の kill の終わり (BEFORE-P なら初め) に足し, その kill をクリップボードに書く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:current-kill"
msgid ""
"Rotate the yanking point by N places, and return that kill.\n"
"If N is zero and another program put text on the clipboard, push that text as the latest kill, and return it.\n"
"If DO-NOT-MOVE (the optional second argument) is true, do not rotate the yanking point."
msgstr ""
"yank の位置を N だけ回し, その kill を返す.\n"
"N が 0 で, ほかのアプリがクリップボードに書いていれば, その文字を最新の kill にして返す.\n"
"DO-NOT-MOVE (オプションの第 2 引数) が真なら, yank の位置を回さない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--with-clipboard"
msgid "Run COMMAND (interactively if ARGS is empty) with select-enable-clipboard set."
msgstr "select-enable-clipboard を真にして, COMMAND を動かす (ARGS が空なら対話的に)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:clipboard-kill-ring-save"
msgid "Copy the region to the kill ring and to the clipboard (kill-ring-save with select-enable-clipboard)."
msgstr "リージョンを kill-ring とクリップボードに写す (select-enable-clipboard を真にした kill-ring-save)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:clipboard-kill-region"
msgid "Kill the region, and put it on the clipboard (kill-region with select-enable-clipboard)."
msgstr "リージョンを kill して, クリップボードに書く (select-enable-clipboard を真にした kill-region)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:clipboard-yank"
msgid "Insert the clipboard text, or the latest kill (yank with select-enable-clipboard)."
msgstr "クリップボードの文字か, 最新の kill を入れる (select-enable-clipboard を真にした yank)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--kill"
msgid ""
"Delete the text between FROM and TO and save it in the kill ring.\n"
"If the previous command was a kill, append the text to its kill."
msgstr ""
"FROM と TO の間の本文を消して, kill-ring に入れる.\n"
"前のコマンドも kill だったなら, その kill に足す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-region"
msgid ""
"Kill the text between point and the mark, or between the two positions FROM and TO.\n"
"The killed text is saved in the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"点とマークの間か, 2 つの位置 FROM と TO の間の本文を kill する.\n"
"kill した本文は kill-ring に入る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-ring-save"
msgid ""
"Save the region in the kill ring, without killing it.\n"
"Called from Lisp with START and END, save the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを kill-ring に保存する (消さない).\n"
"Lisp から START と END を渡すと, その間の文字を保存する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-line"
msgid ""
"Kill the rest of the line; if there are no nonblanks there, kill through the newline.\n"
"With an argument N, kill that many lines from point; a negative N kills backward,\n"
"and 0 kills the text before point on the line.  Signal an error at the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"行の残りを kill する. 空白だけしか無ければ, 改行まで kill する.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 行を kill する (負なら前向き. 0 なら, 行の点より前).\n"
"バッファの終わりではエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--marker"
msgid "Return where POSITION is after the text from FROM to TO was deleted."
msgstr "FROM から TO の本文を消した後の, POSITION の位置を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-whole-line"
msgid ""
"Kill the current line, with its newline.\n"
"With an argument N, kill that many lines from the current line; a negative N kills\n"
"backward, also killing the preceding newline.  With 0, kill the line without its newline."
msgstr ""
"今の行を, 改行ごと kill する.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 今の行から N 行を kill する. 負なら前向きで, 前の改行も kill する. 0 なら, 改行を除いて kill する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-kbd-macro"
msgid "Last kbd macro defined, as a list of key names (nil if none)."
msgstr "最後に定義したキーボードマクロ (キーの名前の並び. 無ければ空)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:executing-kbd-macro"
msgid "Non-nil while a keyboard macro is executing."
msgstr "キーボードマクロを動かしている間は, 空でない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--end-kbd-macro"
msgid "Finish defining a keyboard macro and remember it in `last-kbd-macro'."
msgstr "キーボードマクロの定義を終え, last-kbd-macro に覚える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:start-kbd-macro"
msgid ""
"Record subsequent keyboard input, defining a keyboard macro.\n"
"The commands are recorded even as they are executed.\n"
"With a prefix argument (or APPEND), append to the last macro instead of starting a new one."
msgstr ""
"以後のキー入力を覚えて, キーボードマクロを作る.\n"
"実行したコマンドも覚える.\n"
"前置引数 (か APPEND) があれば, 新しく作らず, 最後のマクロの続きに覚える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:end-kbd-macro"
msgid ""
"Finish defining a keyboard macro.\n"
"The definition was started by start-kbd-macro.  The macro is now available for use with\n"
"call-last-kbd-macro.  With numeric arg, repeat the macro now that many times, counting the\n"
"definition just completed as the first repetition.  An argument of zero means repeat until error."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロを覚え終える.\n"
"覚え始めたのは start-kbd-macro. マクロは call-last-kbd-macro で使える.\n"
"数の引数があれば, 覚えたものを 1 回目と数えて, その回数だけマクロを動かす. 0 なら, 失敗するまで繰り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:call-last-kbd-macro"
msgid ""
"Call the last keyboard macro that you defined.\n"
"A prefix argument serves as a repeat count.  Zero means repeat until error."
msgstr ""
"最後に覚えたキーボードマクロを動かす.\n"
"前置引数は, 繰り返す回数. 0 なら, 失敗するまで繰り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:kmacro-counter"
msgid "Current keyboard macro counter."
msgstr "キーボードマクロの今のカウンター."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:kmacro-last-counter"
msgid "Last counter inserted by `kmacro-insert-counter'."
msgstr "`kmacro-insert-counter' が最後に挿入したカウンター."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:kmacro-counter-format"
msgid "Format to use when inserting the keyboard macro counter."
msgstr "キーボードマクロのカウンターを挿入するときの書式."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-start-macro"
msgid ""
"Record subsequent keyboard input, defining a keyboard macro.\n"
"Without a prefix argument, the counter is reset to 0.  With a numeric prefix argument, the\n"
"counter is set to it.  With C-u, append to the last macro and keep the counter."
msgstr ""
"これから打つキーを覚えて, キーボードマクロを定義する.\n"
"前置引数が無ければ, カウンターを 0 に戻す. 数の前置引数があれば, カウンターをその値にする.\n"
"C-u なら, 最後のマクロの続きに覚え, カウンターは変えない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-insert-counter"
msgid ""
"Insert the next value of the keyboard macro counter and increment it.\n"
"With a numeric prefix argument, increment by that amount.  With C-u, insert the previous\n"
"value without incrementing."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロのカウンターの次の値を挿入して, 1 増やす.\n"
"数の前置引数があれば, その分だけ増やす. C-u なら, 増やさずに前の値を挿入する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-start-macro-or-insert-counter"
msgid "Start defining a keyboard macro, or insert the counter if one is being defined."
msgstr "キーボードマクロの定義を始める. 定義の途中なら, カウンターを挿入する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-end-macro"
msgid ""
"Finish defining a keyboard macro.\n"
"With numeric arg, repeat the macro now that many times, counting the definition just\n"
"completed as the first repetition.  An argument of zero means repeat until error."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロの定義を終える.\n"
"数の前置引数があれば, 今定義したものを 1 回目と数えて, その回数だけ繰り返す. 0 は, 失敗するまで繰り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-end-and-call-macro"
msgid ""
"Call the last keyboard macro, ending the definition first if one is in progress.\n"
"A prefix argument serves as a repeat count; zero means repeat until error."
msgstr ""
"最後のキーボードマクロを動かす. 定義の途中なら, 先に終える.\n"
"前置引数は繰り返す回数. 0 は, 失敗するまで繰り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-end-or-call-macro"
msgid "End the keyboard macro being defined, or call the last one."
msgstr "定義の途中のキーボードマクロを終える. 途中でなければ, 最後のマクロを動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kmacro-name-last-macro"
msgid "Assign a name to the last keyboard macro defined."
msgstr "最後に定義したキーボードマクロに名前を付ける."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--casify-region"
msgid "Convert the text between point and the mark, or between the two positions in ARGS, with MODE."
msgstr "点とマークの間か, ARGS の 2 つの位置の間の文字を, MODE で変換する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--casify-word"
msgid ""
"Convert the N words after point (before point if N is negative) with MODE.\n"
"Point moves to the end of the converted text, except for a negative N."
msgstr ""
"点の後ろ (N が負なら前) の N 語を, MODE で変換する.\n"
"点は, 変換した文字の終わりへ動く (N が負のときは動かない)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:upcase-region"
msgid ""
"Convert the region to upper case.\n"
"Called from Lisp with the two positions BEG and END, convert the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを大文字にする.\n"
"Lisp から 2 つの位置 BEG と END を渡すと, その間の文字を変換する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:downcase-region"
msgid ""
"Convert the region to lower case.\n"
"Called from Lisp with the two positions BEG and END, convert the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを小文字にする.\n"
"Lisp から 2 つの位置 BEG と END を渡すと, その間の文字を変換する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:upcase-initials-region"
msgid ""
"Upcase the initial of each word in the region.\n"
"Subsequent letters of each word are not changed.\n"
"Called from Lisp with the two positions BEG and END, convert the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの各単語の頭を大文字にする.\n"
"単語の残りの文字は変えない.\n"
"Lisp からは, 2 つの位置 BEG と END を付けて呼ぶと, その間の文字を変換する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:capitalize-region"
msgid ""
"Convert the region to capitalized form.\n"
"Capitalized form means each word's first character is upper case and the rest lower case.\n"
"Called from Lisp with the two positions BEG and END, convert the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを, 単語の頭だけ大文字にする.\n"
"各単語の初めの文字を大文字に, 残りを小文字にする.\n"
"Lisp から 2 つの位置 BEG と END を渡すと, その間の文字を変換する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:upcase-word"
msgid ""
"Convert to upper case from point to end of word, moving over.\n"
"With argument N, do this to that many words; a negative N converts the words before point\n"
"and leaves point where it is."
msgstr ""
"点から単語の終わりまでを大文字にして, 点を進める.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 語を変換する. N が負なら, 点の前の語を変換して, 点は動かさない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:downcase-word"
msgid ""
"Convert to lower case from point to end of word, moving over.\n"
"With argument N, do this to that many words; a negative N converts the words before point\n"
"and leaves point where it is."
msgstr ""
"点から単語の終わりまでを小文字にして, 点を進める.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 語を変換する. N が負なら, 点の前の語を変換して, 点は動かさない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:capitalize-word"
msgid ""
"Capitalize from point to the end of word, moving over.\n"
"With argument N, capitalize that many words; a negative N converts the words before point\n"
"and leaves point where it is."
msgstr ""
"点から単語の終わりまでを, 頭だけ大文字にして, 点を進める.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 語を変換する. N が負なら, 点の前の語を変換して, 点は動かさない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-word"
msgid ""
"Kill the characters forward until the end of a word.\n"
"With argument N, kill that many words."
msgstr ""
"単語の終わりまでの文字を, 前向きに kill する.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 個の単語を kill する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-kill-word"
msgid ""
"Kill the characters backward until the beginning of a word.\n"
"With argument N, kill that many words."
msgstr ""
"単語の始めまでの文字を, 後ろ向きに kill する.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 個の単語を kill する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:zap-to-char"
msgid ""
"Kill up to and including the Nth occurrence of CHAR.\n"
"Interactively, N is the prefix argument and CHAR is read as a key."
msgstr ""
"N 個目の CHAR まで (CHAR も含めて) kill する.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, N は前置引数で, CHAR はキーで読む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:append-next-kill"
msgid ""
"Cause the following command, if it is a kill, to append to the previous kill.\n"
"Interactively, it takes effect after this command."
msgstr ""
"次のコマンドが kill なら, 前の kill に足すようにする.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, このコマンドの後から効く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:ignore-preserving-kill-region"
msgid "Do nothing, but keep the kill that the previous command made for the next kill."
msgstr "何もしないが, 前のコマンドの kill を, 次の kill のために残す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:yank"
msgid ""
"Insert the most recent kill at point, and leave the mark at the start of the text.\n"
"With a plain prefix argument (C-u), leave point at the start and the mark at the end.\n"
"With a number N, insert the Nth most recent kill; with -, the second most recent."
msgstr ""
"一番新しい kill を点の所に入れ, マークを入れた本文の始めに置く.\n"
"C-u なら, 点を始めに, マークを終わりに置く.\n"
"数 N なら N 番目に新しい kill を, - なら 2 番目に新しい kill を入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:yank-pop"
msgid ""
"Replace the text just yanked with the previous kill in the kill ring.\n"
"With an argument N, use the Nth previous kill.  If the previous\n"
"command was not a yank, read a kill from the kill ring in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"今貼った本文を, kill-ring の一つ前の kill に替える.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 個前の kill を使う. 前のコマンドが yank でなければ, kill-ring の中から\n"
"ミニバッファで選んで入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-buffer"
msgid ""
"Insert after point the contents of BUFFER, and leave point before it and the mark after it.\n"
"Interactively, read the name of BUFFER in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"BUFFER の内容を点の後ろに入れ, 点は入れた本文の前に, マークは後ろに置く.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, ミニバッファで BUFFER の名前を読む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--transpose"
msgid "Transpose the objects that MOVER moves over, as transpose-chars, transpose-words and transpose-lines do."
msgstr "MOVER が動く単位を入れ替える (transpose-chars, transpose-words, transpose-lines が使う)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--transpose-pairs"
msgid "Transpose the objects whose start and end AUX returns (a list of two positions) for a direction."
msgstr "AUX が向きごとに返す (2 つの位置のリストの) 始めと終わりの対象を入れ替える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--transpose-1"
msgid "Swap the text of the two regions POS1 and POS2, each a list (start end), keeping the markers at their ends."
msgstr "2 つの範囲 POS1 と POS2 (どちらも (始め 終わり)) の本文を入れ替える. 範囲の両端のマーカーは, そのままにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-chars"
msgid ""
"Interchange the characters around point, and move point forward over them.\n"
"At the end of a line, the previous two characters are interchanged.\n"
"With argument N, drag the character before point forward over N other characters."
msgstr ""
"点の前後の文字を入れ替えて, 点をその先に動かす.\n"
"行の終わりでは, 前の 2 文字を入れ替える.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 点の前の文字を N 文字先へ動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-words"
msgid ""
"Interchange the words around point, and move point over the second.\n"
"With argument N, drag the word before or around point forward over N other words."
msgstr ""
"点の前後の単語を入れ替えて, 点を 2 番目の単語の先に動かす.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 点の前か点の所の単語を N 個先へ動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-lines"
msgid ""
"Exchange the current line and the previous line, and leave point after both.\n"
"With argument N, move the previous line past N lines."
msgstr ""
"今の行と前の行を入れ替えて, 点を両方の後ろに置く.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 前の行を N 行先へ動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:quoted-insert"
msgid ""
"Read a character and insert it as it is, N times.\n"
"A control key inserts its control character (C-x inserts ^X), a Meta key the character with the\n"
"eighth bit set (M-a inserts the character 225), RET inserts a carriage return."
msgstr ""
"文字を 1 つ読んで, そのまま N 個入れる.\n"
"制御キーは制御文字を入れる (C-x は ^X). Meta キーは 8 ビット目を立てた文字を入れる (M-a は文字 225).\n"
"RET はキャリッジリターンを入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:set-mark-command-repeat-pop"
msgid "Non-nil means that repeating set-mark-command after popping a mark pops another one."
msgstr "真なら, マークを取り出した後に set-mark-command を繰り返すと, 次のマークを取り出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:push-mark-command"
msgid ""
"Set the mark at point; with an argument, set it even if it is already there.\n"
"If the mark is already at point, activate it instead.  The second argument\n"
"NOMSG, if true, suppresses the message."
msgstr ""
"点にマークを置く. 引数があれば, すでにそこにあっても置く.\n"
"マークがすでに点にあれば, 代わりに使う状態にする. 第 2 引数 NOMSG が真なら, メッセージを出さない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:pop-to-mark-command"
msgid "Jump to the mark, and pop a new position for the mark off the mark ring."
msgstr "マークに移り, マークの履歴から新しいマークの位置を取り出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:pop-global-mark"
msgid "Pop off the global mark ring and jump to the top location."
msgstr "バッファをまたぐマークの履歴から取り出し, 先頭の場所に移る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-mark-command"
msgid ""
"Set the mark where point is, and activate it; or jump to the mark.\n"
"With a plain prefix argument (C-u), jump to the mark and pop the mark ring.\n"
"With C-u C-u, set the mark and activate it without the special cases.\n"
"Repeated, it activates or deactivates the mark."
msgstr ""
"点にマークを置いて使う状態にする. または, マークに移る.\n"
"前置引数だけ (C-u) なら, マークに移ってマークの履歴を取り出す.\n"
"C-u C-u なら, 特別な場合を除いて, マークを置いて使う状態にする.\n"
"繰り返すと, マークを使う状態と使わない状態にする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:exchange-point-and-mark"
msgid ""
"Put the mark where point is now, and point where the mark is now.\n"
"The mark is activated, unless there is an argument (which deactivates it)."
msgstr ""
"マークを今の点に置き, 点を今のマークの所に置く.\n"
"引数が無ければマークを使う状態にし, あれば使わない状態にする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-whole-buffer"
msgid "Put point at the beginning and the mark at the end of the buffer."
msgstr "点をバッファの始めに, マークを終わりに置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-word"
msgid ""
"Set the mark at the end of the next word, or extend the region by a word.\n"
"With argument N, do it for N words (backward if N is negative)."
msgstr ""
"次の単語の終わりにマークを置く. または, リージョンを 1 単語広げる.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 単語分 (負なら後ろへ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:keyboard-quit"
msgid "Deactivate the mark and cancel the running command by signaling a quit."
msgstr "マークを使わない状態にして, quit を知らせて, 動いているコマンドをやめる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:keyboard-escape-quit"
msgid ""
"Exit the current mode in a general sense: deactivate the region, clear a prefix\n"
"argument, or go back to just one window."
msgstr "広い意味で今の状態を抜ける: リージョンを使わない状態にする, 前置引数を消す, または, ウィンドウを 1 つにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:prefix-arg"
msgid "The prefix argument for the next command: #f, a number, the symbol -, or a list like (4)."
msgstr "次のコマンドの前置引数: #f, 数, 記号 -, または (4) のようなリスト."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-command-event"
msgid "The key (a string such as \"5\" or \"M-5\") that ran the command."
msgstr "コマンドを動かしたキー (\"5\" や \"M-5\" のような文字列)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:universal-argument-mode"
msgid "True while the keys 0-9, - and C-u make up a prefix argument (the universal-argument-map)."
msgstr "キー 0-9, -, C-u が前置引数を作っている間は真 (universal-argument-map)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--prefix-state"
msgid "Pass the prefix command state to the next command: it will see the previous last-command."
msgstr "前置引数のコマンドの状態を次のコマンドに渡す: 次のコマンドは, 前の last-command を見る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--event-digit"
msgid "Return the digit of the key that ran the command (the last character of last-command-event)."
msgstr "コマンドを動かしたキーの数字を返す (last-command-event の最後の文字)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:universal-argument"
msgid ""
"Begin a numeric argument for the following command.\n"
"Digits or minus sign following it make up the numeric argument.\n"
"C-u without digits or minus sign provides 4 as argument."
msgstr ""
"次のコマンドの数の引数を始める.\n"
"続く数字とマイナス記号が数の引数になる.\n"
"数字もマイナス記号も無い C-u は, 引数 4 を渡す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:universal-argument-more"
msgid "Multiply the prefix argument by 4 (C-u after C-u), or end the argument after digits."
msgstr "前置引数を 4 倍にする (C-u の後の C-u). 数字の後なら, 引数を終える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:digit-argument"
msgid "Part of the numeric argument for the next command: add the digit of the key."
msgstr "次のコマンドの数の引数の一部: キーの数字を加える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:negative-argument"
msgid "Begin a negative numeric argument for the next command, or negate it."
msgstr "次のコマンドの負の数の引数を始める. または, 符号を反対にする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--single-key-description"
msgid "Return how Emacs writes the ASCII character CHAR as a key, such as C-a or SPC."
msgstr "ASCII の文字 CHAR を, Emacs がキーとして書く形 (C-a, SPC など) で返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:what-cursor-position"
msgid ""
"Print information about the cursor position in the echo area:\n"
"the character after point with its codes, the position, and the column.\n"
"In a narrowed buffer, also show the accessible range as <BEG-END>."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの位置の情報をエコーエリアに出す:\n"
"点の後の文字とその符号, 位置, 桁.\n"
"絞り込んだバッファでは, 見える範囲も <BEG-END> で出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--round-percent"
msgid "Return 100 * N / TOTAL rounded to the nearest integer, ties to even (like Emacs round)."
msgstr "100 * N / TOTAL を最も近い整数に丸めて返す (半端は偶数へ. Emacs の round と同じ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--count-lines"
msgid "Return the number of lines between START and END."
msgstr "START と END の間の行の数を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--count-words"
msgid "Return the number of words between START and END."
msgstr "START と END の間の単語の数を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--count-sentences"
msgid "Return the number of sentences between START and END."
msgstr "START と END の間の文の数を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--count-words-format"
msgid "Return the message about the lines, sentences, words and characters between START and END."
msgstr "START と END の間の行, 文, 単語, 文字の数のメッセージを返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:count-words-region"
msgid ""
"Print the number of lines, sentences, words and characters in the region.\n"
"With a prefix argument, report on the whole buffer."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの行, 文, 単語, 文字の数を出す.\n"
"前置引数があれば, バッファ全体の数を出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:fill-column"
msgid "The column beyond which automatic line breaking should happen."
msgstr "自動で行を折り返す桁."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:truncate-lines"
msgid "Non-nil means do not display continuation lines: give each line one row, cut at the window edge."
msgstr "真なら, 折り返しの行を出さない: 1 行を 1 行で出し, ウィンドウの端で切る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:selective-display"
msgid "A number N means that lines indented by N columns or more are not displayed."
msgstr "数 N は, N 桁以上字下げした行を出さないことを表す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-fill-column"
msgid ""
"Set fill-column to the argument.  With C-u, use the current column.\n"
"Interactively without a prefix argument, read the column in the minibuffer (the current column is the default)."
msgstr ""
"fill-column を引数にする. C-u なら, 今の桁にする.\n"
"対話的に前置引数が無ければ, ミニバッファで桁を聞く (既定の値は今の桁)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:toggle-truncate-lines"
msgid ""
"Toggle truncating of long lines for the current buffer.\n"
"With a positive argument, truncate; with zero or a negative one, wrap."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファで, 長い行を切るかを切り替える.\n"
"引数が正なら切り, 0 か負なら折り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-selective-display"
msgid ""
"Set selective-display to the argument; clear it if there is none.\n"
"When it is a number, lines indented by that many columns or more are not displayed."
msgstr ""
"selective-display を引数にする. 引数が無ければ消す.\n"
"数なら, その桁以上字下げした行を出さない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:simple--undo-equiv"
msgid ""
"Which undo lists were made by undo: a list of (length value).\n"
"The value is what is left to undo (a list, #t or empty).  It is keyed by the length of the undo list."
msgstr ""
"どの履歴が undo で作られたか: (長さ 値) のリスト.\n"
"値は, 残りの戻す記録 (リスト, #t, empty). 履歴の長さで引く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--skip-boundaries"
msgid "Return the undo list UL without the boundaries (#f) at its front."
msgstr "履歴 UL の, 前にある区切り (#f) を除いたものを返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--equiv-ref"
msgid "Return what undo recorded for the undo list UL, or #f."
msgstr "履歴 UL について undo が覚えたことを返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--equiv-set"
msgid "Record VALUE for the undo list UL."
msgstr "履歴 UL について, VALUE を覚える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--last-change-was-undo-p"
msgid "Return what undo recorded if the last change in UNDO-LIST was made by undo, else #f."
msgstr "UNDO-LIST の最後の変更が undo で作られたなら, undo が覚えたことを返す. そうでなければ #f."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--undo-more"
msgid "Undo N more groups of changes from the pending undo list."
msgstr "まだ戻していない履歴から, N 個のまとまりを元に戻す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--drop-point-records"
msgid "Return the undo list UL without the position records that undo made in its newest group."
msgstr "履歴 UL の最新のまとまりから, undo が作った位置の記録を除いたものを返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:undo"
msgid ""
"Undo some previous changes.  Repeat the command to undo more.\n"
"With a number N, undo N groups of changes.  After the other commands, the\n"
"undo starts again from the newest change, so undoing an undo redoes the change."
msgstr ""
"前の変更を元に戻す. 続けて呼ぶと, さらに戻す.\n"
"数 N があれば, N 個のまとまりを元に戻す. 別のコマンドの後では, 最新の変更からやり直すので, undo を元に戻すと, やり直しになる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:undo-redo"
msgid "Undo the last N undos, that is redo the last N changes that were undone."
msgstr "最後の N 個の undo を元に戻す. つまり, 戻した最後の N 個の変更をやり直す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:split-window-below"
msgid "Split the selected window into two windows, one above the other."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を, 上下に 2 つに分ける."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:split-window-right"
msgid "Split the selected window into two windows side by side."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を, 左右に 2 つに分ける."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-window"
msgid "Delete the selected window, or the window given as the argument."
msgstr "選んでいる窓, または引数の窓を消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-other-windows"
msgid "Make the selected window fill the screen."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を, 画面全体にする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:other-window"
msgid "Select another window.  With argument N, select the Nth window after this one."
msgstr "別の窓を選ぶ. 引数 N があれば, この窓から N 番目の窓を選ぶ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--modified-file-buffers"
msgid "Return the names of the buffers that visit a file and are modified."
msgstr "ファイルを訪れていて, 書き換えたバッファの名前を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:save-buffers-kill-terminal"
msgid ""
"Offer to save the modified buffers, and exit the editor.\n"
"Ask once more if modified buffers remain."
msgstr ""
"書き換えたバッファを保存するか聞いて, エディタを終わる.\n"
"書き換えたバッファが残っていれば, もう一度聞く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--symbol-constituent-at"
msgid "True if the character at POS has word or symbol syntax (Emacs \\sw\\|\\s_)."
msgstr "POS の文字が単語か記号の構文なら真 (Emacs の \\sw\\|\\s_)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--transpose-sexps-pair"
msgid "Return the start and end of the sexp to transpose in the direction ARG (Emacs transpose-sexps-default-function)."
msgstr "向き ARG の, 入れ替える式の始めと終わりを返す (Emacs の transpose-sexps-default-function)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-sexps"
msgid ""
"Like transpose-chars, but applies to sexps.  Point must be between the two sexps.\n"
"With argument N, drag the sexp before point forward past N other sexps (backward if negative).\n"
"With zero, interchange the sexps ending at or after point and at or after mark."
msgstr ""
"transpose-chars と同じで, 式を入れ替える. 点は 2 つの式の間に置く.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 点の前の式を N 個の式の先へ動かす (負なら後ろへ).\n"
"0 なら, 点の後ろの式とマークの後ろの式を入れ替える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-sentences"
msgid ""
"Interchange the current sentence with the next one.\n"
"With argument N, move the current sentence past N sentences."
msgstr ""
"今の文と次の文を入れ替える.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 今の文を N 文の先へ動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:transpose-paragraphs"
msgid ""
"Interchange the current paragraph with the next one.\n"
"With argument N, move the current paragraph past N paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"今の段落と次の段落を入れ替える.\n"
"引数 N があれば, 今の段落を N 段落の先へ動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:simple--page-mark"
msgid "The form feed character that starts a page boundary line."
msgstr "ページの区切りの行を始める改ページの文字."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--page-forward-search"
msgid "Move point past the next page delimiter (a form feed at the start of a line); return false if none."
msgstr "次のページの区切り (行の始めの改ページ) の後ろへ動く. 無ければ偽を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--page-backward-search"
msgid "Move point to the start of the previous page delimiter; return false if none."
msgstr "前のページの区切りの始めへ動く. 無ければ偽を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-page"
msgid ""
"Move forward to page boundary.  With argument N, repeat, or go back if negative.\n"
"A page boundary is a line that starts with a form feed."
msgstr ""
"ページの区切りまで進む. 引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら戻る.\n"
"ページの区切りは, 改ページで始まる行."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-page"
msgid "Move backward to page boundary.  With argument N, repeat, or go forward if negative."
msgstr "ページの区切りまで戻る. 引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら進む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-page"
msgid ""
"Put the mark at the end of the page and point at the beginning.\n"
"With argument N, mark the page N pages forward (backward if negative)."
msgstr ""
"ページの終わりにマークを置き, 始めに点を置く.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N ページ先 (負なら前) のページにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:narrow-to-region"
msgid ""
"Restrict editing in this buffer to the current region.\n"
"The rest of the text becomes temporarily invisible and unchangeable.\n"
"Called from Lisp with START and END, restrict to that range instead."
msgstr ""
"このバッファの編集を, 今のリージョンに限る.\n"
"それ以外の本文は, 一時的に見えなくなり, 変えられなくなる.\n"
"Lisp から START と END を付けて呼ぶと, その範囲に絞り込む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:widen"
msgid ""
"Remove restrictions (narrowing) from the current buffer.\n"
"This allows the buffer's full text to be seen and edited."
msgstr ""
"このバッファの絞り込みをやめる.\n"
"バッファの本文の全体が見えて, 編集できるようになる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--page-delimiter-p"
msgid "Return true if point is at a page delimiter: a form feed at the start of a line."
msgstr "カーソルがページの区切り(行の始めの改ページ文字)にあれば真を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:narrow-to-page"
msgid ""
"Make text outside current page invisible.\n"
"A numeric argument specifies to move forward or backward by that many pages,\n"
"thus showing a page other than the one point was originally in."
msgstr ""
"今のページの外の本文を見えなくする.\n"
"数の引数で, その数だけ前や後ろのページへ動いてから絞り込むので,\n"
"最初にカーソルがあったのとは別のページを見せられる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:narrow-to-defun-include-comments"
msgid "Whether narrow-to-defun includes the comments before a defun."
msgstr "narrow-to-defun が, defun の前のコメントを含めるか."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:narrow-to-defun"
msgid ""
"Make text outside current defun invisible.\n"
"The current defun is the one that contains point or follows point.\n"
"Preceding comments are included if INCLUDE-COMMENTS is true.\n"
"Called from the keyboard, use the value of narrow-to-defun-include-comments."
msgstr ""
"今の defun の外の本文を見えなくする.\n"
"今の defun は, カーソルを含むか, カーソルの後ろにあるもの.\n"
"INCLUDE-COMMENTS が真なら, 前のコメントも含める.\n"
"キーボードから呼ぶと, narrow-to-defun-include-comments の値を使う."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--page-line-counts"
msgid "Return (TOTAL BEFORE AFTER): the number of lines on the current page, before point and after point."
msgstr "(TOTAL BEFORE AFTER) を返す: 今のページの行数と, カーソルの前の行数と, 後ろの行数."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:count-lines-page"
msgid "Report number of lines on current page, and how many are before or after point."
msgstr "今のページの行数と, カーソルの前と後ろの行数を知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--forward-sexp"
msgid "Move forward across N sexps, signalling the scan error as is."
msgstr "N 個の式を越える. 式の走査の失敗は, そのまま知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-sexp"
msgid ""
"Move forward across one balanced expression (sexp).\n"
"With argument N, do it N times; a negative N moves backward.\n"
"From the keyboard, report a failure as \"No next sexp\" or \"No previous sexp\"."
msgstr ""
"釣り合った式 (sexp) を 1 つ越えて進む.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら後ろへ.\n"
"キーから動かしたとき, 失敗は \"No next sexp\" か \"No previous sexp\" と知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-sexp"
msgid ""
"Move backward across one balanced expression (sexp).\n"
"With argument N, do it N times; a negative N moves forward."
msgstr ""
"釣り合った式 (sexp) を 1 つ越えて戻る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら前へ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-list"
msgid ""
"Move forward across one balanced group of parentheses.\n"
"With argument N, do it N times; a negative N moves backward.\n"
"From the keyboard, report a failure as \"No next group\" or \"No previous group\"."
msgstr ""
"釣り合った括弧の組を 1 つ越えて進む.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら後ろへ.\n"
"キーから動かしたとき, 失敗は \"No next group\" か \"No previous group\" と知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-list"
msgid ""
"Move backward across one balanced group of parentheses.\n"
"With argument N, do it N times; a negative N moves forward."
msgstr ""
"釣り合った括弧の組を 1 つ越えて戻る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら前へ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:down-list"
msgid ""
"Move forward down one level of parentheses.\n"
"With argument N, do this N times; a negative N moves backward but still goes down a level.\n"
"From the keyboard, report a failure as \"At bottom level\"."
msgstr ""
"括弧の 1 段内側へ進む.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら後ろへ動いて, 内側へ入る.\n"
"キーから動かしたとき, 失敗は \"At bottom level\" と知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:up-list"
msgid ""
"Move forward out of one level of parentheses.\n"
"With argument N, do this N times; a negative N moves backward.\n"
"Inside a string, move out of the string first."
msgstr ""
"括弧の 1 段外側へ出て進む.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら後ろへ.\n"
"文字列の中なら, 先に文字列の外へ出る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-up-list"
msgid ""
"Move backward out of one level of parentheses.\n"
"With argument N, do this N times; a negative N moves forward."
msgstr ""
"括弧の 1 段外側へ出て戻る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 負なら前へ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-sexp"
msgid ""
"Kill the sexp (balanced expression) following point.\n"
"With argument N, kill N sexps; a negative N kills backward."
msgstr ""
"点の後ろの式 (釣り合った式) を切る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 個. 負なら前の式を切る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-kill-sexp"
msgid ""
"Kill the sexp (balanced expression) preceding point.\n"
"With argument N, kill N sexps; a negative N kills forward."
msgstr ""
"点の前の式 (釣り合った式) を切る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 個. 負なら後ろの式を切る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--forward-sexp-to-select"
msgid "Return the end of N sexps from point; signal NONE if there is no sexp to select."
msgstr "点から N 個の式の終わりを返す. 選ぶ式が無ければ, NONE で知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-sexp"
msgid ""
"Set the mark at the end of the next sexp, or extend the region by one sexp.\n"
"With argument N, do it for N sexps (backward if N is negative)."
msgstr ""
"次の式の終わりにマークを置く. または, リージョンを式 1 つ広げる.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 個分 (負なら後ろへ)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--push-mark-for-defun"
msgid "Push the mark before a defun motion NAME, unless it repeats NAME or the region is active."
msgstr "defun の移動 NAME の前にマークを置く. NAME の繰り返しか, リージョンがあるときは置かない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:beginning-of-defun"
msgid ""
"Move backward to the beginning of a defun (an open paren in column 0).\n"
"With argument N, do it N times.  Push the mark first, unless repeated."
msgstr ""
"defun の始め (0 桁の開く括弧) まで戻る.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 回. 繰り返しでなければ, 先にマークを置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--end-of-defun"
msgid "Move forward N defuns.  If SCAN-ERRORS, an unbalanced defun signals the scan error that Lisp code sees."
msgstr "N 個後ろの defun の終わりへ動く. SCAN-ERRORS なら, 括弧が合わない defun は, Lisp のコードが見る scan-error で失敗する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:end-of-defun"
msgid ""
"Move forward to the end of a defun.  With argument N, do it N times.\n"
"Push the mark first, unless repeated."
msgstr ""
"defun の終わりまで進む. 引数 N があれば N 回.\n"
"繰り返しでなければ, 先にマークを置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-defun"
msgid ""
"Put the region around the current defun, including the comments before it.\n"
"With argument N, mark N defuns; a negative N marks backward.\n"
"If the region is active, extend it to the end of the next defun."
msgstr ""
"今の defun とその前のコメントをリージョンにする.\n"
"引数 N があれば N 個の defun を選ぶ. N が負なら後ろ向きに選ぶ.\n"
"リージョンがあれば, 次の defun の終わりまで広げる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-paragraph"
msgid ""
"Move forward to the end of the paragraph.  With argument N, do it N times;\n"
"a negative N moves backward to the start of the paragraph."
msgstr ""
"段落の終わりまで進む. 引数 N があれば N 回.\n"
"負なら後ろへ, 段落の始めまで戻る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-paragraph"
msgid "Move backward to the start of the paragraph.  With argument N, do it N times."
msgstr "段落の始めまで戻る. 引数 N があれば N 回."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-paragraph"
msgid ""
"Put the mark at the end of this paragraph, point at the beginning.\n"
"If the region is active, extend it by one more paragraph."
msgstr ""
"この段落の終わりにマークを置き, 始めに点を置く.\n"
"リージョンがあれば, 段落 1 つ分広げる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-paragraph"
msgid "Kill forward to the end of the paragraph.  With argument N, kill N paragraphs."
msgstr "段落の終わりまでを切る. 引数 N があれば N 段落."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-kill-paragraph"
msgid "Kill back to the start of the paragraph.  With argument N, kill N paragraphs."
msgstr "段落の始めまでを切る. 引数 N があれば N 段落."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:forward-sentence"
msgid ""
"Move forward to next end of sentence.  With argument N, do it N times;\n"
"a negative N moves backward to the start of the sentence."
msgstr ""
"次の文の終わりまで進む. 引数 N があれば N 回.\n"
"負なら後ろへ, 文の始めまで戻る."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-sentence"
msgid "Move backward to the start of the sentence.  With argument N, do it N times."
msgstr "文の始めまで戻る. 引数 N があれば N 回."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-sentence"
msgid "Kill from point to the end of the current sentence.  With argument N, kill N sentences."
msgstr "点から今の文の終わりまでを切る. 引数 N があれば N 文."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-kill-sentence"
msgid "Kill back from point to the start of the sentence.  With argument N, kill N sentences."
msgstr "点から文の始めまでを切る. 引数 N があれば N 文."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:mark-end-of-sentence"
msgid "Put the mark at the end of this sentence.  With argument N, N sentences forward."
msgstr "この文の終わりにマークを置く. 引数 N があれば N 文先."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--command-names"
msgid "Return the names of all commands, sorted."
msgstr "全てのコマンドの名前を, 並べて返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:command-history"
msgid "The commands run with M-x, newest first, each written as an expression such as \"(forward-char)\"."
msgstr "M-x で動かしたコマンド (新しいものが先). それぞれ \"(forward-char)\" のような式の文字列."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--remember-command"
msgid "Put the command NAME on the front of command-history, unless it is already there."
msgstr "コマンド NAME を command-history の先頭に入れる (すでに先頭にあれば入れない)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--run-named-command"
msgid "Read a command name with PROMPT, remember it, and run it."
msgstr "PROMPT でコマンドの名前を読み, 覚えて, 動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:execute-extended-command"
msgid "Read a command name in the minibuffer, with completion, and run it."
msgstr "コマンドの名前をミニバッファで, 補完しながら読んで, 動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:execute-extended-command-for-buffer"
msgid ""
"Read a command name in the minibuffer, with completion, and run it.\n"
"Unlike Emacs, every command is offered, not only those that fit the major mode."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファでコマンドの名前を, 補完して読み, 動かす.\n"
"Emacs と違い, メジャーモードに合うものだけでなく, 全てのコマンドを出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-repeatable-command"
msgid "The last command run from a key, other than the prefix argument commands (the command loop sets it)."
msgstr "キーから動かした最後のコマンド (前置引数のコマンドを除く. コマンドループが置く)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:last-prefix-arg"
msgid "The raw prefix argument of the last command (the command loop sets it)."
msgstr "最後のコマンドの, そのままの前置引数 (コマンドループが置く)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:repeat-previous-repeated-command"
msgid "The command that repeat repeated last."
msgstr "repeat が最後に繰り返したコマンド."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:repeat-too-dangerous"
msgid "Commands that repeat refuses to repeat."
msgstr "repeat が繰り返さないコマンド."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:repeat-on-final-keystroke"
msgid "Non-nil means that the last key of C-x z (z) repeats the command again."
msgstr "nil でなければ, C-x z の最後のキー (z) で, また繰り返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:transient-map--keys"
msgid "The keys of set-transient-map: a list of (KEY COMMAND), used for the next key only."
msgstr "set-transient-map のキー: (KEY COMMAND) のリスト. 次のキーにだけ使う."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-transient-map"
msgid "Use KEYS, a list of (KEY COMMAND), for the next key only, before the other key bindings."
msgstr "KEYS ((KEY COMMAND) のリスト) を, 次のキーにだけ, ほかの割り当てより先に使う."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:repeat"
msgid ""
"Repeat the most recently executed command.\n"
"With a prefix argument, give it to that command; otherwise, give it the prefix argument it had before.\n"
"Then the last key of this command (z of C-x z) repeats it again.\n"
"Unlike Emacs, a command that read its arguments in the minibuffer reads them again."
msgstr ""
"最後に動かしたコマンドを繰り返す.\n"
"前置引数があれば, それをそのコマンドに渡す. 無ければ, 前と同じ前置引数を渡す.\n"
"その後は, このコマンドの最後のキー (C-x z の z) で, また繰り返す.\n"
"Emacs と違い, ミニバッファで引数を読んだコマンドは, 引数を聞き直す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:repeat-complex-command"
msgid ""
"Edit and re-evaluate the last command run with M-x.\n"
"With the argument N, use the Nth previous command (1 is the last)."
msgstr ""
"M-x で動かした最後のコマンドを直して, もう一度評価する.\n"
"引数 N があれば, N 個前のコマンドを使う (1 が最後)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--remember-command-expression"
msgid "Put EXPRESSION on the front of command-history, unless it is already there."
msgstr "式 EXPRESSION を command-history の先頭に入れる (すでに先頭にあれば入れない)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:eval-expression"
msgid "Read an expression in the minibuffer, evaluate it, and show the value."
msgstr "式をミニバッファで読んで, 評価して, 値を出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:eval-last-sexp"
msgid "Evaluate the sexp before point and show its value in the echo area."
msgstr "カーソルの前の S 式を評価し, 値をエコー領域に出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:electric-newline-and-maybe-indent"
msgid ""
"Insert a newline without indenting it, as `electric-indent-mode' makes C-j do.\n"
"With argument N, insert N newlines."
msgstr ""
"字下げせずに改行を入れる (`electric-indent-mode` での C-j と同じ).\n"
"引数 N を渡すと, N 個の改行を入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:abort-recursive-edit"
msgid "Abort the command that requested this recursive edit or minibuffer input."
msgstr "再帰編集かミニバッファの入力を求めたコマンドをやめる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:parens-require-spaces"
msgid ""
"If true, add whitespace as needed when inserting parentheses.\n"
"This affects `insert-parentheses'."
msgstr ""
"真なら, 括弧を入れるとき, 必要に応じて空白を足す.\n"
"`insert-parentheses' に効く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--insert-pair"
msgid "Enclose following sexps in OPEN and CLOSE as `insert-parentheses' does for the prefix argument RAW."
msgstr "前置引数 RAW について, `insert-parentheses' と同じに, 続く S 式を OPEN と CLOSE で囲む."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-parentheses"
msgid ""
"Enclose following ARG sexps in parentheses.\n"
"Leave point after open-paren.\n"
"A negative ARG encloses the preceding ARG sexps instead.\n"
"No argument is equivalent to zero: just insert `()' and leave point between.\n"
"If `parens-require-spaces' is true, this command also inserts a space\n"
"before and after, depending on the surrounding characters.\n"
"If region is active, insert enclosing characters at region boundaries.\n"
"\n"
"This command assumes point is not in a string or comment."
msgstr ""
"続く ARG 個の S 式を括弧で囲む.\n"
"開き括弧の後ろにカーソルを置く.\n"
"ARG が負なら, 前の ARG 個の S 式を囲む.\n"
"引数が無いのは 0 と同じで, `()' を入れて, 間にカーソルを置く.\n"
"`parens-require-spaces' が真なら, 前後の文字に合わせて空白も入れる.\n"
"リージョンがあるときは, リージョンの両端に入れる.\n"
"\n"
"カーソルが文字列やコメントの中にないものとして動く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--newline-and-indent"
msgid "Delete the horizontal space before point, insert a newline, and indent the new line (not the previous one)."
msgstr "カーソルの前の空白を消し, 改行を入れ, 新しい行を字下げする (前の行は直さない)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:move-past-close-and-reindent"
msgid "Move past next `)', delete indentation before it, then indent after it."
msgstr "次の `)' の後ろに移り, その前の字下げを消し, 後ろを字下げする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:shell-command-buffer-name"
msgid "Name of the output buffer for shell commands."
msgstr "シェルのコマンドの出力のバッファの名前."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:shell-command-buffer-name-async"
msgid "Name of the output buffer for asynchronous shell commands."
msgstr "非同期のシェルのコマンドの出力のバッファの名前."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--max-mini-window-lines"
msgid "Return the number of lines the echo area may use before a buffer is displayed instead."
msgstr "エコー領域に出せる行数を返す (これより多ければ, 代わりにバッファを出す)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--nth"
msgid "Return the Nth element of ARGS (from 0), or #f if there are not that many."
msgstr "ARGS の N 番目 (0 から) を返す. 足りなければ #f."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--screen-lines"
msgid "Return the number of screen lines TEXT takes in WIDTH columns."
msgstr "TEXT を WIDTH 桁で出したときの画面の行数を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--display-message-or-buffer"
msgid "Show the text of the buffer NAME in the echo area if it is short, otherwise display the buffer."
msgstr "バッファ NAME の本文が短ければエコー領域に出し, そうでなければバッファを出す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--call-shell-region"
msgid ""
"Run COMMAND with the text from START to END as input, and insert the output at point.\n"
"If DELETE is true, delete that text first.  Return the exit code."
msgstr ""
"START から END までの文字を入力にして COMMAND を動かし, 出力をポイントに入れる.\n"
"DELETE が真なら, 先にその文字を削除する. 終了コードを返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--shell-report"
msgid "Report an EXIT-STATUS of a shell command that printed no output."
msgstr "出力の無かったシェルのコマンドの終了コード EXIT-STATUS を知らせる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:shell-command-on-region"
msgid ""
"Execute string COMMAND in inferior shell with region as input.\n"
"Normally display output (if any) in temp buffer `*Shell Command Output*';\n"
"Prefix arg means replace the region with it.  Return the exit code of COMMAND.\n"
"\n"
"Called from Lisp with START, END, COMMAND, OUTPUT-BUFFER and REPLACE (and the unused\n"
"ERROR-BUFFER and DISPLAY-ERROR-BUFFER).  If OUTPUT-BUFFER is a buffer name, erase that buffer and\n"
"insert the output there; if it is another non-nil value, replace the region with the output.\n"
"If REPLACE is non-nil, delete the region and insert the output in its place."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを入力にして, 文字列 COMMAND をシェルで動かす.\n"
"普通は, 出力 (あれば) を一時バッファ `*Shell Command Output*' に出す.\n"
"前置引数があれば, リージョンを出力で置き換える. COMMAND の終了コードを返す.\n"
"\n"
"Lisp からは START, END, COMMAND, OUTPUT-BUFFER, REPLACE (と, 使わない ERROR-BUFFER, DISPLAY-ERROR-BUFFER) を付けて呼ぶ.\n"
"OUTPUT-BUFFER がバッファの名前なら, そのバッファを消して出力を入れる.\n"
"それ以外の非 nil なら, リージョンを出力で置き換える.\n"
"REPLACE が非 nil なら, リージョンを削除して, その場所に出力を入れる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:shell-command"
msgid ""
"Execute string COMMAND in inferior shell; display output, if any.\n"
"With prefix argument, insert the COMMAND's output at point.\n"
"If COMMAND ends in `&', execute it asynchronously (this editor runs it to the end first, and\n"
"shows its output in `*Async Shell Command*').\n"
"The output appears in the buffer `*Shell Command Output*'.  If the output is short enough to\n"
"display in the echo area, it is shown there.\n"
"\n"
"The optional second argument OUTPUT-BUFFER, if non-nil, says to put the output in some other\n"
"buffer.  If OUTPUT-BUFFER is a buffer name, erase that buffer and insert the output there.  If it\n"
"is not a buffer name and not nil (which happens interactively when the prefix argument is\n"
"given), insert the output in the current buffer after point leaving mark after it."
msgstr ""
"文字列 COMMAND をシェルで動かして, 出力 (あれば) を出す.\n"
"前置引数があれば, COMMAND の出力をポイントに入れる.\n"
"COMMAND が `&' で終わっていれば, 非同期に動かす (このエディタは終わるまで動かして,\n"
"出力を `*Async Shell Command*' に出す).\n"
"出力はバッファ `*Shell Command Output*' に入る. 出力が短くてエコー領域に出せれば, そこに出す.\n"
"\n"
"省略できる 2 番目の引数 OUTPUT-BUFFER が非 nil なら, 出力を別のバッファに入れる.\n"
"バッファの名前なら, そのバッファを消して出力を入れる. バッファの名前でも nil でもなければ\n"
"(対話で前置引数を付けたとき), 今のバッファのポイントの後ろに入れて, マークを出力の後ろに置く."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:async-shell-command"
msgid ""
"Execute string COMMAND asynchronously in background.\n"
"Like `shell-command', but adds `&' at the end of COMMAND to execute it asynchronously.\n"
"The output appears in the buffer `*Async Shell Command*'.\n"
"In this editor the command is run to the end before the next command is read."
msgstr ""
"文字列 COMMAND を, 背景で非同期に動かす.\n"
"`shell-command' と同じだが, COMMAND の終わりに `&' を付けて非同期にする.\n"
"出力はバッファ `*Async Shell Command*' に出る.\n"
"このエディタは, 次のコマンドを読む前に, コマンドを終わりまで動かす."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:rename-buffer"
msgid ""
"Change current buffer's name to NEWNAME (a string).\n"
"If second arg UNIQUE is nil or omitted, it is an error if a buffer named NEWNAME already exists.\n"
"If UNIQUE is non-nil, come up with a new name using `generate-new-buffer-name'.\n"
"Interactively, you can set UNIQUE with a prefix argument.\n"
"Return the name actually given to the buffer."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファの名前を NEWNAME (文字列) に変える.\n"
"2 番目の引数 UNIQUE が nil か省略されていれば, NEWNAME のバッファが既にあるときは失敗する.\n"
"UNIQUE が非 nil なら, `generate-new-buffer-name' で新しい名前を作る.\n"
"対話では, 前置引数で UNIQUE を決められる.\n"
"実際に付けた名前を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--clone-name"
msgid "Return NAME without a trailing <N>."
msgstr "NAME の終わりの <N> を除いて返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--clone-buffer"
msgid "Create a twin copy of the current buffer named after NEWNAME, and return its name."
msgstr "今のバッファの複製を NEWNAME から作った名前で作って, その名前を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:clone-buffer"
msgid ""
"Create and return a twin copy of the current buffer.\n"
"Unlike an indirect buffer, the new buffer can be edited independently of the old one.\n"
"NEWNAME is the name of the new buffer.  It may be modified by adding or incrementing <N> at the\n"
"end as necessary to create a unique buffer name.  If nil, it defaults to the name of the current\n"
"buffer, with the proper suffix.  If DISPLAY-FLAG is non-nil, the new buffer is shown in another\n"
"window.  Trying to clone a file-visiting buffer results in an error.\n"
"Interactively, DISPLAY-FLAG is t and NEWNAME is the name of the current buffer with appropriate\n"
"suffix.  However, if a prefix argument is given, then the command prompts for NEWNAME."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファの双子の複製を作って, 返す.\n"
"間接バッファと違い, 新しいバッファは元のバッファと別に編集できる.\n"
"NEWNAME は新しいバッファの名前. 一意な名前になるように, 終わりの <N> を付けたり増やしたりする.\n"
"nil なら, 今のバッファの名前に適切な接尾辞を付けたもの. DISPLAY-FLAG が非 nil なら,\n"
"新しいバッファを別のウィンドウに出す. ファイルを訪れるバッファは複製できない.\n"
"対話では, DISPLAY-FLAG は t で, NEWNAME は今のバッファの名前に適切な接尾辞を付けたもの.\n"
"ただし前置引数があれば, NEWNAME を尋ねる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:clone-indirect-buffer-other-window"
msgid ""
"Like `clone-buffer' but display in another window and select it.\n"
"This editor has no indirect buffers: the new buffer is a twin copy whose text is not shared."
msgstr ""
"`clone-buffer' と同じだが, 別のウィンドウに出して, そちらを選ぶ.\n"
"このエディタに間接バッファは無い. 新しいバッファは, 本文を共有しない双子の複製."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--mode-arg"
msgid "Return what a minor mode command does for ARGS: 1 to enable, 0 to disable, or toggle."
msgstr "マイナーモードのコマンドが ARGS で何をするかを返す: 有効にする 1, 無効にする 0, または toggle."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:read-only-mode"
msgid ""
"Change whether the current buffer is read-only.\n"
"With no argument (or `toggle'), toggle it.  With a positive argument, make the buffer read-only;\n"
"with zero or a negative argument, make it writable."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを読み取り専用にするかを変える.\n"
"引数が無い (か `toggle') なら, 切り替える. 正の引数なら読み取り専用に,\n"
"0 か負の引数なら書き込めるようにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:beginning-of-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to beginning of current line.\n"
"With argument N not nil or 1, move forward N - 1 lines first.\n"
"If point reaches the beginning or end of buffer, it stops there."
msgstr ""
"カーソルを今の行の始めに動かす.\n"
"引数 N が nil か 1 でなければ, 先に N - 1 行進む.\n"
"バッファの始めか終わりに着いたら, そこで止まる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:end-of-line"
msgid ""
"Move point to end of current line.\n"
"With argument N not nil or 1, move forward N - 1 lines first.\n"
"If point reaches the beginning or end of buffer, it stops there."
msgstr ""
"カーソルを今の行の終わりに動かす.\n"
"引数 N が nil か 1 でなければ, 先に N - 1 行進む.\n"
"バッファの始めか終わりに着いたら, そこで止まる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:count-lines"
msgid ""
"Return number of lines between START and END.\n"
"This is usually the number of newlines between them, but can be one more if START is not equal\n"
"to END and the greater of them is not at the start of a line."
msgstr ""
"START と END の間の行数を返す.\n"
"普通は間の改行の数だが, START と END が違い, 大きい方が行の始めになければ, 1 つ多くなる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-region-as-kill"
msgid ""
"Save the region as if killed, but don't kill it.\n"
"Called from Lisp with START and END, it saves the text between them."
msgstr ""
"リージョンを kill したことにして保存する (消さない).\n"
"Lisp から START と END を渡すと, その間の文字を保存する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:read-char-by-name"
msgid ""
"Read a character in the minibuffer with PROMPT, and return its code.\n"
"The input is a hex number like 3042, or a number with a radix like #x3042, #o30102 or #10r12354.\n"
"Unicode character names are not supported (Emacs completes them)."
msgstr ""
"PROMPT でミニバッファで文字を聞き, その文字コードを返す.\n"
"入力は, 3042 のような 16 進の数か, #x3042, #o30102, #10r12354 のような基数付きの数.\n"
"Unicode の文字の名前は読まない (Emacs は名前を補完する)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--valid-char"
msgid "Return N if it is a character code (up to #x10FFFF, not a surrogate), or signal an error."
msgstr "N が文字コード (#x10FFFF まで. サロゲートでない) なら N を返す. そうでなければエラーにする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:insert-char"
msgid ""
"Insert COUNT copies of CHARACTER (a character code or a string of one character).\n"
"COUNT defaults to 1.  Interactively, read the character in the minibuffer (see read-char-by-name);\n"
"COUNT is the prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"文字 CHARACTER (文字コードか, 1 文字の文字列) を COUNT 個入れる.\n"
"COUNT の既定は 1. 対話的には, ミニバッファで文字を聞く (read-char-by-name を見る).\n"
"COUNT は前置引数."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-to"
msgid ""
"Indent from point with tabs and spaces until COLUMN is reached.\n"
"Optional second argument MINIMUM says always do at least MINIMUM spaces even if that goes past COLUMN.\n"
"Return the column where point ends up."
msgstr ""
"カーソルから, タブと空白で, 桁 COLUMN まで字下げする.\n"
"2 つ目の引数 MINIMUM は, COLUMN を過ぎても, 少なくとも MINIMUM 個の空白を入れる.\n"
"字下げした後の桁を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:tabify-regexp"
msgid ""
"Regexp matching whitespace that tabify should consider.\n"
"Usually this is \" [ \\t]+\" to match a space followed by whitespace.\n"
"\"^\\t* [ \\t]+\" is also useful, for tabifying only initial whitespace."
msgstr ""
"tabify が見る空白に合う正規表現.\n"
"ふつうは, 空白の後に空白が続くものに合う \" [ \\t]+\".\n"
"\"^\\t* [ \\t]+\" にすると, 行の始めの空白だけを tabify する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--with-indent-tabs-mode"
msgid "Call THUNK with indent-tabs-mode set to VALUE."
msgstr "indent-tabs-mode を VALUE にして, THUNK を呼ぶ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:simple--region-or-buffer"
msgid "Return (START END): the first two of ARGS, the whole buffer with a prefix argument, or the region."
msgstr "(START END) を返す: ARGS の初めの 2 つ, 前置引数があればバッファ全体, 無ければリージョン."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:untabify"
msgid ""
"Convert all tabs in the region (START and END) to spaces, preserving columns.\n"
"Interactively with a prefix argument, convert the whole buffer."
msgstr ""
"リージョン (START と END) の全てのタブを, 桁を保って空白にする.\n"
"対話的に前置引数があれば, バッファ全体を変える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:tabify"
msgid ""
"Convert multiple spaces in the region (START and END) to tabs when possible.\n"
"A group of spaces is partly replaced by tabs when this keeps the column they end at.\n"
"Interactively with a prefix argument, convert the whole buffer.  Tabs are 8 columns wide."
msgstr ""
"リージョン (START と END) の続いた空白を, できるところでタブにする.\n"
"空白の終わりの桁が変わらないときに, 空白の一部をタブに置き換える.\n"
"対話的に前置引数があれば, バッファ全体を変える. タブの幅は 8."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "variable:backward-delete-char-untabify-method"
msgid ""
"The method for untabifying when deleting backward: untabify (turn a tab into spaces, then delete one space),\n"
"hungry (delete all spaces and tabs), all (also newlines), or #f (delete one character)."
msgstr ""
"後ろへ消すときのタブの崩し方: untabify (タブを空白に崩し, 空白を 1 つ消す),\n"
"hungry (空白とタブを全て消す), all (改行も消す), #f (1 文字を消す)."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:backward-delete-char-untabify"
msgid ""
"Delete N characters backward, changing tabs into spaces (see backward-delete-char-untabify-method).\n"
"Kill them (save in the kill ring) if KILLP (the second argument) is true; interactively, if there is a prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"前の N 文字を, タブを空白に崩して消す (backward-delete-char-untabify-method を見る).\n"
"KILLP (第 2 引数) が真なら kill する (kill-ring に入れる). 対話的には, 前置引数があれば kill する."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:current-indentation"
msgid ""
"Return the indentation of the current line.\n"
"This is the horizontal position of the character following any initial whitespace."
msgstr ""
"今の行の字下げを返す.\n"
"行の始めの空白の後の, 最初の文字の水平の位置."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:indent-line-to"
msgid ""
"Indent current line to COLUMN.\n"
"This function removes or adds spaces and tabs at beginning of line only if necessary."
msgstr ""
"今の行を桁 COLUMN に字下げする.\n"
"行の始めの空白とタブを, 必要なときだけ足したり消したりする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:looking-back"
msgid ""
"Return true if text before point matches regular expression REGEXP.\n"
"Optional second argument LIMIT bounds the search; the match may not start before it."
msgstr ""
"カーソルの前の文字が, 正規表現 REGEXP に合うなら真を返す.\n"
"2 つ目の引数 LIMIT で探す範囲を限る. 合う所は, LIMIT より前から始まってはいけない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:copy-marker"
msgid "Return a new marker pointing at the same place as POSITION (a buffer position)."
msgstr "POSITION (バッファの位置) と同じ所を指す, 新しいマーカーを返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:set-marker"
msgid ""
"Position MARKER before character number POSITION in the current buffer.\n"
"Return MARKER."
msgstr ""
"マーカー MARKER を, 今のバッファの POSITION 番目の文字の前に置く.\n"
"MARKER を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:buffer-enable-undo"
msgid "Start keeping undo information for the buffer.  Every buffer keeps it here, so this does nothing."
msgstr "バッファの元に戻す情報を取り始める. ここでは全てのバッファが取っているので, 何もしない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-trailing-whitespace"
msgid ""
"Delete trailing whitespace between START and END.\n"
"If called interactively, START and END are the start/end of the region if the mark is active,\n"
"or of the buffer's accessible portion if the mark is inactive.\n"
"When END is not given, also delete trailing empty lines at the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"START から END の間の, 行末の空白を消す.\n"
"対話的に呼ぶと, マークが有効ならリージョンが, 無効ならバッファの見える範囲が START と END になる.\n"
"END を渡さなければ, バッファの終わりの空行も消す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:replace-regexp-in-string"
msgid ""
"Replace all matches for REGEXP with REP in STRING.\n"
"REP is a string (which may use \\& and \\N), or a function called with the matched text.\n"
"Return a new string containing the replacements."
msgstr ""
"文字列 STRING の中の, 正規表現 REGEXP に合う所を全部 REP に置き換える.\n"
"REP は文字列 (\\& と \\N が使える) か, 合った文字を渡して呼ぶ関数.\n"
"置き換えた新しい文字列を返す."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:search-forward-regexp"
msgid "Search forward from point for a regular expression.  Same as `re-search-forward'."
msgstr "点から後ろへ, 正規表現を探す. re-search-forward と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:search-backward-regexp"
msgid "Search backward from point for a regular expression.  Same as `re-search-backward'."
msgstr "点から前へ, 正規表現を探す. re-search-backward と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:word-search-regexp"
msgid ""
"Return a regexp which matches the words of STRING, whatever the punctuation between them.\n"
"Unless LAX is non-nil, the regexp also needs word boundaries at its ends."
msgstr ""
"STRING の単語に合う正規表現を返す. 単語の間の句読点は問わない.\n"
"LAX が空でなければ, 両端に単語の境界を要らない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:word-search-forward"
msgid ""
"Search forward for STRING as a sequence of words, whatever the punctuation between them.\n"
"The other arguments are those of `search-forward'."
msgstr ""
"STRING を単語の並びとして後ろへ探す. 単語の間の句読点は問わない.\n"
"他の引数は search-forward と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:word-search-backward"
msgid ""
"Search backward for STRING as a sequence of words, whatever the punctuation between them.\n"
"The other arguments are those of `search-backward'."
msgstr ""
"STRING を単語の並びとして前へ探す. 単語の間の句読点は問わない.\n"
"他の引数は search-backward と同じ."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:line-number-at-pos"
msgid ""
"Return the line number of POSITION (default: the point), counting from the start of the\n"
"accessible part of the buffer.  If the second argument ABSOLUTE is non-nil, count from the\n"
"start of the whole buffer."
msgstr ""
"POSITION (既定は点) の行の番号を返す. 見える範囲の始めから数える.\n"
"ABSOLUTE が空でなければ, バッファ全体の始めから数える."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kbd--key-p"
msgid "Return true if WORD is one key name such as C-x, M-x, RET or <f1>."
msgstr "WORD が, C-x, M-x, RET, <f1> などの 1 つのキーの名前なら真."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:kbd"
msgid ""
"Convert KEYS (a string of key names, such as \"C-x C-f foo RET\") to a list of keys.\n"
"A word that is not a key name stands for the keys of its characters.  The result is what\n"
"`execute-kbd-macro' takes."
msgstr ""
"KEYS (\"C-x C-f foo RET\" など, キーの名前の文字列) を, キーの並びにする.\n"
"キーの名前でない語は, その文字のキーの並びになる. 結果は execute-kbd-macro に渡せる."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:fundamental-mode"
msgid "Major mode not specialized for anything in particular."
msgstr "特定の用途に特化していないメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:emacs-lisp-mode"
msgid "Major mode for editing Lisp code to run in Emacs."
msgstr "Emacs で動かす Lisp のコードを編集するメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:lisp-data-mode"
msgid "Major mode for buffers holding data written as Lisp S-expressions."
msgstr "Lisp の S 式で書いたデータを持つバッファのメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:scheme-mode"
msgid "Major mode for editing Scheme code."
msgstr "Scheme のコードを編集するメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:text-mode"
msgid "Major mode for editing text written for humans to read."
msgstr "人が読む文章を編集するメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:c-mode"
msgid ""
"Major mode for editing C code.\n"
"Comments, strings, keywords, types, constants and preprocessor directives are highlighted."
msgstr ""
"C++ のコードを編集するメジャーモード.\n"
"コメント, 文字列, キーワード, 型, 定数, プリプロセッサの指示に色を付ける.C のコードを編集するメジャーモード.\n"
"コメント, 文字列, キーワード, 型, 定数, プリプロセッサの指示に色を付ける."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:c++-mode"
msgid ""
"Major mode for editing C++ code.\n"
"Comments, strings, keywords, types, constants and preprocessor directives are highlighted."
msgstr ""
"C++ のコードを編集するメジャーモード.\n"
"コメント, 文字列, キーワード, 型, 定数, プリプロセッサの指示に色を付ける."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:rust-mode"
msgid ""
"Major mode for editing Rust code.\n"
"Comments, strings, keywords, types, attributes and macros are highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Rust のコードを編集するメジャーモード.\n"
"コメント, 文字列, キーワード, 型, 属性, マクロを色付けする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:typescript-mode"
msgid ""
"Major mode for editing TypeScript code.\n"
"Comments, strings, template literals, regexps, keywords, types and names are highlighted."
msgstr ""
"TypeScript のコードを編集するメジャーモード.\n"
"コメント, 文字列, テンプレートリテラル, 正規表現, キーワード, 型, 名前を色付けする."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:lisp-interaction-mode"
msgid "Major mode for typing and evaluating Lisp forms (Scheme forms, in this editor)."
msgstr "Lisp の式 (このエディタでは Scheme の式) を入力して評価するメジャーモード."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:string-match"
msgid ""
"Return the index of the start of the first match for REGEXP in STRING, or nil.\n"
"Searching starts at START (the optional third argument).  The match data is\n"
"set, unless INHIBIT-MODIFY (the fourth argument) is non-nil."
msgstr ""
"STRING の中で REGEXP に最初に合う所の先頭の位置を返す. 無ければ nil.\n"
"探し始めるのは START (省略できる 3 つ目の引数)から.  INHIBIT-MODIFY (4 つ目の\n"
"引数)が nil でなければ, マッチデータを変えない."

#: lisp/simple.scm
msgctxt "function:string-match-p"
msgid "Like `string-match', but do not change the match data."
msgstr "`string-match' と同じだが, マッチデータを変えない."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:sort--split-lines"
msgid "Return the lines of TEXT (without their newlines).  A final newline does not start a new line."
msgstr "文字列 TEXT の行 (改行は除く) を返す. 最後の改行は, 新しい行を始めない."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:sort--join-lines"
msgid "Return LINES joined with newlines, with a final newline if FINAL-NEWLINE."
msgstr "行 LINES を改行でつないだ文字列を返す. FINAL-NEWLINE が真なら, 最後に改行を付ける."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:sort--replace-region"
msgid "Replace the text between BEG and END with TEXT, keeping point where it was."
msgstr "BEG から END の文字を TEXT に置き換える. カーソルは元の所に残す."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:sort-lines"
msgid ""
"Sort lines in region alphabetically; REVERSE non-nil means descending order.\n"
"Called from a program, there are three arguments: REVERSE, BEG and END (the region to sort)."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの行を, 文字の順に並べ替える. REVERSE が nil でなければ, 降順.\n"
"プログラムから呼ぶときは, REVERSE, BEG, END (並べ替えるリージョン) の 3 つの引数を渡す."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:reverse-region"
msgid ""
"Reverse the order of lines in a region.\n"
"From a program takes two point or marker arguments, BEG and END."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの行の順序を逆にする.\n"
"プログラムから呼ぶときは, 位置かマーカーの引数 BEG と END を渡す."

#: lisp/sort.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-duplicate-lines"
msgid ""
"Delete all but one copy of any identical lines in the region.\n"
"Optional REVERSE keeps the last copy; ADJACENT deletes only adjacent duplicates;\n"
"KEEP-BLANKS keeps blank lines.  Return the number of deleted lines."
msgstr ""
"リージョンの同じ行を 1 つだけ残して消す.\n"
"REVERSE を渡すと, 最後の行を残す. ADJACENT は, 隣り合う行だけを消す.\n"
"KEEP-BLANKS は, 空行を残す. 消した行の数を返す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "variable:noninteractive"
msgid "Non-nil means this editor is running in batch mode (--batch), without a screen or a keyboard."
msgstr "#f でなければ, このエディタはバッチモード (--batch) で動いている. 画面もキーボードも使わない."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:y-or-n-p"
msgid ""
"Ask the user a y or n question, and return #t if the answer is y.\n"
"PROMPT is followed by \"(y or n) \". y or SPC means yes, and n or DEL means no.\n"
"Other keys ask again."
msgstr ""
"y か n で答える問いを聞き, 答えが y なら #t を返す.\n"
"PROMPT の後には \"(y or n) \" を付ける. y か SPC は yes, n か DEL は no.\n"
"ほかのキーは, 聞き直す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "variable:minibuffer-default-prompt-format"
msgid "Format string used to show the default value in a prompt."
msgstr "問いに既定の値を出すときの書式."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:read-number"
msgid ""
"Read a number in the minibuffer with PROMPT, and return it.\n"
"DEFAULT (the first of ARGS) is returned for an empty input, and shown in PROMPT.  It can be a list:\n"
"its first element is that value, and M-n shows its non-#f elements.  HIST (the second) is the history.\n"
"An input that is not a number asks again."
msgstr ""
"PROMPT でミニバッファで数を聞き, それを返す.\n"
"DEFAULT (ARGS の 1 つ目) は, 空の入力のときに返し, PROMPT に出す. リストでもよい:\n"
"その最初の要素が既定の値で, M-n は #f でない要素を出す. HIST (2 つ目) は履歴.\n"
"数でない入力は, 聞き直す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:yes-or-no-p"
msgid ""
"Ask the user a yes or no question, and return #t if the answer is yes.\n"
"PROMPT is followed by \"(yes or no) \". The answer must be typed in full, and ended with RET.\n"
"Other answers ask again."
msgstr ""
"yes か no で答える問いを聞き, 答えが yes なら #t を返す.\n"
"PROMPT の後には \"(yes or no) \" を付ける. 答えは全て書き, RET で終える.\n"
"ほかの答えは, 聞き直す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:file-name-directory"
msgid ""
"Return the directory part of FILENAME, up to and including the last /.\n"
"Return #f if FILENAME has no /."
msgstr ""
"FILENAME のディレクトリの部分 (最後の / まで) を返す.\n"
"FILENAME に / が無ければ, #f を返す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:file-name-nondirectory"
msgid "Return the file name of FILENAME without its directory part."
msgstr "FILENAME から, ディレクトリの部分を除いたファイルの名前を返す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:shell-quote-argument"
msgid "Quote ARGUMENT for passing as argument to an inferior shell."
msgstr "ARGUMENT を, 下位のシェルに引数として渡せるように引用する."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:display-warning"
msgid ""
"Display a warning message in the `*Warnings*' buffer, creating it if needed.\n"
"TYPE is a symbol or a list of symbols that says what the warning is about.\n"
"MESSAGE is the text.  The optional LEVEL (a symbol: debug, warning or error) is warning by default;\n"
"a debug warning is only added to the buffer, the other levels also show it in another window."
msgstr ""
"警告のメッセージを `*Warnings*' バッファに書く (無ければ作る).\n"
"TYPE は警告の種類を表すシンボル (またはシンボルのリスト). MESSAGE は文.\n"
"省いてもよい LEVEL (debug, warning, error のシンボル)の既定は warning.\n"
"debug はバッファに書くだけで, ほかのレベルは別の窓にも出す."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:concat"
msgid "Concatenate all the argument strings and make the result a new string."
msgstr "全ての引数の文字列をつなげて, 新しい文字列にする."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:mapconcat"
msgid ""
"Apply FUNCTION to each element of SEQUENCE, and concatenate the results as strings.\n"
"In between each pair of results, stick in SEPARATOR (default: the empty string)."
msgstr ""
"SEQUENCE の各要素に FUNCTION を適用し, 結果の文字列をつなげる.\n"
"結果の間に SEPARATOR (既定は空の文字列) を入れる."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:string<"
msgid "Return #t if the first string is less than the second (compared by character code)."
msgstr "最初の文字列が 2 番目より小さければ #t を返す (文字コードで比べる)."

#: lisp/subr.scm
msgctxt "function:funcall"
msgid "Call FUNCTION with the remaining arguments."
msgstr "FUNCTION を, 残りの引数で呼ぶ."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-buffer-name-style"
msgid ""
"How to construct unique buffer names for files with the same base name.\n"
"The value can be one of: `forward', `reverse', `post-forward',\n"
"`post-forward-angle-brackets', or nil."
msgstr ""
"同じ名前のファイルのバッファに, 分けた名前を付ける形.\n"
"値は `forward', `reverse', `post-forward', `post-forward-angle-brackets', nil のどれか."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-after-kill-buffer-p"
msgid "If non-nil, rerationalize buffer names after a buffer has been killed."
msgstr "nil でなければ, バッファを消したあとに, バッファの名前を付け直す."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-ignore-buffers-re"
msgid "Regular expression matching buffer names that should not be uniquified."
msgstr "名前を分けないバッファの名前に合う正規表現."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-min-dir-content"
msgid "Minimum number of directory name components included in buffer name."
msgstr "バッファの名前に入れる, ディレクトリの名前の部分の少なくとも数."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-separator"
msgid ""
"String separator for buffer name components.\n"
"When `uniquify-buffer-name-style' is `post-forward', separates\n"
"base file name from directory part in buffer names (default \"|\").\n"
"When `uniquify-buffer-name-style' is `reverse', separates all\n"
"file name components (default \"\\\")."
msgstr ""
"バッファの名前の部分を区切る文字列.\n"
"`uniquify-buffer-name-style' が `post-forward' なら, ファイルの名前とディレクトリの部分を区切る (既定は \"|\").\n"
"`reverse' なら, ファイルの名前の全ての部分を区切る (既定は \"\\\")."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "variable:uniquify-strip-common-suffix"
msgid ""
"If non-nil, strip common directory suffixes of conflicting files.\n"
"E.g. if you open /a1/b/c/d and /a2/b/c/d, the buffer names will say\n"
"\"d|a1\" and \"d|a2\" instead of \"d|a1/b/c\" and \"d|a2/b/c\"."
msgstr ""
"nil でなければ, ぶつかるファイルのディレクトリの, 共通の後ろの部分を除く.\n"
"例えば /a1/b/c/d と /a2/b/c/d を開くと, バッファの名前は \"d|a1/b/c\" と \"d|a2/b/c\" でなく,\n"
"\"d|a1\" と \"d|a2\" になる."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--box"
msgid "Return the box of the buffer NAME: a procedure returning the buffer's current name."
msgstr "バッファ NAME の箱を返す: バッファの今の名前を返す手続き."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--renamed"
msgid "Note that the buffer OLD is now called NEW."
msgstr "バッファ OLD の名前が NEW になったことを覚える."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--forget"
msgid "Forget the buffer NAME (it was killed)."
msgstr "バッファ NAME (消した) を忘れる."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--managed"
msgid "Return the conflicting items of the buffer BOX (Emacs's buffer-local `uniquify-managed')."
msgstr "バッファの箱 BOX の, ぶつかる項目を返す (Emacs のバッファローカルな `uniquify-managed')."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--make-item"
msgid "Return an item: a procedure taking a field name (and a new value for dirname and proposed)."
msgstr "項目を返す: フィールドの名前 (と, dirname と proposed なら新しい値) を取る手続き."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--directory-file-name"
msgid "Return DIR without its trailing slash (but \"/\" stays)."
msgstr "DIR の終わりのスラッシュを除いて返す (\"/\" はそのまま)."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-buffer-file-name"
msgid "Return the directory of the file visited by BUFFER, or #f."
msgstr "BUFFER が訪れるファイルのディレクトリを返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-rationalize-file-buffer-names"
msgid ""
"Make file buffer names unique by adding segments from file name.\n"
"Arguments BASE, DIRNAME, and NEWBUF specify the new buffer that causes\n"
"this rationalization."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの名前の部分を足して, ファイルのバッファの名前を分ける.\n"
"引数 BASE, DIRNAME, NEWBUF は, 付け直しのきっかけになった新しいバッファを表す."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-get-proposed-name"
msgid "Return the name proposed for the buffer visiting BASE in DIRNAME, with DEPTH directories."
msgstr "DIRNAME の BASE を訪れるバッファに勧める名前を, DEPTH 個のディレクトリで返す."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-rename-buffer"
msgid "Rename the buffer of ITEM to NEWNAME (a unique name), without rationalizing again."
msgstr "ITEM のバッファの名前を NEWNAME (空いている名前) に変える. 付け直しは, もうしない."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-maybe-rerationalize-w/o-cb"
msgid "Re-rationalize the buffers conflicting with the current one, without it."
msgstr "今のバッファとぶつかるバッファの名前を, 今のバッファを除いて付け直す."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify-kill-buffer-function"
msgid ""
"Re-rationalize buffer names, ignoring current buffer.\n"
"For use on `kill-buffer-hook'."
msgstr ""
"今のバッファを除いて, バッファの名前を付け直す.\n"
"`kill-buffer-hook' に使う."

#: lisp/uniquify.scm
msgctxt "function:uniquify--rename-buffer-advice"
msgid "Rationalize after the current buffer was renamed from OLD to NEWNAME (UNIQUE as `rename-buffer')."
msgstr "今のバッファの名前が OLD から NEWNAME に変わったあとに, 付け直す (UNIQUE は `rename-buffer' と同じ)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--other-buffer"
msgid "Return the name of a buffer other than the current one, or #f if there is none."
msgstr "今のバッファでないバッファの名前を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:switch-to-buffer"
msgid ""
"Display buffer BUFFER-OR-NAME in the selected window.\n"
"If there is no buffer named BUFFER-OR-NAME, create one.\n"
"Interactively, read the name in the minibuffer with completion;\n"
"the default is another buffer."
msgstr ""
"バッファ BUFFER-OR-NAME を, 選んでいるウィンドウに出す.\n"
"BUFFER-OR-NAME という名前のバッファが無ければ, 作る.\n"
"対話的には, 名前をミニバッファで, 補完しながら読む.\n"
"既定は, ほかのバッファ."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--other-window-for-scrolling"
msgid "Return the window after the selected one, the one the scrolling commands act on."
msgstr "選んでいる窓の次の窓 (スクロールのコマンドが動かす窓)を返す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--call-in-window"
msgid "Call THUNK with WINDOW selected, then select the window that was selected before."
msgstr "WINDOW を選んで THUNK を呼び, 前に選んでいた窓を選び直す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--pop-to-buffer-other-window"
msgid "Show buffer NAME in another window (splitting if there is only one) and select that window."
msgstr "バッファ NAME を別の窓に出し (1 つだけなら分ける), その窓を選ぶ."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--default-buffer-name"
msgid "Return the buffer name in ARGS, or read one (default: another buffer) with PROMPT."
msgstr "ARGS にあるバッファの名前を返す. 無ければ PROMPT で読む (既定は, ほかのバッファ)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:switch-to-buffer-other-window"
msgid ""
"Select the buffer BUFFER-OR-NAME in another window.\n"
"If there is only one window, split it.  If there is no buffer named BUFFER-OR-NAME, create one."
msgstr ""
"バッファ BUFFER-OR-NAME を別の窓で選ぶ.\n"
"窓が 1 つなら分ける. BUFFER-OR-NAME のバッファが無ければ作る."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:display-buffer"
msgid ""
"Show buffer BUFFER-OR-NAME in some window, without selecting it.\n"
"If there is only one window, split it.  Interactively, read the name in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"バッファ BUFFER-OR-NAME をどれかの窓に出す. 選びはしない.\n"
"窓が 1 つなら分ける. 対話では, ミニバッファで名前を読む."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--buffer-names"
msgid "Return the names of the buffers that `next-buffer' and `previous-buffer' may show."
msgstr "`next-buffer' と `previous-buffer' が出してよいバッファの名前を返す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:next-buffer"
msgid ""
"In the selected window, switch to the next buffer in the buffer list.\n"
"With a numeric prefix argument N, switch N buffers forward."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓で, バッファの一覧の次のバッファに替える.\n"
"数の前置引数 N があれば, N 個先へ替える."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:previous-buffer"
msgid ""
"In the selected window, switch to the previous buffer in the buffer list.\n"
"With a numeric prefix argument N, switch N buffers back."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓で, バッファの一覧の前のバッファに替える.\n"
"数の前置引数 N があれば, N 個前へ替える."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:delete-windows-on"
msgid ""
"Delete all windows showing the buffer BUFFER-OR-NAME (default: the current buffer).\n"
"If it is the only window, show another buffer in it instead."
msgstr ""
"バッファ BUFFER-OR-NAME (既定は今のバッファ)を出している窓を全て消す.\n"
"それが唯一の窓なら, 代わりに別のバッファを出す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--show-buffer"
msgid "Show buffer NAME in WINDOW; if WINDOW is the selected one, make the buffer current too."
msgstr "バッファ NAME を WINDOW に出す. WINDOW が選んでいる窓なら, そのバッファを今のバッファにもする."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--kill-buffer-with-hook"
msgid "Kill the buffer NAME, running `kill-buffer-hook' in it first (unless it visits a modified file)."
msgstr "バッファ NAME を消す. 先に, そのバッファで `kill-buffer-hook' を走らせる (書き換えたファイルのバッファでなければ)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-buffer"
msgid ""
"Kill the buffer named by the argument.  Interactively, read the name in the minibuffer.\n"
"The default is the current buffer.  Ask before killing a modified file buffer.\n"
"Called from Lisp with a name, kill the buffer without asking (an error if it visits a modified file)."
msgstr ""
"引数の名前のバッファを消す. 対話的に呼ぶと, ミニバッファで名前を読む.\n"
"既定は今のバッファ. 書き換えたファイルのバッファは, 聞いてから消す.\n"
"Lisp から名前を渡して呼ぶと, 聞かずに消す (書き換えたファイルのバッファならエラー)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:kill-buffer-and-window"
msgid "Kill the current buffer and delete the selected window."
msgstr "今のバッファを消して, 選んでいる窓も消す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:quit-window"
msgid ""
"Quit the selected window and bury its buffer.\n"
"If there are other windows, delete the window; otherwise show another buffer in it.\n"
"With a prefix argument, kill the buffer instead of burying it."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓をやめて, そのバッファを後ろに回す.\n"
"別の窓があれば窓を消し, 無ければ別のバッファを出す.\n"
"前置引数があれば, 後ろに回さずバッファを消す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:scroll-other-window"
msgid ""
"Scroll next window upward ARG lines; or near full screen if no ARG.\n"
"A negative ARG scrolls downward, and `-' means a screenful downward."
msgstr ""
"次の窓を ARG 行, 上へスクロールする. ARG が無ければ, 画面の近く 1 つ分.\n"
"ARG が負なら下へスクロールする. `-' なら, 画面 1 つ分下へ."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:scroll-other-window-down"
msgid "Scroll the next window downward ARG lines; or near full screen if no ARG."
msgstr "次の窓を ARG 行, 下へスクロールする. ARG が無ければ, 画面の近く 1 つ分."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:beginning-of-buffer-other-window"
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning of the buffer in the next window.\n"
"With numeric argument N, put point N/10 of the way from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"次の窓のバッファの先頭へ, 点を動かす.\n"
"数の引数 N があれば, 先頭から N/10 の所へ置く."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:end-of-buffer-other-window"
msgid ""
"Move point to the end of the buffer in the next window.\n"
"With numeric argument N, put point N/10 of the way from the end."
msgstr ""
"次の窓のバッファの終わりへ, 点を動かす.\n"
"数の引数 N があれば, 終わりから N/10 の所へ置く."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:recenter-other-window"
msgid "Call `recenter-top-bottom' in the next window."
msgstr "次の窓で `recenter-top-bottom' を呼ぶ."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "variable:window-min-height"
msgid "The minimum total height, in lines, of any window (the mode line included)."
msgstr "窓の全体の高さ (モードラインを含む)の最小の行数."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:split-root-window-below"
msgid "Split the whole screen into two windows, one above the other; the new one is at the bottom."
msgstr "画面の全体を上下に 2 つに分ける. 新しい窓は下になる."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:split-root-window-right"
msgid "Split the whole screen into two windows side by side; the new one is at the right."
msgstr "画面の全体を左右に 2 つに分ける. 新しい窓は右になる."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:balance-windows"
msgid "Make all windows the same height and width."
msgstr "全ての窓を同じ高さと幅にする."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:enlarge-window"
msgid ""
"Make the selected window ARG lines taller (negative: shorter).\n"
"Take the lines from the neighbouring window."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓を ARG 行高くする (負なら低くする).\n"
"行は, 隣の窓から取る."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:shrink-window"
msgid "Make the selected window ARG lines shorter (negative: taller)."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を ARG 行低くする (負なら高くする)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:enlarge-window-horizontally"
msgid "Make the selected window ARG columns wider (negative: narrower)."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を ARG 桁広くする (負なら狭くする)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:shrink-window-horizontally"
msgid "Make the selected window ARG columns narrower (negative: wider)."
msgstr "選んでいる窓を ARG 桁狭くする (負なら広くする)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--buffer-lines"
msgid "Return the number of lines of text in the current buffer."
msgstr "今のバッファの本文の行数を返す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:window--fit-height"
msgid "Return the total height, in lines, that shows all the text of the current buffer."
msgstr "今のバッファの本文が全て見える, 窓の全体の高さ (行)を返す."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:shrink-window-if-larger-than-buffer"
msgid ""
"Shrink the selected window if it is taller than its buffer's text.\n"
"Do nothing if there is only one window."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓がバッファの本文より高ければ, 低くする.\n"
"窓が 1 つなら, 何もしない."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:fit-window-to-buffer"
msgid ""
"Adjust the height of the selected window to show all the text of its buffer.\n"
"Do nothing if there is only one window."
msgstr ""
"選んでいる窓の高さを, バッファの本文が全て見える高さに合わせる.\n"
"窓が 1 つなら, 何もしない."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "variable:window--line-position"
msgid "Where `move-to-window-line-top-bottom' put point last: 0 middle, 1 top, 2 bottom."
msgstr "`move-to-window-line-top-bottom' が最後に点を置いた所: 0 は真ん中, 1 は上, 2 は下."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:move-to-window-line-top-bottom"
msgid ""
"Position point relative to the window: the middle, then the top, then the bottom.\n"
"With a numeric argument N, put point at the beginning of line N of the window\n"
"(negative: counted from the bottom)."
msgstr ""
"点を窓の中の位置に動かす: 真ん中, 上, 下の順.\n"
"数の引数 N があれば, 窓の N 行目の行頭へ動かす\n"
"(負なら, 下から数える)."

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:project-tree"
msgid "Show or hide the tree of the files of the project in the side bar."
msgstr "サイドバーのプロジェクトのファイルの木を, 出すか隠す."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "variable:xref--back-stack"
msgid "List of (BUFFER-NAME MARKER) to go back to, the latest first."
msgstr "戻る先の (バッファの名前 マーカー)のリスト (新しいものが先)."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "variable:xref--forward-stack"
msgid "List of (BUFFER-NAME MARKER) to go forward to, the latest first."
msgstr "進む先の (バッファの名前 マーカー)のリスト (新しいものが先)."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "variable:xref-prompt-for-identifier"
msgid "If non-nil, `xref-find-definitions' always reads the identifier in the minibuffer."
msgstr "真なら, `xref-find-definitions' は, 必ず識別子をミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "variable:xref-project-directory"
msgid "The directory `xref-find-references' searches."
msgstr "`xref-find-references' が探すディレクトリ."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--location"
msgid "Return (BUFFER-NAME MARKER) for point."
msgstr "点の (バッファの名前 マーカー)を返す."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--push-marker-stack"
msgid "Remember the current location, for `xref-go-back'."
msgstr "今の場所を, `xref-go-back' のために覚える."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--jump"
msgid "Show the buffer of LOCATION in the selected window and put point at its marker."
msgstr "LOCATION のバッファを, 選んでいる窓に出して, 点をそのマーカーに置く."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-go-back"
msgid "Go back to the previous position in xref history."
msgstr "xref の履歴の, 前の場所へ戻る."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-go-forward"
msgid "Go to the point where we previously were, before `xref-go-back'."
msgstr "`xref-go-back' の前にいた場所へ進む."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--identifier-at-point"
msgid "Return the symbol at or next to point, or #f."
msgstr "点の所か, 隣の記号を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--read-identifier"
msgid "Read an identifier with PROMPT; the default is the symbol at point."
msgstr "識別子を PROMPT で読む. 既定は, 点の所の記号."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--identifier"
msgid "Return the identifier ARGS name, the symbol at point, or one read with PROMPT."
msgstr "ARGS が示す識別子か, 点の所の記号か, PROMPT で読んだものを返す."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--definition-regexp"
msgid "Return a regexp (for `grep') that matches the line that defines NAME."
msgstr "NAME を定義する行に合う正規表現 (`grep' 用)を返す."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--definition"
msgid "Return (FILE LINE) of the definition of NAME, or #f."
msgstr "NAME の定義の (ファイル 行)を返す. 無ければ #f."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--goto-definition"
msgid "Go to the definition of NAME, in another window if OTHER-WINDOW."
msgstr "NAME の定義へ移る. OTHER-WINDOW なら, 別の窓で."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-find-definitions"
msgid ""
"Find the definition of the identifier at point.\n"
"With a prefix argument, or if there is no identifier at point, read it in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"点の所の識別子の定義を探す.\n"
"前置引数があるか, 点の所に識別子が無ければ, ミニバッファで読む."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-find-definitions-other-window"
msgid "Like `xref-find-definitions' but switch to the other window."
msgstr "`xref-find-definitions' と同じだが, 別の窓に出す."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--project-files"
msgid "Return the files below `xref-project-directory', not those in .git, target, or node_modules."
msgstr "今のディレクトリの下のファイルを返す (.git, target, node_modules の中は除く)."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref--show"
msgid ""
"Show LINES (strings) under TITLE in the *xref* buffer, in another window; return the buffer name.\n"
"If LOCATIONS is not empty, the lines are `FILE:LINE:TEXT' and `next-error' visits them."
msgstr ""
"TITLE の下に LINES (文字列)を *xref* バッファに入れて, 別の窓に出す. バッファの名前を返す.\n"
"LOCATIONS があれば, 行は `FILE:LINE:TEXT' で, `next-error' で訪ねる."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-find-references"
msgid ""
"Find references to the identifier at point.\n"
"With a prefix argument, or if there is no identifier at point, read it in the minibuffer.\n"
"The references are listed in the *xref* buffer as FILE:LINE:TEXT."
msgstr ""
"点の所の識別子の参照を探す.\n"
"前置引数があるか, 点の所に識別子が無ければ, ミニバッファで読む.\n"
"参照は, FILE:LINE:TEXT の形で *xref* バッファに並べる."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:xref-find-apropos"
msgid ""
"Find all meaningful symbols that match PATTERN, a regexp.\n"
"They are listed in the *xref* buffer as NAME (FILE)."
msgstr ""
"正規表現 PATTERN に合う, 意味のある記号を全て探す.\n"
"*xref* バッファに, NAME (FILE) の形で並べる."

#: lisp/xref.scm
msgctxt "function:help-find-source"
msgid ""
"Switch to the source of the function whose description is shown in *Help*, in another window.\n"
"Interactively, read the function name in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"*Help* に説明を出した関数のソースへ, 別の窓で移る.\n"
"対話では, 関数の名前をミニバッファで聞く."
